window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3401,"title":"Chapter 3401 - Throwing Herself At Him (4)","paragraphs":["All the Spiritual Armament Masters were dumbstruck to hear Grandmaster Xiao’s interpretation.","“An armament refining room for each person to refine alone?”","“What kind of idea is this? I’ve taken part in so many competitions, but it’s my first time encountering this kind of situation!”","!!","“If this is the case, wouldn’t it be easy to cheat? Where is the fairness in this?”","The crowd started to talk about this and many expressed their discontent.","Grandmaster Xiao said, “Everyone, don’t worry. A special array has been set up at the entrance of each room. Although you can’t see what’s happening outside or next door, the people outside can see what you’re doing inside the room. There will be a judging panel member patrolling and surveying the entire competition process, so all of you need not worry. This move is merely implemented to prevent anyone from deliberately playing dirty tricks to interfere with the other Spiritual Armament Masters from refining armaments.”","This explanation sounded rather logical.","The Spiritual Armament Masters taking part in the competition considered the pros and cons internally and realized that this arrangement was to their advantage. So after a short moment of hesitation, they nodded their heads to express their agreement.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but rose an eyebrow, feeling extremely satisfied with Grandmaster Xiao’s method and speech.","Experience indeed was an important factor. If she was the one who announced it, she might not be able to handle it as well as Grandmaster Xiao!","After announcing the rules, those stewards who accompanied the Spiritual Armament Masters to the competition were kept outside.","Only the Spiritual Armament Masters followed Grandmaster Xiao into the rear courtyard. They were getting prepared for the start of the competition.","When both groups separated, Li Yuntao held onto Li Leyun and asked with a frown, “Leyun, what are you up to? Grandmaster Xiao was about to chase Young Miss Li away, so wasn’t that what you wanted? What are you trying to do by making her stay? Aren’t you creating trouble for yourself? Or do you feel that the situation is not as chaotic as it should be yet?”","Li Leyun shot a glance at him and snorted coldly disapprovingly.","“Uncle Hai, you need not bother about this! I had a wager with her some time ago and I thought she didn’t dare to accept it. However, I didn’t expect her to come of her own accord. This time, I must grab hold of this opportunity!”","“What? What wager?” Li Yunhai also frowned as he instinctively felt that something was wrong.","Li Leyun replied, “Don’t overthink things. Anyway, it’s a good thing! Just wait and see. After today, that little slut will leave Brother Moying on her own! You don’t need to spend any effort at all!”","“What do you mean?”","Both Divine Generals were confounded as they wanted to continue questioning her.","But Grandmaster Xiao had already discovered that Li Leyun was not following them, so he turned back and urged.","Li Leyun took this opportunity to run over, trying to catch up to the group, leaving both Divine Generals behind.","Huang Yueli originally was at the end of the group. From the corner of her eyes, she noticed Li Leyun and both Divine Generals whispering in one another’s ears.","When Li Leyun caught up with the group, the first person she saw was Huang Yueli.","Her lips curled upward and she couldn’t help but laugh. “Tsk tsk, I’ve never seen anyone as dumb as you! What are you doing here today? Don’t tell me you honestly think that you, a low rank Spiritual Armament Master, can win so many mid rank Spiritual Armament Masters here? Oh, right! You haven’t seen the Spirit Armament illustration that we will be using in today’s competition yet, right? Later when you see it in the armament refining room, you will surely have a nice surprise~”","Thinking of this, Li Leyun’s confidence soared.","Huang Yueli suddenly rushed over to register and did not have a copy of the Spirit Armament illustration beforehand. If she were to see it so abruptly, she would definitely be stunned.","Li Leyun thought, “Today’s win at this competition is too easy!”"]},{"number":3402,"title":"Chapter 3402 - Throwing Herself At Him (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli didn’t say a word, nor did she look at Li Leyun. Instead, she followed the group closely.","Li Leyun was intentionally finding trouble with her, but the other party did not fall for it. So she instantly became gloomy.","Luckily, Grandmaster Xiao quickly brought the group to the competition grounds, gave each person a number plate to represent their identity, and asked them to head to the corresponding armament refining rooms.","Huang Yueli entered the room she was allocated, and she leisurely looked around at the situation in the room.","The rooms that the Spiritual Armament Masters were assigned to were roughly the same size. Other than the criterion standardized spirit armament furnace and a box of materials, there weren’t any extra decorative items.","Huang Yueli lifted the box lid and found a Spirit Armament illustration on top of the materials.","This illustration was naturally the topic for today’s competition.","Huang Yueli was the person who drew this illustration, so no one was more familiar with the contents than her. She took a casual look and placed the illustration right back in its original spot.","After that, she began to start refining the Spirit Armament.","The competition this time was to get them to refine a set of wrist guards.","Wrist guards were a kind of armor, but it wasn’t an ordinary defensive Spirit Armament. The main use of wrist guards was to help the practitioner direct the Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in the air and increase their Profound Energy to raise their attack power.","Hence, the use of wrist guards was more inclined as a weapon.","Huang Yueli skillfully lit the fire, added the materials, guided the structural energy field, and finally shaped it as it cooled down.","The entire refining process only took a quarter of an hour or more.","Shortly after, a standardized pair of wrist guards were born. No matter if it was the exterior, endurance, or increase of the power, it had already reached premium quality.","Of course, based on Huang Yueli’s ability, it would merely take a lift of a finger to make this pair of wrist guards into deluxe quality grade.","But Huang Yueli merely wanted to stop Li Leyun from stepping into the limelight, and not create even greater trouble. Hence, she intentionally threw the game and raised the temperature slightly higher when she lit the fire to artificially create a little flaw.","The result would definitely affect the wrist guard’s quality.","But this Spirit Armament was just nice for today’s competition.","After she completed refining, Huang Yueli instantly had nothing to do and became extremely bored.","To prevent the competing Spiritual Armament Masters from playing dirty tricks on the sly, the armament refining room’s décor was so crude that not even a chair was given.","Huang Yueli looked around and finally saw a cushion in the corner. She hurriedly walked over and sat down.","The entire competition would take eight hours, but only one hour had passed.","There was no restriction for the Spiritual Armament Masters to hand in the Spirit Armaments that they had refined successfully during the entire process, but today’s test topic was so difficult that there would probably be less than ten Spiritual Armament Masters who could refine a finished product in the last quarter of the competition.","Under this situation, if Huang Yueli were to leave so early, it would surely cause a commotion.","She didn’t want that to happen so the only way was to waste the remaining time in the spirit armament refining room.","Wasting time might sound very simple, but it was honestly very rather tough to do.","Because like what Grandmaster Xiao had said earlier, this spiritual armament refining room’s entrance was set up with a special array. Outsiders could see the situation in the room from the outside."]},{"number":3403,"title":"Chapter 3403 - Throwing Herself At Him (6)","paragraphs":["Moreover, throughout the entire competition, there were judges who were high ranked Spiritual Armament Masters invigilating and making their rounds outside.","Originally, this array only allowed those from the outside to look in and the people inside could not see when someone was passing by outside.","However, such an array was not difficult for Huang Yueli.","She made a little change to make it two-ways. From the inside, she could also see the patrolling of the Spiritual Armament Master outside.","However, doing this didn’t help her much, because the crux of the problem was that in order to make herself look like a normal contestant, she could not be caught sleeping, right?","Moreover, although there were some books in her space, it was impossible to take one out to read to pass the time, otherwise, wouldn’t it be the same as cheating? This could very well possibly get herself into another round of trouble.","After contemplating for a while, she could only take out a stack of plain paper and scribble on it. While pondering on the illustrations of several intermediate-level Spiritual Armament she had recently refined, she secretly prayed that today’s competition would end soon!","However, there was still such a long time to go, how could time fly by so quickly?","Moreover, the more one wished for time to pass quickly, the more it would make one feel that the time passed was extremely long...","In the end, Huang Yueli still couldn’t hold back and very soon, she drifted off to sleep and ended up leaning her head against the wall.","It wasn’t until Grandmaster Xiao’s apprentice knocked on the door, telling her that the time for the competition was up and asked her to come out to hand in the Spirit Armament when she jolted awake.","“Oh, it’s all because of that darn Moying, hmph, I actually fell asleep while seated!” Huang Yueli rubbed her slightly red eyes, pouted her lips, and scolded him in her heart.","She often feels sleepy during the day now, mainly because... Li Moying pestered her every night, doing some indescribable double cultivation.","She also knew that the two had been separated for nearly two years after they got married, and now that they have finally reunited, Li Moying must be making up for lost time.","But, then there was still no need for him to do it...to...to such an extent!","The god-level double cultivation manual they brought from Soaring Heavens Continent was almost at the last page! The manual clearly stated that it will take at least five years to have a small success...","Only Heavens know what they have done in the past two months...","After scolding her husband in her heart, Huang Yueli jumped up, picked up the pair of wrist guards that she had thrown in the corner, and walked out of the refining room.","In the courtyard by the entrance, a lot of people have gathered and there were many Spiritual Armament Masters walking out from their refining room one after another.","Obviously, almost everyone stayed until the last moment of the competition.","Li Leyun came out a little earlier. The Spirit Armament in her hand had already been handed over to Grandmaster Xiao. She was standing in the middle of the courtyard, with her arms crossed, looking leisurely around at the crowd that started to gather. Looking at the expression on her face, she seemed very relaxed and comfortable, it was as though she had already won.","Seeing Huang Yueli walking out, Li Leyun’s eyes immediately fell on her.","“Hey, Young Miss Li, why did it take so long for you to come out? Look at you, did you spend too much spirit consciousness just now? This lady kindly advises you, refining a Spirit Armament isn’t like any ordinary competition. If you failed a few times, it just means that you can’t do it at all! No matter how long you delay for, it’s meaningless!”","Hearing Li Leyun’s taunt, the other Spiritual Armament Masters also turned to look at Huang Yueli."]},{"number":3404,"title":"Chapter 3404 - Throwing Herself At Him (7)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun and Huang Yueli...these two were now the main focus of the competition!","Before the competition started, the two of them were fighting each other. They fought so hard until the moment each of them finally entered the refining room and yet straight after each of them left the refining room, they started arguing again?","Moreover, Huang Yueli’s complexion looked really bad!","However, they did not know that it was all because she had dozed off and fell asleep accidentally but was rudely awoken up by someone in the middle of her sweet dreams.","So, her expression was still a little sullen, her gaze had a hint of confusion in there and she couldn’t fully open her eyes while her fair cheeks even had a faint pink blush on.","It was true that a stunning beauty, even if she was not in good spirits, still has her own charm.","However, it was undeniable that she does not look like she had successfully refined a Spirit Armament.","The Spiritual Armament Masters present exchanged glances with each other, and felt pity for Huang Yueli.","When Huang Yueli heard Li Leyun’s provocative words, she just raised her eyes and glanced at her, and said indifferently, “Thank you Young Miss Li for your advice, but this is all common sense. ”","“Hmph! It’s good that you know!”","Li Leyun was blocked by her and felt unhappy in her heart. However, when she thought that if she waited a moment more, she could witness Huang Yueli’s loss and win the bet to let this little tart leave her Brother Moying... with such naive thoughts...she quickly became happy again.","“Where are the wrist guards that you made? Why don’t you take it out quickly?” Li Leyun urged.","Huang Yueli walked over to Grandmaster Xiao, and took out a small wooden box from her arms.","This box was a box that Grandmaster Xiao asked his apprentice to distribute to all the contestants before the competition. It was used to hold the finished product. The lid of the wooden box could be locked.","This was for the sake of fairness in the competition. It would ensure that after the contestants’ works were sealed, they would not be at risk of being switched out by others.","However, like Li Leyun, several Spiritual Armament Masters who have refined excellent products did not lock the box.","They were eager to show the Spiritual Armament Masters present how perfect the Spirit Armament they refined was!","After all, today’s test was so difficult, and being able to refine the finished product was a very remarkable thing itself. Showing off in front of so many peers, even if one failed to get the first place and get the big business, it was sure to make a name of oneself too.","As for cheating or something...","No one would think that under the eyes of the Allied Forces Generals and Grandmaster Xiao, there were still people who would dare to act so blatantly.","Therefore, before Huang Yueli left, only those Spiritual Armament Masters who failed in the final refining and tossed only a half-finished product would close the box tightly so that no one could see the contents inside.","Huang Yueli reached out and took out her wooden box and placed it on a table in front of Grandmaster Xiao.","The lid of the box was closed, and Huang Yueli’s number was written on it – Thirty-one.","Originally, there were thirty Spiritual Armament Masters participating in the competition today, and she was the extra one with the highest number.","Grandmaster Xiao nodded, “The Spirit Armament of contestant No. 31 has been received, you can go and rest. Next—”","However, before Huang Yueli could leave, Li Leyun suddenly rushed to the front of the long table."]},{"number":3405,"title":"Chapter 3405 - Throwing Herself At Him (8)","paragraphs":["“How is the Spirit Armament that you refined? Let everyone have a look!”","Before anyone could react, she reached out to the box and lifted the lid up—","However, despite using all her strength, she failed to lift the lid of the box.","Li Leyun was stunned for a moment, however, Grandmaster Xiao had already recovered his senses.","He held down Huang Yueli’s box, glared at Li Leyun, frowned and said in a curt voice, “Young Miss Li, even if you are a proud daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you can’t ignore the rules of the competition like this! After the wooden box is closed, unless the Spiritual Armament Master is willing, otherwise no one can open it to see it! Since it’s the first time you’ve made an offense, I’ll let you go this time, but if there is a next time, don’t blame this old man for disqualifying you!”","!!","Being reprimanded by Grandmaster Xiao in front of so many people, Li Leyun felt disgruntled.","However, after hearing what Grandmaster Xiao finally said that she would be disqualified from the competition, no matter how unconvinced she was, she didn’t dare to say another word, and backed away in embarrassment.","Grandmaster Xiao glared angrily at Li Leyun. He was very dissatisfied with this young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and at the same time, he felt even more fortunate for Li Moying.","If this kind of woman really married a god-level genius, it would be a tragedy for the entire God Realm!","In the future, Li Moying will become one of the best in the God Realm. If there was such a brainless and arrogant woman who uses his prestige to cause trouble outside, how much trouble would it will cause!","But, unfortunately... Li Leyun really had a talent for refining.","Grandmaster Xiao glanced at the few finished products that came up just after opening the box lid.","Among them, the one refined by Li Leyun was obviously much better than the others!","If things continued this way, it should be the best Spirit Armament in today’s competition...","After Li Leyun withdrew, she felt depressed for a while, but she soon regained her aloof expression.","She had absolute confidence in the Spirit Armament that she had refined and was 99% confident in winning!","Just now, she was really wrong. What she originally wanted to do was to open the wooden box of Huang Yueli in front of so many Spiritual Armament Masters, and let everyone see what she made! It’s probably not even half-finished!","Losing in front of so many people, Huang Yueli’s reputation in Sky Gem Glass Chamber will plummet to rock bottom!","When the Spiritual Armament Masters of the major forces spoke about this in the grapevine, Huang Yueli would definitely be unable to lift her head in the future.","Unexpectedly, Huang Yueli locked her wooden box!","Li Leyun made her move unexpectedly but was unable to open the box!","This made Li Leyun feel that it was a pity, and she wondered how bad the things she refined was that had to be so carefully hidden.","And after these boxes were sent to the judges, the judges would no longer judge publicly, and would only give the final result.","Therefore, these contestants would no longer have the opportunity to see what other people’s finished products were like.","No matter how she wanted Huang Yueli to lose her reputation, she no longer had the chance..","“Tch... This damn girl is really lucky, hmph! However, it doesn’t matter, anyway, she’s bound to lose the bet today. After the results of the competition are announced, I can’t wait to see how she still has the cheek to rely on Brother Moying and stay by his side!”","Li Leyun glanced at Huang Yueli in admonishment, left the courtyard, walked to the front hall, and waited for the results of the competition."]},{"number":3406,"title":"Chapter 3406 - Competition results announced (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli’s expression was calm, and she turned a blind eye to all the various gazes cast by the people around her.","It was not until Grandmaster Xiao collected all the wooden boxes that she followed the crowd and left.","Huang Yueli deliberately walked at the end of the line, lowered her head and kept silent. When no one was paying attention to her, she found a corner and ran away secretly.","Huang Yueli found an empty room and hurriedly changed her clothes.","Then, after putting on her disguise, she swaggered through the gate into the courtyard and came to the room where Grandmaster Xiao was.","In the room, the five Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters who were invited to serve as judges this time have all sat together and were in a heated discussion for a while.","These five people happened to be the five Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters who were invited by Divine General Mu to review her Spirit Armament Illustrations when Huang Yueli first arrived in Medial Arch City City.","Of course, it’s not a coincidence to have invited them to this competition.","In Medial Arch City City, these five masters represent the highest level of the Sky Gem Glass Chamber in Empyrean Fox Continent, and having several of them as judges was enough to convince all the major forces participating in the competition.","However, on the faces of these five esteemed judges, there was a trace of worry.","“Grandmaster Xiao, what’s going on? Didn’t you agree that Young Master Li will be there today? Where is he now?” Grandmaster Han couldn’t help asking.","Grandmaster Xiao’s face stiffened, “Young Master Li clearly came here this morning, and even greeted me! However, when the test was about to start, he suddenly said that he had had to relief himself and excused himself and I don’t know where he had run off to after that!”","“What? You don’t know where he went? How is it possible?” Grandmaster Yuan frowned and said, “Since he mentioned that he had to relief himself, he must have gone to the washroom?”","“Do you think this old man does not know such a thing? However, I have sent people to search every room in the mansion, not to mention each and every washroom, even my daughter’s boudoir was not let off! After such a thorough search, no one has seen the shadow of Young Master Li!”","“What do you think happened? Young Master Li will be fine, right?”","The five looked at each other in dismay, and instead of reducing their doubts, they became more uneasy.","After a while, Grandmaster Han said, “What should we do? We don’t know what happened to Young Master Li, how could he just leave midway? Besides, when those Spiritual Armament Masters were refining the Spirit Armament, it’s fine if he wasn’t there! Now the results of the competition are going to be announced, and yet he is still not present!”","Grandmaster Yuan also said: “Grandmaster Xiao, what do you think we should do now? We have been dragging on for nearly an hour, and there are still so many Spiritual Armament Masters and powerful figures from major forces waiting outside. We have to give them an explanation!”","Grandmaster Wang hesitated: “But, after all, this is Young Master Li’s business. If he is not here, yet we announce the results directly, doesn’t it seem very inappropriate?”","Grandmaster Yuan nodded and said, “That’s true, but, in the current situation... Grandmaster Xiao, you have the deepest friendship with Young Master Li, and the one who has the has the highest status in the Sky Gem Glass Chamber Glazed Glass Pavilion. You have to speak with reason!”","“This... it’s not that the old man deliberately shirking, but...”","This hot potato was shoved directly into Grandmaster Xiao’s hands, but he also felt that he couldn’t take it, and hesitantly wanted to refute.","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","Grandmaster Xiao frowned and said in displeasure, “Who is it?”"]},{"number":3407,"title":"Chapter 3407 - Competition results announced (2)","paragraphs":["“Has no one taught you the rules? This is the place where this old man discusses affairs. No one is allowed to approach without permission!”","Grandmaster Xiao thought that the person who came was a servant girl in the mansion, so he immediately reprimanded.","But who knows, right after that, a familiar voice came from outside the door, “Grandmaster Xiao, aren’t you looking for me?”","The five people in the room were all shocked.","“Young Master Li!!”","!!","Grandmaster Xiao suddenly stood up, walked to the door and opened the door.","Outside the door, stood Huang Yueli, who had finished her disguise. She nodded towards Grandmaster Xiao and walked into the study.","After being stunned momentarily, the five Grandmasters came back to their senses and gathered around again.","“Young Master Li, you...you’ve finally shown up! We’ve been looking for you for a long time!”","“Yeah, is your body alright? Why did you go to the washroom and didn’t show up for so long?”","Grandmaster Xiao’s face showed a bit of obvious anger, “Young Master Li, where did you go? If you wanted to leave, why didn’t you give me a head’s up? It made me look for you everywhere. If you weren’t going to appear, we have no idea what to do!”","Knowing that she was wrong, Huang Yueli laughed wryly and explained, “This... I suddenly remembered that there is something urgent at home...”","In a hurry, she made up a reason casually.","Seeing Grandmaster Xiao’s expression full of doubts and looked as though he wanted to probe further, she quickly changed the subject, “By the way, how is the competition? I heard your voices at the door just now. It seems you’re in a hurry?”","Sure enough, when it came to serious business, Grandmaster Xiao was distracted.","“The competition is over now, and the finished products of so many Spiritual Armament Masters have been placed here, come and see, which Spirit Armament are you going to choose? It’s getting late, you have to make a decision as soon as possible! ”","He pointed to the thirty wooden boxes neatly arranged on the table, and said to Huang Yueli, “Young Master Li, hurry up and pick one!”","This time, Huang Yueli took so much effort to remove her disguise and put it on again, it was precisely for this reason.","The quality of the Spiritual Armament she refined was definitely guaranteed. She had full confidence that under the fair evaluation of Grandmaster Xiao and the rest, they would also choose the Spiritual Armament she refined as the first place.","However, Huang Yueli also had something she was worried about.","Because, before the start of the competition, Grandmaster Xiao once said in front of all the contestants that the Spiritual Armament refined by everyone today will be personally inspected by the owner of the illustration, “Young Master Li”. Cough, so... she still had to select one.","Grandmaster Xiao was a righteous man, and it was impossible to go back on his words casually.","If she was with those contestants and hadn’t come to Grandmaster Xiao to review these Spirit Armaments, maybe Grandmaster Xiao would have been procrastinating, refusing to announce the results of the competition, so she didn’t know how long it would take!","She had no choice but to quickly put on her disguise and run to the courtyard again.","Under Grandmaster Xiao’s angry gaze, Huang Yueli daringly walked to the front of the table.","Now, the lids of all wooden boxes have been opened.","The works of each Spiritual Armament Master was presented before everyone, and they could all be seen at a glance.","The situation was not much different from what Huang Yueli had guessed before. There were only less than ten people who were able to refine the finished product. The rest of the wooden boxes were filled with incomplete and defective products."]},{"number":3408,"title":"Chapter 3408 - Competition results announced (3)","paragraphs":["Out of those that seem to be relatively complete, there were three that stood out most.","The first piece, of course, was the wrist guard that Huang Yueli refined, and the quality was of course at the top .","The remaining two pieces were borderline and if compared with the one she refined, they were still inferior.","Huang Yueli’s eyes were very sharp, and after a little glance, she knew the general situation.","However, she did not express her position immediately, but turned to look at the five Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters.","!!","“Grandmasters, you must have looked at these Spiritual Armament carefully before I came back? I wonder what you think about these works? Although I am a person who draws illustrations, after all, I am still young and have little knowledge. I still have to listen to the opinions of few esteemed Grandmasters.”","The Spiritual Armament Masters valued their reputation the most, so when Huang Yueli said these words, it placated their hearts.","Immediately, several Grandmasters felt at ease, forgetting the trouble caused by Huang Yueli’s sudden disappearance earlier.","Grandmaster Xiao was the first to open his mouth and offered his opinion very sincerely: “Young Master Li, we have indeed discussed it just now. As you can see, only three of these finished products can be regarded as top quality products that can be used. In such a short span of five days, it is very rare to learn this brand-new refining method just by looking at the illustration, and to be able to successfully complete the refining. It can be said that the level of the three Spiritual Armament Masters is quite high.”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, she nodded, “What Grandmaster Xiao said is very true!”","Grandmaster Han also came over and said, “However, if you look closely at these three pairs of wrist guards, you can tell the difference. The wrist guard of contestant No. 31 is obviously better than the other two. In addition, there is not much difference between the works of contestants No. 16 and No. 18. As this is a competition, in order to ascertain the quality, we also specially tested them. ”","The two Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters have roughly explained the situation.","The remaining three Grandmasters talked a lot, and added details.","Huang Yueli nodded in her heart, these five Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters’ reputation were indeed well-deserved, and their views were exactly the same as hers.","She pretended to think for a moment before slowly saying: “Then... According to the opinion of the five seniors, the first place in this competition is the No. 31 contestant? However, I remember that only thirty Spiritual Armament Masters signed up today, how did a No. 31 suddenly appear?”","Hearing this question, the five Grandmasters looked at each other and were silent for a while.","After a while, Grandmaster Xiao sighed and said, “Young Master Li, you were away just now, so you don’t know what happened before the test.”","Grandmaster Xiao quickly recounted the dispute between Huang Yueli and Li Leyun before he said, “Because of this, another Spiritual Armament Master from the Cloudy Qilin Clan gave up the qualification, and this Lass Li will make up for it. Hence, only this No. 31 was added. However, the final product received was still thirty pieces.”","Naturally, Huang Yueli knew the situation at that time better than anyone else, so there was no need for Grandmaster Xiao to say more, anyway it was all just her own farce.","However, after listening to Grandmaster Xiao’s words, she still nodded in an exaggerated.","In fact, she almost couldn’t hold back her laughter and was trying her hardest to stifle it."]},{"number":3409,"title":"Chapter 3409 - Competition results announced (4)","paragraphs":["This was because, in the process of telling her the ins and outs of the matter, Grandmaster Xiao obviously stood by her side, completely portraying Li Leyun as a shrew.","Thinking about Li Leyun was pathetic enough.","As a proud daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she was usually adored and pampered on, so the chances of her being so disrespectful did not account for much.","However, it was extremely rare for her to show her ugly side and not to mention, out of these two times, she was caught by Grandmaster Xiao!","Others may not hate Li Leyun so much just by seeing her performance today, but when Grandmaster Xiao gave a lecture last time, he was almost disturbed by her.","Huang Yueli nodded and said, “There is actually such a thing! Fortunately, Grandmaster Xiao, you handled it properly. If I was the only one present, I don’t know what to do.”","Grandmaster Xiao was praised by her again and in a good mood, he continued: “Speaking of which, this Lass Li really performed beyond our expectations! I didn’t expect that such a delicate little girl, she actually refined such a high level of Spirit Armament! When she said she was going to participate in the competition today, I thought this little girl was just bragging, but I didn’t expect that she actually made a finished product, and it was the best of all the entries!”","“Yeah, this is really surprising!” Grandmaster Han also agreed.","Even Grandmaster Yuan said beside him: “Speaking of which, Madame Li’s talent is indeed quite good! Seeing that she is a little younger than Li Leyun, I didn’t expect that the level of refining is even higher!”","In order to cover up the fact that she was too young, Huang Yueli would dress up a little more maturely when she showed up on weekdays, so most people would think that she was about the same age as Li Moying.","When Huang Yueli heard the crowd praising her, the corners of her mouth were slightly raised, and she smiled without saying a word.","After listening to them, she said: “Those things about the Cloudy Qilin Clan are nothing to worry about, it has nothing to do with today’s competition. Judging from the quality of the Spirit Armament, the wrist guards in the No. 31 wooden box is the best. Then... we will announce the results of the competition as agreed before, and then formally negotiate with the forces behind the first place to sign a contract.”","Several Sky Gem Glass Chamber Grandmasters nodded together, “Yes, that’s how it should be!”","Huang Yueli finished her decision and looked at Grandmaster Xiao again, “Grandmaster Xiao, please announce the result of the competition for me!”","Grandmaster Xiao remembered what happened in the morning again, blowing his beard and staring at him, his face full of displeasure.","Huang Yueli hurriedly said, “Grandmaster Xiao, didn’t you tell the contestants just now that I didn’t want to show up in front of people? If I show up again at this time, wouldn’t I be smacking myself?”","When Grandmaster Xiao thought about it, it seemed that this was the truth. There was no other way but to accept this task.","The remaining four masters did not like to join in the fun, so they chose to stay in the study.","Seeing that Grandmaster Xiao was gone, Huang Yueli quickly pressed her stomach again.","“Oh, oh, no, no, no! I seem to feel uncomfortable again! Several seniors rest well, I... I’ll take one step first!”","After speaking, she hurriedly slipped away before the four Grandmasters could react!","Leaving the four Grandmasters to look at each other in dismay, they were all pondering, this Young Master Li was in such a situation so many times a day, this... he was really sick! And pretty serious as well!","If you’re sick, you have to treat it quickly!","Unfortunately, Huang Yueli ran so fast that they didn’t have time to say anything."]},{"number":3410,"title":"Chapter 3410 - Competition results announced (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli had to rush once again as she quickly removed her disguise and hurried back to the main hall.","At this point in time, the main hall was full of people, not only all the participating Spiritual Armament Masters, but also all the powers of the major forces.","This was the most important moment of the day, where the results of the competition were about to be announced. Naturally, no one wanted to miss it.","Huang Yueli took a deep breath as she opened the door stealthily and cautiously slipped in.","However, even though she had tried her best to lighten her steps, Li Leyun and the others still turned their heads and looked at her.","!!","“Oh, where have you been? Why did it take you so long to come here? I thought...you didn’t dare to come!” Li Leyun deliberately raised her voice and it attracted everyone’s attention.","Huang Yueli noticed that everyone’s eyes were on her, and she couldn’t help but frown.","However, she still walked to Li Leyun very calmly, and said indifferently: “I was just feeling a little uncomfortable, so I went for a walk. How could I not come at the important moment when the results of the competition is going to be announced?”","Li Leyun glanced at her contemptuously as she gave a mocking smile.","“Well, after refining such a bad Spirit Armament, if I were you, I would not even have the face to come here. Well, it’s rather befitting of someone so shameless, you can even still be in the mood to go for a walk, but then again, you are only human. Now that you are here, why don’t you sit down quickly? No matter what, you are are representing our Cloudy Qilin Clan, being late for such an occasion, it’s very rude!”","Huang Yue knew what Li Leyun was thinking, but she just found it funny.","It seems that Li Leyun was very sure of herself and had already presumed that she had won the competition, right?","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli felt that it she was pretty lucky.","Thank goodness she came to participate in the competition on the spur of the moment! Otherwise, if this business fell into the hands of Li Leyun, she would be really depressed!","Huang Yue thought about it in a heartbeat, and without talking to Li Leyun, she walked to the corner and sat down.","Li Leyun felt that Huang Yueli had been stepped on by her, and she was so ashamed that she was embarrassed. She couldn’t help but widen her smile.","The others present also talked a lot, and even many people forgot what they were here for and even started to blatantly gossip about Huang Yueli and Li Leyun.","At this moment, Grandmaster Xiao walked to the stage and coughed softly.","The audience immediately became quiet, and everyone looked at him expectantly.","Grandmaster Xiao did not speak much and went straight to the point: “Everyone has been waiting for a long time, just now, this old man and several judges today carefully checked each of the Spirit Armament you refined and compared them one by one. The quality of the Spiritual Armament is out of the ranking, and now, the old man will announce the results of the competition.”","“The first place in this competition is...”","Li Leyun widened her eyes and squeezed the armrests on both sides of the chair with both hands.","She had absolute confidence that the first place belonged to her!","The other Spiritual Armament Masters also secretly looked at Li Leyun, feeling all kinds of discomfort in their hearts.","Everyone had seen the finished products made by Li Leyun before, and everyone was ashamed. Although they weren’t reconciled, they had to admit that Li Leyun’s level of refinement was far superior to others!","Although she was a shrew, she was really powerful!","It’s a pity that Li Moying’s sweet little lady...","“...Number 31!”"]},{"number":3411,"title":"Chapter 3411 - Competition results announced (6)","paragraphs":["What...What number did Grandmaster Xiao just say?","It took awhile for reality to sink in and upon realising what had just happened, only then did Li Leyun jump up from the chair, looked at Grandmaster Xiao in disbelief, and asked loudly, “Grandmaster Xiao, you... did you report an error just now? What’s the name?? Number 31? This...it’s impossible!”","Grandmaster Xiao snorted, twisted his gray beard with his hand, and said in a displeased tone, “Young Miss Li, please pay attention to your wording! Although this old man is not too young, he has not yet reached the point of being confused! How could he report an error in the competition? The result? You heard right, what the old man said just now is the result of the evaluation by several judges. The first place is Madame Li, No. 31!”","Grandmaster Xiao repeated it again, this time, it couldn’t be more clear.","All who thought they had heard it wrong all came back to their senses, with shocked expressions on their faces.","“What? The first place is actually that Young Miss Li? How is that possible?”","“Did something go wrong? She’s just a junior Spiritual Armament Master!”","“Also, when everyone handed in the finished product, her box was kept closed. If she really made such a good Spirit Armament, why would she lock the box?”","“It’s hard to say. Who stipulated that if the refining level is high, the box cannot be locked?”","“Having said that, I still think this is too strange. I have also seen the pair of Wrist Guards that Li Leyun refined, and they are indeed quite perfect. How could Young Miss Li be able to refine something better than hers?” What about the finished product?”","Everyone was chatting and talking, and they couldn’t quite accept such a result.","Of course, the person who found it most unacceptable was Li Leyun.","She widened her eyes, looked at Huang Yueli, and then at Grandmaster Xiao, she couldn’t believe that such a thing would happen.","“Impossible, it’s absolutely impossible! This damned girl is just a junior Spiritual Armament Master. How can she make a better Spirit Armament than me? There must be a problem here, there must be a problem!”","Li Leyun believed that she had an outstanding talent for refining armaments, and she had been secretly tutored by people from the Allied Forces to achieve her current level.","And yet now, she was told that Huang Yueli had easily surpassed her?","Li Leyun would feel a little better if the first place was won by another Spiritual Armament Master, but now the first place actually belonged to Huang Yueli!","If that damned girl was really number one, didn’t it mean that the bet between the two of them... The winner’s Huang Yueli!","Li Leyun was flustered and became agitated.","When Grandmaster Xiao heard her accusation, he was very displeased. He hated Li Leyun at first, but at this time, he was even more ruthless in his words.","“Young Miss Li, what are you talking about? From the looks of it, it seems that you are very dissatisfied with the results of this competition? But isn’t Madame Li from your Cloudy Qilin Clan? No matter who the two of you are first, the result will be the same. It’s the same. It’s alright for other people to question the old man. What do you mean when you jump out and yell?”","Hearing Grandmaster Xiao’s words, the expressions on the faces of the two Divine Generals sitting beside Li Leyun couldn’t help changing.","Grandmaster Xiao’s words were very reasonable.","Although the result surprised both of them, they both felt happy when they thought about it. In any case, this business still belongs to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, which is the biggest gain."]},{"number":3412,"title":"Chapter 3412 - Competition results announced (7)","paragraphs":["It really didn’t matter whether the first place belonged to Li Leyun or Huang Yueli, in essence, the Cloudy Qilin Clan had absolutely nothing to lose.","Thinking of this, Li Yuntao stopped Li Leyun and persuaded: ” Young Miss Leyun, today’s judges are all Sky Gem Grandmasters with outstanding strength. They have rich experience and will not make such low-level mistakes. I am afraid the winner truly belongs to Young Miss Li. Most probably, there’s something special about the Spirit Armament that she had refined...”","Before he could finish speaking, he was interrupted curtly by Li Leyun.","“Uncle Tao, I know you said this out of family interests, but, as a Spiritual Armament Master, I won’t stand down! The fairness of the competition is more important than the result! We, the dignified ancient God Clan, have the right to know how such a thing actually happened. The victory is obviously ours, and if the result of the competition is unfair, even if we get the business, so what of it? I must ask clearly!”","Li Leyun said it aloud unceremoniously with a dignified look on her face.","When Li Yuntao heard this, his expression immediately changed.","He really never thought that she did not care about the family’s interests at all, and on top of it, she even dared to refute his words in public in such a rude manner!","According to hr words, if he didn’t do as she said, his morals will be low.","Even if Li Leyun was the niece of the Patriarch, was this the manner she should speak to a distinguished Elder in such a large clan?","It’s not that Li Leyun didn’t see Li Yuntao’s crumbled expression, but, to her, she absolutely couldn’t recognize the result of today’s competition! That was related to her and Huang Yueli, who was her way to get her out of Li Moying’s side!","Besides, even if such a bet wasn’t wagered, she absolutely could not accept the fact that she would actually lose to that damned little vixen!","Li Leyun turned her head to look at Grandmaster Xiao, this time, she didn’t care about showing any respect to a Senior, and she spoke even more rudely.","“Grandmaster Xiao, don’t gossip, it’s not that the juniors don’t believe in the fairness and fairness of several masters, but some people are secretly doing things behind their backs, and a few may not be able to find out. It’s possible. I’m not the only one who feels dissatisfied with the results of today’s competition!”","She glanced around the crowd in the hall.","Actually, quite a few people secretly nodded their heads in agreement.","A junior Spiritual Armament Master who has ascended from the lower realm was better than the genius intermediate Spiritual Armament Master who had been poured with lots of resources to cultivate and stood at the forefront of so many major forces.","This thing alone was outrageous enough!","Li Leyun looked in the direction of Huang Yueli again.","Huang Yueli sat on a mahogany chair at the edge of the hall, with an elegant and upright posture. She had on a relaxed and comfortable expression, holding a cup of hot tea in her hand, drinking it unhurriedly.","Her demeanor in drinking the tea was very elegant, and no one could tell that she had ascended from the lower realm, but instead looked like a real daughter of a great power.","Coupled with her beauty, she looked even more ethereal.","Seeing this, Li Leyun gnashed her teeth!","Only a truly stunning beauty can be like Huang Yueli, every move, every frown and smile, even if it was unintentional, she was so beautiful that people couldn’t take their eyes off her.","In terms of looks, she couldn’t even compare to a finger of Huang Yueli!","And now, this damned little vixen still won her in Spirit Armament refinement?","“Hmph, pretend, just keep on pretending! I must expose your true face today! No matter what tricks you do in secret, don’t try to escape my eyes!”"]},{"number":3413,"title":"Chapter 3413 - Competition results announced (8)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun turned to Grandmaster Xiao and continued to urge: “Grandmaster Xiao, look, there are so many colleagues who are not convinced by this result! The best way now is to take out all the finished products that everyone has refined. Let everyone present see why this little vixen can get the first place!”","As she spoke, she cast a provocative look at Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli didn’t even look at her at all, and said, “Grandmaster Xiao, since so many people have doubts about the results of the comparison competition, why don’t you just follow what Young Miss Li said and bring out the wrist guards I made for everyone. Look at it! If I have worn down the reputations of several masters because of me, I would be really sorry!”","Her voice was sweet, and when she spoke, her tone was calm, not slow or hurried.","It sounds like there is a kind of calm demeanor that only high-ranking people have.","Compared with Li Leyun, who was still yelling just now, she appeared to be several grades higher.","For a while, Li Leyun froze in place.","When Grandmaster Xiao heard Huang Yueli’s words, he immediately felt a lot more comfortable, and nodded to her: “Madame Li, you are really a good and understanding girl, no wonder Master Li likes you so much, he really is very good Eyes! Since that’s the case, then go and take out all the finished products refined by the contestants today! Go!”","Grandmaster Xiao waved his hand, and the maids retreated in response, apparently going to the backyard to get a Spirit Armament.","When Li Leyun heard Grandmaster Xiao’s words, her face turned from blue and white, extremely ugly.","She never thought that Grandmaster Xiao would actually say such a thing in front of so many powerful forces. This was obviously to support Huang Yueli! It also meant as a huge face slap to her!","What is the charm of that damned little vixen, even Grandmaster Xiao was on her side? Didn’t she just look better?","Huang Yueli swept Li Leyun’s expression out of the corner of her eyes, and couldn’t help but secretly hook her lips up.","Speaking of which, Grandmaster Xiao will support her, which was really thanks to Li Leyun!","It was precisely because Li Leyun was so aggressive and repeatedly questioned Grandmaster Xiao’s character and level, that Huang Yueli stood up and said such appropriate words for Grandmaster Xiao’s consideration, which moved Grandmaster Xiao even more.","In contrast, Grandmaster Xiao naturally felt that such a gentle lady was particularly lovely.","While waiting for the attendants to come back, the hall was noisy, and almost everyone was discussing about what happened just now.","After a quarter of an hour or so, the attendants returned with the boxes.","However, it wasn’t just the attendants who came, even Grandmaster Han and the others followed.","Grandmaster Xiao said unexpectedly: “Old Han, Old Yuan, why are you here? Don’t you mean to be too lazy to attend such an occasion?”","Grandmaster Han snorted angrily, “There are people who question our judgment and even dare to say we old men are too old and confused. How can we not come out? This old man wants to see who is talking nonsense there and slandering us!”","Grandmaster Yuan also said: “Exactly! It’s alright to say that this old man has nothing else, that we have no vision, we don’t know how to do it? It’s ridiculous! Come on, open all the wooden boxes and let everyone see who has no vision!”","When the attendants heard the order, they hurriedly took the wooden boxes out of the box, arranged them neatly one by one according to the size numbered above, and then opened the lids of the boxes.","Everyone stretched their necks and looked at the wooden boxes stacked in the center of the hall."]},{"number":3414,"title":"Chapter 3414 - Do you still remember that bet? (1)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun immediately looked at the box numbered sixteen, which contained the wrist guards she made.","The pair of delicate Wrist Guards shone under the light, and they were not ordinary at first glance.","Li Leyun suddenly became complacent, raised her chin, and looked at the surrounding contestants, wanting to see the envy of everyone.","However, when she turned around, she found that no one was looking at her at all.","The Spiritual Armament Masters were almost all gathered around, staring at a wooden box placed at the very edge, and discussing in a low voice.","!!","Li Leyun’s face changed, a little doubt arose in her heart, as she strode over haughtily.","“What are you all looking at? How can the Spirit Armament refined by the damned little vixen be so good...” She walked over to the crowd with a sneer, halfway through the sarcastic words in her mouth, and her eyes touched the wooden box No. 31 The pair of wrist guards that were placed inside suddenly became speechless.","Grandmaster Yuan was standing beside Huang Yueli’s wooden box, with his hands around his chest, he said angrily, “Where is the person? Who else hasn’t seen it? Come and take a closer look! This number 31 is the proclaimed winner today. One’s hard work, everyone will come to judge, which other Spirit Armament can be better than this one?”","The Spiritual Armament Masters all came closer and watched carefully.","At the beginning, everyone thought that what Grandmaster Yuan and others said was exaggerated, and some people were deliberately trying to find faults.","However, after seeing it, all the Spiritual Armament Masters fell silent, silently backed away without saying a word.","The major forces were originally standing far away, and they were not in a hurry to join in the fun. However, seeing their own Spiritual Armament Masters come out one by one with a sad look, they couldn’t stand anymore, and they all gathered around.","Although these people were not Spiritual Armament Masters, nor were they highly talented cultivators, but as managers in charge of the business of the major forces, their vision were not worse than that of Spiritual Armament Masters.","At a glance, many people were stunned on the spot.","Grandmaster Yuan twirled his beard and said quite contentedly: “How about it? How about this pair of Wrist Guards? Who dares to say that this is not a fine product? After testing, the improvement of the attack power of this bracer far exceeds that of other finished products!”","The facts were placed right before them as everyone exchanged glances and no one made a sound.","When Li Leyun asked Grandmaster Xiao and the others to take out all the pieces submitted for the competition, although they didn’t interrupt, they were actually a little unconvinced in their hearts and wanted to see. In their hearts, Huang Yueli was like a vase, all she had was looks. Although she was such a peerless beauty, what ability did she have to surpass everyone and win the competition?","But now, facts have proved that the judgment of the five Grandmasters were not wrong at all.","Compared with other finished products, the Spirit Armament in Box No. 31 was more than a grade higher!","Anyone with a little knowledge of Spirit Armaments knows which work would be ranked first!","For a time, everyone looked at Huang Yueli differently.","“I really didn’t expect that Madame Li is a genius in refining armaments! At such a young age, she could actually refine such a Spirit Armament!”","“It’s not easy, it’s really not easy!”","“Speaking of which, Young Master Li is really fortunate to be married to such a beautiful woman, and she is also a genius Spiritual Armament Master. What a blessing!”","“More than that, Madame Li is gentle, virtuous and knowledgeable, which is even more rare.”"]},{"number":3415,"title":"Chapter 3415 - Do you still remember that bet? (2)","paragraphs":["“Exactly, exactly!”","Although the people of the major forces were talking in hushed tones, they did not deliberately lower their voices.","When Li Leyun heard these words, her face suddenly became hot, and she felt unspeakably uncomfortable!","The speaker may be unintentional, but the listener was intentional.","Listening to these words in Li Leyun’s ears, every sentence seemed like someone was deliberately mocking her.","!!","Sentences such as “national beauty “, “genius Spiritual Armament Master” for describing Huang Yueli were heard all around. Weren’t they mocking her for not being good-looking, and her level of Spirit Armament refinement was not as high as others?","Some people even said that Huang Yueli was “gentle, virtuous and knowledgeable”, which was more like a slap in the face of Li Leyun.","There were a lot of people who secretly said she was akin to a shrew just now. In the end, it was Huang Yueli’s turn. Even though that damned little vixen said a lot of ugly things, others still thought she was gentle and kind!","This damned little vixen was young, yet so insidious and cunning!","Li Leyun was so angry that she suddenly felt a line of sight behind her, looking towards her.","When she turned around suddenly, she saw Huang Yueli standing not far away looking at her, with a faint smile on the corner of her mouth.","Beside Huang Yueli, a large number of Spiritual Armament Masters and various major forces were surrounding her, trying to get close to her, and their mouths were full of praise.","Moreover, there were many people who called Huang Yueli “Young Miss Li” before, but by this time, most of them had changed their name to “Madame Li”.","“Madame Li, I really didn’t expect you to be able to refine such a perfect Spirit Armament, and you won the first place with ease!”","“As soon as you got married to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you won such a big business for the family. It’s really amazing!”","“I am the head of Void Heart Hall, a second-class force, and I have always wanted to befriend Young Master Li. I wonder if you can help us introduce him?”","Listening to so many people, calling Huang Yueli “Madame Li” one by one, and surrounding her like a star in the middle of the moon, Li Leyun almost spit out a mouthful of old blood!","How familiar was such a scene?","When Li Leyun entered the door just now, she once boasted that she was Li Moying’s fiancée. At that time, many people from the second-class forces also surrounded her like this, eager to curry favor with her.","However, now, these people have turned to Huang Yueli’s side again!","A group of grass on the wall that sees the wind!","Li Leyun really wanted to tear all these people apart!","Of course, among so many people, the most annoying thing was Huang Yueli’s departure. The smile on her face made Li Leyun’s heart hurt.","Huang Yueli noticed Li Leyun’s sight, raised her hand, and nodded everyone around her.","“Everyone, I’m sorry, I still have something to do. Please excuse me for a while. Please take care of yourself!”","She had on a sweet smile and elegant demeanor, which made people feel like a spring breeze blew by.","Everyone all waved their hands, “Don’t dare, don’t dare, Madame Li, please...”","They took the initiative to make way for Huang Yueli to pass through the crowd smoothly.","Seeing Huang Yueli walking towards her, Li Leyun was shocked and remembered the most important thing!","Before the competition, Li Leyun specially reminded Huang Yueli about the bet between the two!","Whoever loses today’s competition will get out of Li Moying’s side and never harass him again!","Previously, Li Leyun thought she was going to win, so she specially reminded Huang Yueli."]},{"number":3416,"title":"Chapter 3416 - Do you still remember that bet? (3)","paragraphs":["But now, the result of the competition was just the exact opposite of what Li Leyun expected, and the loser became herself!","“I know great beings who own universe boat are not to be trifled with, but I am still unreconciled to the meat on the tip of my tongue. So I went forward to negotiate with the great beings in universe boat, and I even brought up my Ancient Yuan Star. Who would have thought that the other party did not care about my Ancient Yuan Star at all? He even directly asked me to get lost, and if I were to say one more word, he would kill all of us.” The sturdy old man clenched his hands tightly, in a low voice, he said, “No matter what, he is still snatching the meat from our mouths, yet he is still so overbearing, completely disregarding our Ancient Yuan Star. Of course, this makes me angry. I have been unable to swallow this anger, so naturally, I do not have the mood to continue hunting.”","“Is that so?” The silver-haired middle-aged man in the long robe nodded slightly, but then he smiled. “Why, are you not happy? Don’t tell me you want to drag out the great beings in universe boat and kill them?”","The muscular old man was stunned, but then he shook his head. “I’m not stupid. How could I dare to attack him directly? Even if I’m angry, I can only endure it.”","“It’s good that you know.” The middle-aged man in the silver-haired robe laughed, “In the universe, to be able to own a universe boat is enough to show his identity and power. Unless we have absolute confidence to figure out his true power and means, we shouldn’t provoke such a person.”","!!","“I know, but this person has been hiding in universe boat and hasn’t shown himself. There are arrays on universe boat that block my soul probing, so I can’t find out his true power, so I don’t dare to act Rashly. However, the more this is the case, the more unwilling I am to accept it. If the other party is really a powerful great being, and he shows himself, or shows a little godly power or aura, and it really scares me, then it’s fine for me to be reprimanded by him, but what if the person in universe boat isn’t a great being, and he’s just using universe boat to put on airs? Then I’ll become a joke,” said the sturdy old man.","In the universe, there were many people who relied on universe boat to put on airs.","Everyone knew that those who could own universe boat were all extraordinary, so naturally, very few people dared to provoke them.","However, the universe was so big that there were some weaker people who had obtained universe boat by chance.","In the Purple Micro Star Field alone, it had happened several times that the other party rode universe boat, but his own power was very ordinary. There was even a Principles Master who rode universe boat.","“Old man, do you think the person I met this time is a real great being, or is he just putting on an act with the help of universe boat?” Asked the muscular old man.","“I don’t know.” The silver-haired middle-aged man shook his head. “It’s hard to get a universe boat,” said the middle-aged man, “there’s no doubt about that. Under normal circumstances, those who own a universe boat must be real great beings or people with a big background. Of course, there are also some people who are lucky enough to get such a universe boat. However, such situations are rare. However, from what you just said, the other party didn’t show up at all. He didn’t even show his godly power or aura. That’s strange.”","“You think it’s strange too?” The muscular old man’s eyes lit up.","“A little, but I can’t be sure.” The silver-haired middle-aged man’s voice was calm, but his gaze suddenly turned toward the muscular old man. “Thirteen, if you’re really unhappy and feel aggrieved, and you can’t take this lying down, you can try to probe that universe boat, but don’t show yourself. Just send your subordinates to probe it, or use some other method to figure out the level of power of the great beings in the universe boat. Then you can decide whether to make a move or not.”","“Haha!” The old man laughed, “I’ve been waiting for you to say that. To tell you the truth, I’ve been planning to do that for a long time. However, I don’t need my men to test it out. I just need to wait quietly. I’ve known for a long time that the couple saved by the great beings in universe boat are going to wing fire star field. When my men fought with this couple, they used some special methods to sense their location.”","With this happening, this wager became Li Leyun’s restriction.","She never thought that she would lose, and she never thought that she would give up her identity as Li Moying’s fiancée!","From Li Leyun’s point of view, even if she was embarrassed here today, as the beloved daughter of the esteemed Cloudy Qilin Clan, her identity and talent was apparent afterall and had never considered that her position was shakable.","Even if that damned little vixen was in the limelight today and showed off her amazing talent in refining, so what?","Unless Li Moying could fight against the whole clan otherwise, that damned little vixen should not try to climb on her head!","However, the premise of Li Leyun’s justification was that there was no such bet...","If other people knew that she had made such a bet with the damned little vixen, how could she still have the face to call herself Li Moying’s fiancee?","Li Leyun immediately made up her mind that she would definitely deny it to the end!","So, when Huang Yueli walked in front of her, Li Leyun called out before she could speak.","“Grandmaster Xiao, I want to report this Young Miss Li!”","With this sudden remark, even Huang Yueli was startled.","After hearing Li Leyun’s words clearly, Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows and stopped, she wanted to listen, what else this Li Leyun was up to.","Naturally, other people in the hall heard Li Leyun’s words and turned to look over together.","Grandmaster Xiao frowned, “Young Miss Li, what’s the problem with you? Now, the old man has already taken out all the Spirit Armaments, and everyone can see that the wrist guards you made are indeed inferior to that of Madame Li. So, what else do you have to say?”","Li Leyun gritted her teeth and said, “Judging from the Spirit Armaments presented here, the Wrist Guards in the No. 31 wooden box are indeed much better than the ones I made. I have to admit this, but... Who can guarantee that the Spirit Armament in this box is indeed made by Young Miss Li herself?”","Grandmaster Xiao was stunned for a moment, and then his brows furrowed even deeper.","“Young Miss Li, what do you mean by that? Please clarify!”","Li Leyun said: “I suspect... Young Miss Li’s Spirit Armament in the box was not made by herself at all, but she got it from somewhere and hid it in an interspatial ring!”","“What?? Is there such a thing?”","“Isn’t that impossible? When we entered the arena, Grandmaster Xiao personally inspected our interspatial rings.”","“Besides, while refining the Spirit Armaments, there are so many Spiritual Armament Masters patrolling, who can cheat at such a time?”","Li Leyun’s words aroused everyone’s discussion.","However, most people do not think that Huang Yueli had the possibility of cheating.","Grandmaster Xiao was of course even more unconvinced, he sneered coldly, “Are you questioning the fairness of the competition organized by this old man? When this old man checked your interspatial ring, everyone was watching from the side, even if the old man wanted to open the back door, It can’t be done at all!”","Li Leyun shook her head and said, “I’m not questioning you, but when I left the courtyard just now, I heard something very suspicious!”","“What?” Grandmaster Xiao asked with a frown.","Li Leyun did not speak in a hurry, but glanced at Huang Yueli triumphantly.","This time, even Huang Yueli was a little puzzled."]},{"number":3417,"title":"Chapter 3417 - Do you still remember that bet?","paragraphs":["She couldn’t figure out what the hell Li Leyun was up to.","Li Leyun spoke in a dramatic manner, raising her voice: “It’s like this, when I came out of the courtyard just now, I happened to see two of Grandmaster Xiao’s named disciples at the door. They should be in charge of patrolling, so they’ve been talking about the competition. However, I heard from them that during the competition today, there was a Spiritual Armament Master who had been sleeping and didn’t seem to take the competition to heart at all.”","Hearing Li Leyun’s words, Huang Yueli’s eyes widened.","This... this clearly meant her!","Sure enough, Li Leyun said with a mysterious smile: “Aren’t you curious, who would fall asleep in the middle of such an important competition? I also found it very strange, so I stopped and listened carefully, and I heard it that this Spiritual Armament Master was in the refining room number 31!”","By now, everyone knows that that was Huang Yueli’s number.","As soon as Li Leyun finished speaking, hundreds of eyes focused on Huang Yueli.","Grandmaster Xiao’s expression changed, and he said, “Young Miss Li, you can’t spout such nonsense!”","Li Leyun said: “How could I? The people who are in charge of patrolling the competition today are all Grandmaster Xiao’s disciples and servants, right? If you don’t believe me, you can gather these people. I still remember what those two looked like. Well, Grandmaster Xiao just needs toask them and would know whether what I said was true or false.”","Li Leyun’s words sounded very confident, and it didn’t sound like a lie at all.","For a while, everyone present all looked at each other, their faces full of surprise.","Originally, everyone had already accepted the results of the competition and admitted that Huang Yueli was the worthy of the first place.","Unexpectedly, such a turning point suddenly appeared.","Everyone was a little dazed. Seeing how Li Leyun said so confidently, could it be that there was really such a thing?","If Huang Yueli slept during the entire competition, then she definitely didn’t have time to refine a finished product, let alone such an excellent product!","In this case, can’t it be inferred that there is something wrong with the Spirit Armament she handed over?","Everyone’s gazes went back and forth on the faces of Huang Yueli and Li Leyun, looking over and over, not knowing whose side to stand on.","If it’s just from selfishness, everyone thinks Huang Yueli is more like a good person, but Li Leyun said so calmly that there were witnesses... this wasn’t something random, right?","Grandmaster Xiao was also confused. He looked at Huang Yueli with obvious doubts in his tone.","“Madame Li, what’s going on here? Is what Young Miss Li said true? You really fell asleep in the middle of the competition? Then the Spirit Armament...”","At this time, Huang Yue was also deeply annoyed.","She knew that she shouldn’t have fallen asleep just now! It’s all Li Moying’s fault!","She hadn’t forgotten to throw the blame in her heart, so she scolded her husband in her heart.","Of course, on the surface, she was still smiling and calm.","“Grandmaster Xiao, I can’t refute what Young Miss Li said. It’s true...”","“What?? Is this true??”","“Madame Li actually admitted it??”","Someone couldn’t help but exclaimed in surprise.","Grandmaster Xiao’s face darkened, “Madame Li, are you admitting that you cheated in the competition?”"]},{"number":3418,"title":"Chapter 3418 - Do you still remember that bet? (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli smiled and shook her head slightly, “Grandmaster Xiao, when did I say such a thing?”","Grandmaster Xiao was at a loss, “Then... you are...”","Huang Yueli looked at Li Leyun, and said indifferently, “Since Young Miss Li said she has witnesses, let them come over.”","Hearing this, everyone present were all stunned.","Everyone speculated that Huang Yueli’s reaction, whether she admitted or denied it, was not surprising, but no one expected that she would say such a sentence.","She actually asked Li Leyun to find the witnesses?","What was happening? Or, she didn’t believe that Li Leyun could find a witness at all?","Li Leyun snorted coldly, “You don’t shed tears without seeing the coffin? Well, please ask Grandmaster Xiao to let out the disciples who are in charge of patrolling Young Miss Li’s area today? Whether it’s true or not, you’ll know when you ask.”","Li Leyun’s words were also very confident, because she didn’t make this story up, she had really heard it!","No matter what the hell Huang Yueli was up to, Li Leyun was sure that the testimony of the witnesses would definitely benefit her!","Seeing this, Grandmaster Xiao frowned, raised his hand and motioned for them to be summoned.","In the hall, everyone was buzzing around in excitement as countless puzzled gazes fell on the two women, all trying to guess the truth of this matter.","It was rare for such an open and fair competition to have such twists and turns when the results had already been announced, yet new doubts kept arising and a conclusion had still not been made. Although the people present were all people with reputation, they couldn’t help but gossip.","Only Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai, whose faces were as black as the bottom of a pot, sat in the corner all the time, never making a sound, just staring gloomily at the two standing in the middle of the hall.","Among so many people on the scene, there was nothing more embarrassing than the two of them.","Because, in front of Grandmaster Xiao, for the sake of a first-place ranking, the two Spiritual Armament Masters who were fighting tit-for-tat were both members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Originally, the first and second places were both Spiritual Armament Masters of his own clan. This was a very good thing, which represented the strength of the clan and could shock other ancient God Clans.","Moreover, it could also let Grandmaster Xiao and the others see that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was absolutely capable of doing this business.","But what about now? After the battle between Li Leyun and Huang Yueli, all their reputation would be gone! Even the Cloudy Qilin Clan has become a big joke in the entire Medial Arch City!","Couldn’t they see that there were so many forces around that were all holding back their laughter now? Some people couldn’t hold back and even laughed out loud!","It was supposed to be a good thing, how did it become so...","The more they thought about it, the more uncomfortable they felt.","In addition, the dissatisfaction with Li Leyun became stronger.","After all, Grandmaster Xiao had already made a conclusion just now. Seeing that this business would also belong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Leyun suddenly jumped out again, and she was still confused!","In the current situation, no matter who turns out to be false in the end, it will damage the face of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","After a while, two young Spiritual Armament Masters entered the venue.","As soon as the two entered the door, Li Leyun’s eyes lit up and she stood up and said, “That’s right, I just saw the two of them!”","The two Spiritual Armament Masters walked up to Grandmaster Xiao and bowed to salute him."]},{"number":3419,"title":"Chapter 3419 - Do you still remember that bet? (6)","paragraphs":["“Master, may we know why you have asked us to come here? What are your orders?”","Both looked puzzled and were a little scared.","The people that were currently in the hall were all the big figures of the major forces. They had never seen such a big occasion before as they were still young Spiritual Armament Masters.","Grandmaster Xiao nodded and said, “The old man summoned you, as I really want to ask you something... Just now, I heard that Young Miss Li mention that you were discussing something in the backyard today, and that when you were patrolling the area, you saw someone in the refining room that was sleeping inside? Is this true?”","The two Spiritual Armament Masters were startled and looked a little ashamed.","“Master, this disciple didn’t expect someone to eavesdrop at the side. It wasn’t intentional to talk nonsense everywhere...”","“Master, please forgive me, this disciple will definitely stop talking nonsense in the future.”","Both of them were very apprehensive, because when Grandmaster Xiao accepted them as disciples, he had repeatedly emphasized for them to be tight lipped once they had acknowledged him as their Master. After all, the refining techniques of the Spiritual Armament Masters were top secret.","When the two of them finished their rounds, they thought that no one was around hence they were chatting casually, but they were actually heard by outsiders, which was a mistake in itself.","Grandmaster Xiao was also not very happy, but this was not the time to pursue such responsibility.","He waved his hand and said, “Don’t talk about it for now. The old man is now asking you, is it true? Wasthere really someone who have been sleeping in the room without refining weapons properly?”","“This...” Both of them hesitated and looked at each other.","Grandmaster Xiao frowned and said sternly: “What’s going on? Why are you talking hesitantly? Just say what you have to say! This matter is very important, you must ensure that every word you say is true, but if there is a lie, old man I’ll kick you out!”","After hearing these words, the two Spiritual Armament Masters did not dare to tarry any further, and said quickly: “Master, at that time, the disciples were patrolling the easternmost area. Among them, the Spiritual Armament Master in the Number 31 refining room, did fall asleep during the competition, but...”","The word “but” was only half uttered, and Li Leyun couldn’t hold back her excitement and interrupted them.","“Did you hear it? Did everyone hear it? What I said just now is true, right? Young Miss Li really fell asleep during the competition, and she wasn’t refining Spirit Armament at all! These two are Grandmaster Xiao’s disciples, their testimony will definitely not be false. Therefore, there must be something wrong with Young Miss Li’s Spirit Armament!”","In fact, there is no need for Li Leyun to emphasize that, those present have already started a ruckus.","The words of the two young Spiritual Armament Masters perfectly corroborated Li Leyun’s accusation just now.","Everyone’s gazes that were on Huang Yueli suddenly changed!","In such a competition, she was actually cheating in such an open manner! This was much more shameful than a shrew scolding in the street!","“I thought that Young Master Li married this great beauty, and he has good eyesight, but who knows, she is not as good as that arrogant Young Miss Li!”","“Isn’t it? I was almost deceived by her just now! I thought she was really some kind of genius Spiritual Armament Master!”","“Tsk tsk, it’s so lively now, I didn’t expect it to be like this. I really feel sorry for Young Master Li, why are all the women who are related to him so superb?”","“It’s a coincidence to meet one of the best, but if you meet two of the best, you can’t say it’s bad luck, right? I don’t think Li Moying himself is a good person!”"]},{"number":3420,"title":"Chapter 3420 - Do you still remember that bet? (7)","paragraphs":["Hearing these vague discussions around her, Huang Yueli felt displeased, as a cold glint flashed across her eyes.","It didn’t matter if others scolded her, but Li Moying was scolded because of her, which was exactly what she could not tolerate!","However, the expression on her face did not change, she just calmly looked at Li Leyun who was standing in the centre of the hall with the corners of her mouth turned upward into a mocking smile.","When Li Leyun turned her head, she thought she could see Huang Yueli panicking and kneeling down to beg for mercy, but in the end, this damn girl was still so calm and calm!","Li Leyun sneered: “What are you still laughing at? Now that the evidence is solid, don’t hurry up and tell the truth, how on earth did you cheat? Where did you hide the Spirit Armament and bring it into the refining room! Brother Moyingis actually with you. Having been with such a woman, I really feel unworthy for him!”","Huang Yueli ignored her and turned her attention to Grandmaster Xiao.","“Grandmaster Xiao, do you also believe in such nonsense?”","Grandmaster Xiao’s face was ugly, “Madame Li, it’s not that the old man doesn’t believe you, but the two disciples of the old man are honest people and won’t lie. They have already said so, and this old man will definitely choose to believe them! So, how are you going to explain yourself?”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “What I’m explaining now seems to be useless...”","“Now that you know, why do you still have the face to stay here?” Li Leyun interjected gloatingly.","However, Huang Yueli once again ignored her and continued talking on her own.","“However, I don’t need to explain this matter myself. I just heard what the two young masters said, and it seems that Young Miss Li interrupted them before they finished speaking. Now, I don’t know if Grandmaster Xiao can give them two another opportunity to speak and, let them speak clearly? When the time comes, the truth will naturally come out!”","The noisy hall suddenly became quiet, and everyone looked at Huang Yueli with surprise. They didn’t expect her to say that.","For a moment there, no one couldfigure out what she meant.","Grandmaster Xiao frowned and looked at his two named disciples, “Have you two finished talking? What do you mean? If you still have something to say, then say it now!”","The two young Spiritual Armament Masterswere at a loss, not knowing why they came here.","However, to be able to become Grandmaster Xiaos disciples, both of them were actually very clever.","Hearing the conversation between Li Leyun and Huang Yueli, as well as other people’s comments, they also roughly guessed what the situation was and why Grandmaster Xiao asked them about the situation during the competition.","After they understood the truth, they did not dare to neglect, they quickly stepped forward and said, “Master, it’s like this, just now, Young Miss Li in room 31 really slept for a while, but it wasn’t because she didn’t refine the armament properly and fell asleep. Then...that’s not true!”","“Yes, my senior brother and I have been paying attention to Young Miss Li’s refining room, because her refining technique is really fast, even more proficient than the two of us who have practiced for a month! Moreover, her refining speed is extremely fast. They are quick, accurate and smooth... Anyway, we all stared at her at first and almost forgot we were patrolling!”","“About half an hour later, Young Miss Li put out the fire and took out the Spirit Armamentfrom the inside! We were startled by this speed. Not only did she refine the finished product in one go, even the refined product is amazing!”"]},{"number":3421,"title":"Chapter 3421 - Do You Still Remember the Bet? (8)","paragraphs":["“That’s right, that was amazing! We were all shocked silly and we planned to wait for Lady Li to refine again to see how she managed such a feat. As a result, after we waited and waited, we saw that after she finished refining, she went to the corner and after a while, she actually fell asleep!”","The two of them chattered excitedly, finishing each other sentences, and quickly revealed the situation at that time.","They had planned to explain from the beginning, but they were rudely interrupted by Li Leyun who suddenly appeared. Moreover, they were still in a state of confusion at that time and they didn’t know what they were here for. They didn’t dare to speak any nonsense, so, when interrupted, they immediately clammed up.","Now, with no one bothering them, they quickly told everyone what they saw.","Listening to the explanations of the two, the expressions on the faces of everyone present became more and more astonished, and many people’s eyes almost popped out!","They thought that Huang Yueli was able to refine such a perfect product only after several attempts that she finally succeeded!","Even if she took several times to refine it, it was still very, very rare that she could produce such a fine piece!","But who would have thought that she only refined it once? And, it only took half an hour?","After the two young Spiritual Armament Masters finished speaking, they both looked at Huang Yueli with admiration.","“This Lass Li is really amazing. At first, I only looked at her a few more times because she was good-looking. I didn’t expect that she’s such an amazing genius!”","“Yes, seeing Lady Li’s artifact refining today was really eye-opening. As soon as we were excited, we couldn’t help but discuss a few words at the gate of the courtyard...”","Speaking of which, everyone understood.","After all, this was actually a misunderstanding!","Li Leyun only heard half of what the two Spiritual Armament Masters said, so she made up a lot of it in her own mind, and used it as evidence to accuse Huang Yueli!","However, the truth of the matter was completely different from what everyone imagined!","No wonder Huang Yueli didn’t panic when she heard Li Leyun’s accusation, but laughed instead.","Because people had this confidence!","The hall became noisy again, but this time, when everyone was talking about Huang Yueli, they praised her to the skies!","Such an amazing armament refining genius was rare in the entire God Realm!","When Li Leyun heard the words of the two Spiritual Armament Masters, her complexion changed abruptly.","When everyone praised Huang Yueli, they naturally wouldn’t forget to step on Li Leyun and talk about her as a joke.","It was really funny that she swore that Huang Yueli was cheating.","Moreover, she accused Huang Yueli twice, and both times she was beaten so badly in the face!","Li Leyun became more and more angry, and she couldn’t accept this fact at all.","She was quite sure just now, thinking that she could step Huang Yueli into the mud all at once, but in a blink of an eye, Huang Yueli turned over completely!","Oh, not just turning over.","Due to the words of the two Spiritual Armament Masters, Huang Yueli’s armament refining talent has been raised to a new level! Her refining level was even more amazing!","And this was all thanks to Li Leyun!","She tried so hard, but she ended up lifting a rock and smashing herself in the foot!","“No...impossible! This can’t be true! Grandmaster Xiao, are you sure that these two witnesses are telling the truth? Maybe they were bought off by someone!”"]},{"number":3422,"title":"Chapter 3422 - Do You Still Remember That bet? (9)","paragraphs":["No matter what, Li Leyun refused to admit defeat.","“She’s just a junior Spiritual Armament Master who has refined a Spirit Armament in half an hour. Tell me, do you believe it? It’s simply treating people as fools! There is obviously a problem here! Don’t be fooled by others. This is absolutely impossible for it to be true!”","Hearing this, many who were watching were stunned for a moment.","Actually, what Li Leyun said was not without reason.","The refining talent that Huang Yueli showed was really too abnormal.","When Grandmaster Xiao’s two disciples heard this, they were so angry that they almost jumped up on the spot!","“Young Miss Li, what do you mean? Are you saying that the two of us lied? We absolutely dare not make a false statement in front of Master!”","“Young Miss Li, you are the daughter of the dignified Ancient God Clan, how can you slander us like this? I can guarantee that everything we said just now is true! Lady Li has such strength, the facts are in front of you, it is useless if you don’t believe it! ”","“That’s right, the wise man knows he knows nothing, the fool thinks he knows all! We have a clear conscience!”","After the two took turns to scold Li Leyun, they both turned to Grandmaster Xiao.","Grandmaster Xiao frowned slightly. In any case, he was more familiar with his two named disciples, and he was more inclined to believe their words.","Besides, Li Leyun didn’t even have any evidence and she just casually said that his apprentice lied. No Master would like to hear such words. Even if he had some doubts about his disciple’s words, he would not just stand by and do nothing. He did not hesitate and chose to stand on their side.","Grandmaster Xiao said in a deep voice: “Young Miss Li, these two disciples of mine have been diligent ever since they followed this old man, and have never done anything inappropriate. Besides, before today’s competition, they didn’t know Lady Li at all, so how could they help? What about her cheating? Are you saying that to imply that the old man is not strict?”","Seeing Grandmaster Xiao’s gloomy face, Li Leyun suddenly reacted and realized that she had said the wrong thing.","However, it was too late to regret it now, she had offended everyone!","Li Leyun’s face turned blue and white, and she was extremely embarrassed.","However, she also knew that since things have come to this point, she wanted to insist that Huang Yueli was cheating. If she can’t completely knock Huang Yueli out and can’t turn over, then the one who can’t turn over would be herself!","However, before Li Leyun could speak again, Huang Yueli, who had been silent all the time, suddenly spoke.","“Young Miss Li, you are really interesting. When these two Spiritual Armament Masters said that I was dozing off in the refining room, because the testimony was in your favor, you insisted that they could not lie. Didn’t you say it? Everyone heard it!”","“However, now that they have made it clear, they have proved my innocence, and the testimony is now in my favor, you immediately changed your words and said that what they said was a lie! Isn’t this correction too fast? Are you as forgetful at such a young age?”","As soon as these words came out, there were a few chuckles around.","When Huang Yueli mentioned this, the others also remembered it. Li Leyun offered to look for these two witnesses just now. Moreover, at that time, she even complimented Grandmaster Xiao, saying that his disciple were credible!","Now she suddenly turned her face, and in contrast to the two, what she just said was like hitting herself in the face."]},{"number":3423,"title":"Chapter 3423 - Do You Still Remember that Bet?(10)","paragraphs":["“Yeah, Young Miss Li, what you said before and what you just said are completely opposite! Which one do you mean?”","“Tsk tsk, today I can learn what it means to let one’s tongue run away with him! Things that are good for you are true, otherwise they are false! Do you still have a basic conscience?”","“In such a short span of time, you don’t recognize what you yourself just said! Young Miss Li’s mannerism is really an eye-opener!”","Everyone connected the cause and effect of the incident and thought about it carefully. How could they not understand?","In particular, compared to Li Leyun’s self-contradiction, Huang Yueli had always been calm and never tried to influence the testimony of the two Spiritual Armament Masters.","When the situation was unfavorable to her, she didn’t say no to the two of them, she just asked them to describe the situation completely.","Why was that? It was because she has the bottom line in her heart and knows that she was innocent, and she would be able to prove her innocence sooner or later!","Thinking of this, everyone stood on Huang Yueli’s side.","Grandmaster Xiao’s patience had reached the limit and he has long been impatient with Li Leyun’s entanglement.","With a wave of his hand, he said angrily: “What else needs to be verified in this matter? This old man’s disciple will never lie! Now the results have been confirmed, Madame Li’s level of refining is indeed amazing, and she is the person who deserves the first place!”","Grandmaster Xiao paused, then turned his eyes to Li Leyun, “As for Young Miss Li... I haven’t seen a woman like you for so many years! Your skills are not as good as others, and you still refuse to admit it? You even have time to accuse others as cheating. Why don’t you spend some time practicing your own skills? Otherwise, you will never be able to match even a finger of Madame Li’s!”","Grandmaster Xiao was very angry at what had unfolded today, and he didn’t hold anything back as he berated her mercilessly.","Li Leyun’s face was extremely pale, her hands were clenched into fists, and she didn’t even dare to lift her head!","When things have developed to such a point even if she refused to accept this fact, she could not find any other reason to refute it.","Seeing this, Li Yuntao quickly stood up and said to Grandmaster Xiao, “Grandmaster Xiao, don’t be angry! Young Miss Leyun didn’t do it on purpose. She also overheard the conversation between the two little masters by accident, and she didn’t listen to it all before. This misunderstanding was caused by impulse, and this is also an unintentional fault, please understand Grandmaster Xiao.”","When Li Yunhai heard what his brother said, he also followed suit.","“Grandmaster Xiao, it’s all a misunderstanding, a misunderstanding! Young people are ignorant, we apologize to you for her!”","Grandmaster Xiao was originally in a fit of rage, and planned to kick Li Leyun out and even planned to give her some punishment.","However, now that Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai suddenly came out to plead for mercy, it would be hard for him to get angry.","No matter what, these two were six-star Divine Generals, masters of the Dao Profound Realm, and they are quite well-known figures in the Allied Army, and even in the entire God Realm.","Although Grandmaster Sky Gem Glass Chamber has a high status and is sought after by major forces, it is still very irrational to offend the two six-star generals.","Moreover, it was not worth it for the sake of a mere little girl like Li Leyun to offend two such people.","Grandmaster Xiao took a deep breath and calmed down a bit.","“Alright, originally, this old man planned to report to the Sky Gem Glass Chamber’s headquarters to give this little girl some punishment.”"]},{"number":3424,"title":"Chapter 3424 - Do You Still Remember that bet? (11)","paragraphs":["“Now, since the two Divine Generals have said so, this old man can’t help but give face...” Grandmaster Xiao was still a little angry, was holding on to his beard that was raised up in anger, “This is the end of today’s affairs. However, Young Miss Li Leyun, please do not think about stepping into any Sky Gem Glass Chamber in our Empyrean Fox Continent!”","Hearing Grandmaster Xiao’s words, Li Leyun was frightened.","If it hadn’t been for Li Yuntao and the others to intercede for her, and if Grandmaster Xiao really reported today’s matter to the Sky Gem Glass Chamber headquarters, then she would be out of luck.","Spiritual Armament Masters who have a criminal record at the headquarters will be treated differently. Many Spiritual Armament Masters cannot enjoy the privileges, and they cannot even participate in such competitions as today.","Now, Grandmaster Xiao had actually blacklisted Li Leyun Sky Gem Glass Chamber in the Empyrean Fox Continent. Of course, the consequences were quite serious, but it was better than being officially recorded by the headquarters.","Li Yuntao looked at Li Leyun’s pale face and glared at her, “Aren’t you going to step back?!”","Li Leyun took two steps back, suddenly stopped, and found someone standing behind her.","She was startled, and when she looked back, she found that Huang Yueli had come over at some point, and had been looking at her ashamed.","Li Leyun bit her lower lip so hard that it almost bled.","She knew that she could never cause trouble again at this time, she tried her best to hold back her anger, and wanted to walk past Huang Yueli.","However, seeing her step to the side, Huang Yueli also took a small step to the side, just blocking her way.","Li Leyun suddenly raised her head, “You... what do you want to do? Now that you are complacent, what else do you want?”","As soon as she opened her mouth, she found that her voice began to tremble.","Huang Yueli slowly raised the corners of her mouth and said, “Young Miss Li, are you leaving now? If I remember correctly, before the competition started today, Young Miss Li specially reminded me not to forget a certain bet. Hmm, have you forgotten it?”","Hearing this, Li Leyun’s face immediately became even more pale.","This was what she was really afraid of. What she was most afraid of was Huang Yueli bringing up this bet!","After Huang Yueli was proclaimed the winner, the biggest reason why Li Leyun had been entangled in this matter again and again, and even turned into a tangled mess and made a big fool, was simply because of this bet!","Originally, she didn’t mention Huang Yueli, but thought she had forgotten, and kept praying in her heart, hoping that Huang Yueli would never suddenly think of it!","As long as she doesn’t speak out on the occasion of so many people, and she refused to admit it afterwards, who else can Huang Yueli turn to? This was something only the two of them knew.","But who knows, she was just one step away!","Just a little bit, Li Leyun was about to leave the room, but at this juncture, Huang Yueli took out the bet and talked about it.","She didn’t say it sooner or later and had to be at this point in time!","Li Leyun almost fainted on the spot!","She glared at Huang Yueli angrily, “What bet? I don’t know what you’re talking about? Get out of the way, I’m leaving!”","Huang Yueli smiled and didn’t take her anger seriously at all, “Young Miss Li, is this... a noble person forgetting things? Do you need me to remind you?”","“What reminder? Reminder for what? You...you did win me this time and became the first place, but don’t go too far! You are talking nonsense here!”"]},{"number":3425,"title":"Chapter 3425 - One must always honor a bet (1)","paragraphs":["Using a little strength, Li Leyun swiftly tried to go past Huang Yueli and even tried to suppress Huang Yueli briefly with her aura.","As long as Huang Yueli was shocked for a while, she could quickly slip away.","So, as soon as Li Leyun finished speaking, she turned around and went around Huang Yueli.","But who knows, Huang Yueli casually took a step and blocked her again.","“You...” Li Leyun glared at Huang Yueli angrily, not knowing what to do anymore.","Li Yuntao and others were beside the two of them, and they felt very strange when they saw the movements between them. Seeing that the two were in a deadlock state, Li Yuntao couldn’t help but ask, “Lady Li, what’s going on? What kind of bet is there? Can you tell me about it?”","Li Leyun’s face was suddenly very ugly, and she shook her head hastily, “No, no, no, Uncle Tao, this is what we two said in private, don’t bother you, we can solve it ourselves.”","As she said that, she grabbed Huang Yueli’s sleeve and wanted to pull her out of the door, “Let’s go, let’s stop affecting others, go outside and talk...”","Li Leyun believed that she was an exponent in the heart profound realm, and her cultivation was much higher than that of Huang Yueli, so with a little effort, she felt that Huang Yueli would definitely not be able to break free and could only follow her.","But who knows, not only did she fail to drag Huang Yueli away, but Huang Yueli almost brought her to the ground when she struggled back.","Li Leyun staggered before regaining her balance.","At this time, Huang Yueli had already turned to face Li Yuntao, and said unhurriedly, “Divine General Li, I didn’t want to say more, but since the elders have asked, it is inappropriate for me to hide it or not... The matter is very serious. Simple, a few days ago, Young Miss Li Leyun deliberately found where I lived and proposed to me that she wanted to make a bet with me on who could win the first place in Grandmaster Xiao’s competition today, and the bet...”","She shook her head, with a helpless expression on her face, “The bet is my husband! Young Miss Li wants me to promise that the person who loses the bet must get out of my husband’s side, and no matter what the reason is, you can’t approach him in the future! ”","As soon as these words came out, everyone in the hall was in an uproar.","It’s not uncommon for young everyone to be jealous, but it’s not something you can bet on every day.","Besides, these two girls can be regarded as genius Spiritual Armament Masters, but they were much more extraordinary than the average. They actually had a wager on Grandmaster Xiao’s competition!","At the same time, everyone suddenly had an epiphany.","It turned out that the two were betting on Li Moying’s ownership. No wonder Li Leyun was so reluctant.","Grandmaster Xiao’s face was even more ugly. In his opinion, the Spirit Armament competition was a very serious matter. Now it’s even better. What were the two little girls doing?! Still betting and using a man as a wager?!","However, apart from Grandmaster Xiao and a few other Sky Gem Grandmasters, the others were even more excited.","Today’s gossip... it was really exhilarating to watch!","“In this way, Young Miss Li has lost! You can’t say that she is the fiancee of Young Master Li in the future.”","“Yes, yes, yes, I am willing to admit defeat! Besides, Lady Li and Young Master Li are already married, what else can I say?”","Li Leyun’s face turned blue and red after listening to the words of these people who were watching the fun and didn’t think it was a big deal."]},{"number":3426,"title":"Chapter 3426 - One must always honor a bet (2)","paragraphs":["So many people were jeering, weren’t they forcing her to admit defeat!","If she insisted on denying it, it meant that she could not afford to lose, which was a huge humiliation.","However, if she was asked to immediately admit to the the bet and swear that she would never approach Li Moying again, she couldn’t do it at all!","Li Leyun froze in place, staring at Huang Yueli fiercely, “You...don’t go too far! The bet at that time, right! You...you didn’t accept it at all?”","A burst of light flashed by in Li Leyun’s mind, and she suddenly recalled that at that time, Huang Yueli did not agree to bet with her at all, but said some high-sounding words about respecting and disrespecting Li Moying and rejected her.","!!","However, later, Huang Yueli appeared at Grandmaster Xiao’s manor again.","Li Leyun felt that she would definitely win, so she deliberately brought up the bet before the competition, in fact, she was afraid that Huang Yueli would say that she had never agreed to bet, and deliberately used words to provoke her.","However, the loser had become Li Leyun herself!","She didn’t react for a while, but when she thought about it just now, she remembered her previous feelings.","“That’s right, I said that I want to bet with you that the loser can’t get close to Brother Moying! However, you clearly said at the time that Brother Moying is very important in your heart and can’t be used for betting. This is a disrespect to him! Isn’t that what you said? What? Now that you got the first place, you changed your mind? You can disrespect Brother Moying?!”","Everyone looked at Li Leyun with strange eyes.","This person actually said that others are were hypocritical. Who was more hypocritical and changed their minds faster?","Who couldn’t tell the truth of the matter? Hearing her words, wasn’t the truth pretty oblivious? At first, Li Leyun said she had made the bet with Huang Yueli, but now she says she didn’t bet when she lost!","However, if Huang Yueli really said that before, then she really can’t insist on letting Li Leyun fulfill the content of the wager...","After the everyone who were present had forcibly watched Li Leyun, they turned their heads and looked at Huang Yueli, waiting to see how she was going to answer.","“Hmm, I wonder if this is true, right?”","“Whether it’s true or not, the situation is so favorable to Madame Li. She will definitely insist that the bet exists!”","“That’s right, if it were me, I wouldn’t say that the bet doesn’t exist at this time. After all, when the two bet, there is not even a witness, and even if they say it, no one can prove it. Who would be like that? Stupid?”","The voices of the everyone’ discussions entered Li Leyun’s ears, her pupils instantly dilated and she became more nervous.","Yes, that damned little vixen can still deny it!","It can be said that she is empty talk and has no witnesses!","Thinking of this, Li Leyun was almost desperate.","But at this moment, Huang Yueli spoke up, and what she said was beyond everyone’s expectations.","“Young Miss Li is right. She came to me for a bet, but I didn’t accept it. Before the competition started today, Young Miss Li made a bet with me again, but I didn’t agree.”","As soon as these words came out, the hall suddenly became quiet.","No one expected that Huang Yueli would say such a thing!","Even Grandmaster Xiao stared at her with wide eyes, thinking she must be stupid!","Huang Yueli noticed the surprised gazes around her, and smiled slightly, “As Young Miss Li said just now, my husband is a priceless treasure in my heart, and he is a human being, not my property, so how can I bet on this?”"]},{"number":3427,"title":"Chapter 3427 - One must always honor a bet (3)","paragraphs":["Having said this, Huang Yueli paused, glanced coldly at Li Leyun’s face, and said: “Besides, my husband has his own thoughts and feelings, even if I were to retreat, he will never be interested in you. So tell me, how can I watch him suffer such in injustice?”","Hearing this, Li Leyun’s face suddenly turned green!","This shrewed little vixen was too shameless! She just spoke out in such a straightforward manner. It was obvious what she meant, Li Moying doesn’t like her at all!","Although, this was a fact, but Li Leyun had always refused to accept it!","Besides, speaking out in front of so many of those that were in power and spreading it out, who knows what would go down the grapevine!","Hearing this, everyone in the hall laughed out along as well.","In fact, what the relationship between Huang Yueli and Li Moying was and whether Li Moying had a crush on Li Leyun, these outsiders don’t know anything about it.","But this does not prevent them from admiring Huang Yueli’s confidence and demeanor.","Huang Yueli could admit that the bet did not exist. Behind such a demeanor was unparalleled confidence! It seemed that she was certain that Young Master Li would never betray their feelings.","Huang Yueli turned to Grandmaster Xiao, cupped her hands and said, “So, from the beginning to the end, I didn’t plan to make any bet with Young Miss Li. I’m here to participate in the competition today, simply because I just don’t want anyone else to be called my husband’s fiancee outside. This shameful incident has damaged my husband’s reputation! That’s all.”","After listening to Huang Yueli’s explanation, everyone was convinced.","For such a young girl to have such insight and ambition, few even the younger generation of the other God Clans can achieve it.","Even Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai looked at each other, and their views on Huang Yueli were greatly changed.","Originally, they thought that Huang Yueli only depended on luck and beauty to marry Li Moying in the lower realm, but now that she came to the realm of the gods, she could only be a vase that Li Moying looked after, and it was insignificant.","But now, Huang Yueli not only showed a powerful talent for refining armaments, but also showed the tolerance and heart that a superior should have.","To be honest, if it wasn’t for Huang Yueli’s low background, they would all think that Huang Yueli is more suitable to be the young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan than Li Leyun!","Besides, Huang Yueli’s insistence on not betting against Li Moying also shows that her feelings for Li Moying are from the heart.","Based on this, even Li Leyun can’t compare.","“It’s a pity, a little girl who has risen from the lower realm is still a human race. Her background is too low, even if she has a second-class background!”","Li Yuntao said a word without beginning or end, but Li Yunhai and he were twin brothers, and they had the same mind, so he naturally understood what he meant.","Li Yunhai also nodded and said, “Let’s report today’s affairs to the Patriarch first. At least you can give her the status of a concubine. For a little human Lass Like her, it is a step to the sky.”","The Twelve Great God Clans were equivalent to nobles in the God Realm, and it was common to have a wife and a few concubines.","Like Li Moying, as the future Patriarch, in addition to the main wife, he can also marry two concubines.","The Concubine’s status in the family was also very high, and she must be a noble daughter with outstanding talent from major families to sit in this position.","In the eyes of the two of them, making Huang Yueli the position of a concubine was already considered to have done her a great favor, and she should even be thankful for it."]},{"number":3428,"title":"Chapter 3428 - One must always honor a bet (4)","paragraphs":["While the two were discussing this matter, they deliberately lowered their voices so that even Li Leyun, who was standing the closest to them, could not hear them.","However, after Huang Yueli’s Primordial Spirit merged, her consciousness was stronger than that of the normal cultivators, so she could still hear their conversation clearly.","She raised her eyebrow, feeling a little more dissatisfied with the Cloudy Qilin Clan people in her heart.","The people of these Ancient Gods were really aloof, and they always seem to spare no effort to despise those ordinary people.","How did they even think that giving her the position of a concubine seem like it was a huge merit? What the hell!","!!","Not to mention, she did not eve put them in her eyes, what more, Li Moying. He wouldn’t be at their mercy.","There was a commotion in the hall, and everyone was discussing the previous matter.","Huang Yueli turned around and found that Li Leyun, who was not far from her side, was gone. After searching carefully, she found that Li Leyun had already arrived at the door. It seemed that she could not bear such a blow and wanted to sneak away.","Grandmaster Xiao came over, walked Huang Yueli’s side and said with pride: “Today’s competition had twists and turns, but fortunately, the truth was finally revealed. Madame Li won the first place with her true ability, then this deal also belongs to you! By the way, this old man has good news to tell you...”","Grandmaster Xiao chortled heartily and announced loudly, “The new standard spirit armament designed is not limited to just one type, but a total of twenty variations!”","Of course, Huang Yueli knew that this deal involved twenty kinds of Spirit Armaments, so she wasn’t surprised at all.","However, she still had to act. She showed a surprised expression at the right time, and her voice trembled, “Two... Twenty kinds of improved standard Spirit Armaments! This... this is too amazing!”","Huang Yueli’s surprise was faked, but the shock to the other everyone in the hall was real!","“Twenty new standard Spirit Armaments! Twenty!”","“My Goodness, the amount involved in this deal is probably several millions!”","“The luck of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is also very good, they won such a big deal!”","“How can this be called luck? Madame Li relies on her strength!”","“That’s true as well, isn’t it great luck that Young Master Li can marry such a talented and beautiful lady?”","“Wait until your talent and strength surpass that of Young Master Li, then say that again!”","The exclamations came one after another, and Grandmaster Xiao nodded again and again. This competition was also a major event for Empyrean Fox Continent’s Sky Gem Glass Chamber. It was able to cause such a sensational effect, which made him very satisfied.","After everyone was talking about it, he raised his hand to signal everyone to be quiet.","“Alright, today’s competition is over, congratulations to the Cloudy Qilin Clan for winning this deal, please ask Madame Li and the two Divine Generals to come to this old man tomorrow to discuss specific cooperation matters, and the others should go back to rest early!”","Hearing this, Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai stood up with joyful expressions on their faces.","Although today because of Li Leyun’s relationship, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has become the laughing stock of the onlookers, but aside from the gossip about two women fighting for one man, the Cloudy Qilin Clan was actually the biggest beneficiary today.","The first and second places in the competition belonged to the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even if Li Leyun annoyed Grandmaster Xiao, the Cloudy Qilin Clan still took the business into their pockets.","Just when the two came up and wanted to talk to Grandmaster Xiao in detail, suddenly, a voice came from beside them.","“Grandmaster Xiao, wait a minute!”"]},{"number":3429,"title":"Chapter 3429 - The True One (1)","paragraphs":["At this time, everyone thought that the dust had settled, but suddenly someone stood up.","Hearing this voice, many everyone had already reached the gate, and they all stopped and turned their heads, wanting to see what happened next.","Grandmaster Xiao saw the speaker clearly and was very surprised, “Madame Li, you ..”","Huang Yueli glanced at the two Divine Generals indifferently, and said, “Grandmaster Xiao, this junior takes the liberty to ask of you, why do you want to congratulate the two Divine Generals? When did I say that I would give this deal to the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Grandmaster Xiao’s eyes widened, this time he was really shocked.","“What? You... what do you mean?”","The two Divine Generals frowned and looked at Huang Yueli suspiciously. After seeing the extremely indifferent expression on the face of that amazingly beautiful girl, both of them suddenly had a bad premonition in their hearts.","Sure enough, the words that left Huang Yueli’s mouth made their hearts jolt.","“I mean, I didn’t participate in the competition on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan at all. Although I won the first place, this deal shouldn’t be handed over to the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","The expressions of the two Divine Generals suddenly changed.","“You... what do you mean? Do you want to distance yourself from the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“You are the Young Master’s wife, do you still want to have the share of the entire pie?”","Huang Yueli looked at the two of them, and said with a half-smile: “Now you say that I’m Moying’s wife again? Before, didn’t you deny my marriage to him at all? Since in your eyes, I’m just a fool, a woman with no background, what kind of competition did I participate in outside, and what kind of business did I get, it doesn’t seem to have anything to do with the Cloudy Qilin Clan, right?”","The two of them were at a loss for words.","After a moment, Li Yuntao said: “Lady Li, you are blaming us for saying this! We have never denied your intentions! Anyway, you followed our Young Master in the lower realm, that is the Young Master. How could the woman of yours be without a name? Don’t worry, the family will never let you suffer any lose!”","Li Yunhai also said: “That’s right, Lady Li, you have made a contribution to our Cloudy Qilin Clan today. We will report these things to the Patriarch and win the appropriate reward for you.”","Huang Yueli slightly raised the corners of her mouth, and there was a bit of coldness in her smile.","“It’s really deserving to be Divine Generals. You speak with such articulate skills. Your words are many times better than Young Miss Li! You won’t let me suffer a loss, but I would really like to know, may I know your plan to not let me suffer any loss?”","“This...”","The two were at a standstill again.","To let Huang Yueli be the Concubine, in their opinion, was a righteous and just reward but it was not suitable to say it on such an occasion. After all, Huang Yueli had just made a big splash today, and many people were on her side.","Li Yuntao can only say vaguely: “This, when we report to the Patriarch, the family will naturally have a decision.”","Huang Yueli sneered and said, “There’s no need to trouble you. Anyway, I didn’t intend to cooperate with the Cloudy Qilin Clan from the very beginning.”","As a noble general, Li Yuntao was swept away by a young human race girl like this, his face changed suddenly, and his whole body became cold.","“Lady Li, do you think you can use such a deal to coerce the Cloudy Qilin Clan to make concessions to you? Let me tell you, although this deal can generate millions, but for the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it is just a drop in the bucket! It’s nothing at all!”"]},{"number":3430,"title":"Chapter 3430 - The True One (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli heard the words and just smiled, “Divine General really thinks too much, I never thought of threatening the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I also know very well that with my ability, it is impossible to bargain with the Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","When Li Yunhai heard her say that, he secretly heaved a sigh of relief, thinking that Huang Yueli would soften after they threatened her.","He softened his tone and said, “It’s good that you understand. I will treat it as angry wordsthat were spoken just now and not hold them accountable. We all understand that you have grievances against Young Miss Leyun and it was just on a whim.”","After he finished speaking, he looked at Huang Yueli with a smile, as if waiting for her to bow her head and admit her mistake.","Huang Yueli looked at his seemingly kind, but hypocritical expression, and knew very well in her heart.","The twin brothers had a tacit understanding of cooperation, one acts as the good cop, the other acts as the bad cop, wanting to use both hard and soft approach and in then end, forcing her to leave the deal to the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","This move can be said to be quite vicious. If she was really a young girl who did not know the ugliness hidden in the world, she may have obeyed their wishes under such pressure.","But unfortunately, they encountered Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli hated being coerced by others the most, not to mention the remarks made by the two who wanted to make her a concubine already annoyed her.","She listened to the two Divine Generals quietly, and then replied unhurriedly: “I understand the good intentions of the two Divine Generals, but it’s not enough, I’m not acting on my will. As you said, this deal is indeed insignificant for the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so there is no need to be so persistent. Anyway, I’ve already given it a lot of thought and it’s useless for you to say anything more.”","Li Yunhai’s complexion also changed suddenly!","He believed that he had condescended to talk to Huang Yueli, and he also promised her a lot of benefits, but she was so ignorant!","In such a short moment, she still insisted on refusing.","Li Yuntao snorted coldly and said in a bad tone: “Lady Li, you were given a choice to do it the easy way but you chose to do it the hard way! My brother is kindhearted and persuaded you yet you think we are really afraid of you and can’t rule over you? Do you think that if you say that this deal does not belong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it really does not belong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Don’t you forget that when you signed up for the competition today, you said that you came on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It doesn’t mean that if you want to deny it so arbitrarily, you can do so!”","Having said this, Li Yuntao turned to look at Grandmaster Xiao.","“Grandmaster Xiao, what do you say about this matter? As the esteemed Grandmaster of the Sky Gem Glass Chamber, you have always been fair and just. You have also seen what happened today. This little girl participated in the competition on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Yet, now she is unwilling to hand over the deal to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, is it fine to go back on her word so simply? If all Spiritual Armament Masters are like this, who would dare to cooperate with your Sky Gem Glass Chamber in the future?”","Li Yuntao said this very rudely. If it was the usual, Grandmaster Xiao would definitely be very angry.","But at this time, he felt speechless and didn’t know how to argue.","Because, even Grandmaster Xiao felt that Huang Yueli was a little wrong in this matter.","Although the Sky Gem Glass Chamber was famous for protecting their own, most of the time, it will support the Spiritual Armament Masters, but if they were obvious in the wrong, things will be difficult to handle."]},{"number":3431,"title":"Chapter 3431 - The True One (3)","paragraphs":["Grandmaster Xiao was lost in thoughts for some time before he took another look at Huang Yueli.","“Madame Li, as for this matter... This old man explained the rules of the competition at the beginning, and the registered Spiritual Armament Masters can only participate in the competition on behalf of their own forces. If you change your mind so suddenly, it is really not very appropriate. Although you are eager to win today, it is a little impulsive. This is not a small matter, so you should think about it again!”","Grandmaster Xiao admired Huang Yueli’s talent very much, and he was upright by nature, and he too didn’t like the way those big clans like the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so he could understand that Huang Yueli refused to bow to the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Therefore, what he said was not too harsh.","However, no matter how calm his tone was, his position was still quite clear.","!!","Grandmaster Xiao also believed that Huang Yueli should cooperate with the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and it was not advisable to change her mind so abruptly.","Li Yuntao was a little dissatisfied with Grandmaster Xiao’s unclear stance, he couldn’t help but glared at him, and then said, “Lady Li, you heard it too, Grandmaster Xiao’s competition rules are like this, so it’s useless for you to argue any further. Besides, if you fight against the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you can only suffer from it, so you should think carefully!”","Li Yuntao and the others clashed again with Huang Yueli. Many everyone from the major forces were reluctant to leave. They stopped to listen in on the arguments between the two sides, and were also discussing each other in private.","“What does Madame Li mean? Does she really want to do this? Grandmaster Xiao can’t possibly allow her to do this, right?”","“I really don’t know why she did this? The deal will eventually belong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s pointless for her to do this!”","“Isn’t it? Although in the public, it would be very cool to contend against the two dignified six-star Divine Generals, but if she returns to the Cloudy Qilin Clan with Young Master Li in the future, this will be the end of the story. Two enemies! The energy of the two Dao Profound Realm everyone in the family is definitely not small, she is not worth the loss!”","Everyone was talking a lot, and they were all worried about Huang Yueli.","If it wasn’t for the inappropriate opening of their mouths on such an occasion, they might have already gone up to persuade her in person.","And the only one qualified to speak, Grandmaster Xiao, even persuaded her directly.","He immediately said, “Madame Li, I have something to tell you...”","He just opened his mouth, and Huang Yueli shook her head.","“Grandmaster Xiao, your good intentions, the younger generation understands. If I really represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan, I will definitely not regret it now. But, did you remember something wrong? When I signed up for the competition earlier, I never said that I want to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the competition! Why do you all insist that I am the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Spiritual Armament Master?”","Huang Yueli’s tone was full of doubts, and the expression reflected on her face was even more innocent.","Grandmaster Xiao looked confused, “What? What do you mean?”","Huang Yueli explained: “That was the situation at the time! Please think back carefully?”","Grandmaster Xiao frowned tightly, recalling the situation at the time, “Let me think about it, you said you wanted to participate in the competition, but according to the rules, you must first prove that the forces behind you are capable of undertaking such a big deal before you can participate in the competition. So this old man had raised some doubts...”"]},{"number":3432,"title":"Chapter 3432 - The True One (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli nodded and said, “That’s right, I wanted to answer at the time and tell me the force behind me, but who knows, before I could speak, Young Miss Li rushed out and said that I represented the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Grandmaster Xiao nodded and said, “Yes, that’s true...”","One of the prerequisites for becoming a Spiritual Armament Master was a strong memory. A Sky Gem Grandmaster like Grandmaster Xiao had a very good memory. If he carefully recalled what happened a few hours ago, he would be able to remember it clearly. A single dialogue could easily be recalled.","Therefore, he was very sure that the situation at that time was exactly what Huang Yueli said, and there was no distortion or exaggeration.","However, Grandmaster Xiao was still quite puzzled in his heart, “Madame Li, what do you mean, you didn’t agree to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan at all? But, under the circumstances at that time...didn’t you acquiesce?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, looking extremely innocent.","“Acquiesce? Is it even considered if I don’t say anything? It’s too unreasonable, right? Everyone has seen the situation at that time. Young Miss Li insisted that I am a Spiritual Armament Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but I can’t tell her. In addition, everyone is urging them to start the competition as soon as possible, I had no time to make it clear! I had never agreed!”","“This...this...” Grandmaster Xiao was speechless, not knowing how to answer.","The everyone present were also shocked by Huang Yueli’s explanation!","There were also many people with outstanding memory among them. Looking back at that time, what Huang Yueli said was indeed right.","But, with her like that, everyone would think that she was going to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan by default, right?","Besides, Li Leyun was so proactive at the time, and she even let another Spiritual Armament Master from the Cloudy Qilin Clan voluntarily withdraw from the competition. This performance strengthened everyone’s cognition.","Even if some people feel that something is wrong at first, after seeing Li Leyun’s performance, there will be no more doubts.","Thinking of this, many people secretly looked at Li Yuntao and the others.","At this moment, these two Divine Generals were about to vomit blood on the spot!","The two of them were able to cultivate to the Dao Profound Realm, and of course their memory weren’t bad, but just like everyone else, they thought that Huang Yueli had already agreed to participate in the competition.","Now that Huang Yueli has pointed this out, thinking about it again, that stinky girl really didn’t say a word to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the competition!","Actually, Huang Yueli said that she didn’t have a chance to make it clear, and that she could deceive Grandmaster Xiao, but the two Divine Generals still knew it very well.","Even if there was no chance to speak before the competition started, after the competition was over, the period of time waiting for the results of the competition was suffiient. If she really want to say, how could there be no chance?","Huang Yueli clearly came deceive them on purpose!","However, what makes the two Divine Generals feel more aggrieved is that they think so in their hearts, but they couldn’t say it confidently at all!","Because, things developing to such a point, the main responsibility was not actually on Huang Yueli, but on Li Leyun!","If she hadn’t been clever enough to answer that embarrassing question for Huang Yueli, and instructed the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Spiritual Armament Master to retire, it would not have been so easy for Huang Yueli to want to deceive them like this!","Don’t mention the suffocation in their hearts! They couldn’t help but stared at Li Leyun fiercely."]},{"number":3433,"title":"Chapter 3433 - The True One (5)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun had already planned to sneak away, but the moment she stepped out, she heard Huang Yueli and Li Yuntao arguing, thinking that she could see Huang Yueli’s defeated expression, she stopped in her tracks once again.","However, this time, she knew better that she was no different from a mouse crossing the street so she didn’t dare to say anything as she just watched silently, praying in her heart that Huang Yueli would suffer for offending the two Divine Generals and would welcome a whole entire streak of bad luck.","But to her disappointment, she didn’t see Huang Yueli unlucky ay all.","Instead, Li Leyun herself realized once again how stupid she was!","Especially when she noticed the cold and stern gazes of the two Divine Generals, she wished she hadn’t stayed! This was simply humiliating!","!!","The other’s present also understood, and they all gloated over her misfortune.","Most people supported Huang Yueli and helped her laugh at the stupidity of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, there were also people who stood on the side of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and raised new questions.","“What Madame Li said is indeed true, but it still doesn’t seem right? If Madame Li did not come on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, what force does she represent? It can’t be on her own, right? It’s really like this, she simply doesn’t have the strength to take on this big deal of millions of chalcedony, that is to say, she doesn’t even have the qualifications to sign up... In this way, her first place should be cancelled!”","There are not one or two people who think of this.","Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai were not stupid either, they quickly thought of it.","The two hurriedly turned to Grandmaster Xiao, “Grandmaster Xiao, let’s see what to do with this! Lady Li insisted that she didn’t represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and that’s a fact, so we’ll accept it! However, she is not qualified to register for the competition and hence her ranking in the competition cannot be counted! Please announce the cancellation of her ranking!”","Hearing the words of the two Divine Generals, everyone present was shocked!","They immediately realized what this meant.","If Huang Yueli’s first-place qualification was cancelled, wouldn’t the original second-place Li Leyun be able to make up for the first place?","In this case, the deal still belongs to the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Li Leyun was already paralyzed on the ground and wanted to find a hole to dig into, but she didn’t expect to hear such words!","She raised her head suddenly, with ecstasy on her face!","If things take such a twist, she will be transformed from the most humiliating person today to the biggest winner today!","Grandmaster Xiao’s face stiffened, “This... this... This old man thinks...”","He hesitated, unable to speak for a long time.","According to the rules of the competition, Li Yuntao’s request was naturally not excessive at all, and it was completely reasonable, but, like this, won’t Huang Yueli just lift a stone and hit her in the foot?","Grandmaster Xiao cherishes talent, and really doesn’t want to see Huang Yueli in such a state of embarrassment.","Moreover, he has an even bolder guess in his heart...","Li Yuntao urged: “Grandmaster Xiao, what are you still hesitating about? The rules of the competition are like this, everyone can see it!”","As he spoke, he glanced at Huang Yueli with a sneer.","Fortunately, he reacted fast enough to catch the flaw in that stinky girl’s words!","That stinky girl is really too cunning, he was a strong exponent and yet he almost fell into her hands.","But now it was different, he will let Huang Yueli know right away, what was called self-defeating!","Huang Yueli noticed his sight, but just raised her chin, the smile on the corner of her mouth did not diminish at all.","“Who said I have no power behind me? I can’t take over this deal?”"]},{"number":3434,"title":"Chapter 3434 - The True One (6)","paragraphs":["“Oh? This is interesting? What is the power behind you? Why don’t you tell me, hmmm?”","Li Yuntao didn’t believe that such a thing would happen at all, a sneer appeared on the corner of his mouth, and asked in jest.","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “The power I represent is...”","Her gaze swept past the major forces who were about to leave but stopped halfway at the door, and finally stopped on Xuan Qingling’s body.","“...Black Tortoise Clan!”","Li Leyun and the two Divine Generals had sarcastic expressions on their faces, so they looked at Huang Yueli in a relaxed manner, wanting to hear what she could say next!","But who knows, as soon as Huang Yueli opened her mouth, everyone was stunned on the spot.","Such an answer was really unexpected.","“Black Tortoise Clan? What does Madame Li have to do with the Black Tortoise Clan?”","“What’s the matter? Is she really representing the Black Tortoise Clan?”","“Don’t be naive, how is this possible! I think Madame Li said that on purpose, to deliberately stand on odds with Li Leyun and the others? Moreover, it doesn’t make any sense to do so?”","“Indeed, she is too stupid to do so!”","“No, wait a minute, who said it’s pointless to do this?”","Everyone was talking in a low voice. After a series of exclamations, they thought about it and suddenly realized that Huang Yueli said this, not just talking nonsense, but...","There were very few people from the Black Tortoise Clan today. Apart from the servants such as maids and guards, the only person who can manage things was Xuan Qingling, a Dao Profound Realm elder of the Black Tortoise Clan.","As soon as they heard Huang Yueli’s words, both of them were stunned, and subconsciously wanted to deny it.","The dispute between Huang Yueli and Li Yuntao was an infighting of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. As one of the twelve Great God Clans, they were not suitable to mix in at such a juncture. Besides, Xuan Qingling was known for her indifferent temperament, so she was too lazy to take care of other people’s deal.","However, before Xuan Qingling could speak, Huang Yueli suddenly coughed heavily and said aloud, “The people of the Black Tortoise Clan discussed with me yesterday that I would also participate in the competition on behalf of the Black Tortoise Clan to take this deal with me. The Black Tortoise Clan is also of the Ancient God clan, is such a big force powerful enough?”","Xuan Qingling’s eyes widened, looking at Huang Yueli, she found that the beautiful and lovely girl smiled at her, and her beautiful big eyes blinked, as if she wanted to say something.","A burst of light flashed in Xuan Qingling’s mind!","Immediately, she responded: “Yes, that’s the way it is! Madame Li agreed with us in advance. Therefore, our Black Tortoise Clan only sent me as a Spiritual Armament Master to participate in this competition, and the other position is reserved for Young Master Li’s Madame. Everything happened so fast, I didn’t have time to make it clear before the competition!”","The elders of the Black Tortoise Clan did not expect that Xuan Qingling would say such a thing, and a trace of confusion flashed.","However, everyone here was a smart person, so naturally they reacted quickly.","Listening to Huang Yueli’s tone, this was to leave this big deal to their Black Tortoise Clan!","Originally, Elder Xuan had completely given up.","No matter how fiercely Huang Yueli and Li Leyun fought today, it was also a matter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and their Black Tortoise Clan will definitely not get any benefit this time.","But now, a big pie has fallen from the sky!","Whoever doesn’t catch it was a fool!","Elder Xuan said hurriedly: “Yes, Madame Li heard that the quota for the Cloudy Qilin Clan Race was full, and she really wanted to participate in the competition, so she came to discuss it with us!”"]},{"number":3435,"title":"Chapter 3435 - The True One (7)","paragraphs":["“This old man didn’t expect Madame Li to have such a high level of refining. Just seeing her as a poor girl, I decided to help her. Anyway, we have an extra quota!”","As Elder Xuan was talking, the corners of his mouth almost went to the back of his ears!","There was actually such a good thing in the world, they were really, really lucky!","Especially before the start of the competition today, Li Leyun also came to Xuan Qingling to show off. At that time, Elder Xuan couldn’t stand it anymore, but because there were two Divine Generals on the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s side, he didn’t dare to tear his face with them.","As a result, how could he have imagined that luck flowed over to their side and it appeared in a splash!","!!","In the end, this deal actually fell into the pockets of their Black Tortoise Clan.","Li Yuntao was so angry that his whole body was trembling, and he looked at Elder Xuan and Xuan Qingling with cold eyes, and his eyes almost burst out with fire! If eyes could kill, maybe Xuan Qingling and the others have already fallen to the ground.","“Xuan Zifan, Xuan Qingling! The two of you don’t even think about meddling in the affairs of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! You really are nosy! Do you think this Divine General will believe such nonsense? Why do you want to help that stinky girl?”","Elder Xuan Zifan said with a smile: “The old man said just now, this is called doing a good deed every day, but I didn’t expect to get such a big deal. So, good intentions are rewarded! Brother Yuntao should also do more good deeds. Don’t always worry about the little thing, you aren’t a gossip monger, why do you even want to be involved in the younger generation’s matters?”","Li Yuntao almost fainted there and then!","All the major forces who were spectating this almost burst out laughing.","Look, how good he was, he really deserved to be the elder of the Ancient God Clan. He even dared to make such cynical remarks!","This was really too outrageous to say this, and “doing one good deed every day”, I don’t know who would believe it! Moreover, he also described Li Yuntao, a dignified six-star Divine General, as a gossip monger.","Moreover, Xuan Zifan satirized the other side of Li Yuntao’s nosy deal, but he was actually showing his favor to Huang Yueli and speaking for her.","Of course, it was understandable for him to do so.","If it were changed to another force and they received such a generous gift from Huang Yueli for no reason, they too would firmly stand by her side to support her.","Thinking of this, the other major forces felt a little depressed again.","Because the people of the Black Tortoise Clan were really lucky!","Huang Yueli didn’t want to cooperate with the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so she just found a participating force to cooperate. However, since the Cloudy Qilin Clan insisted that she participated, so can the other!","The same was to choose a party to cooperate, how could the Black Tortoise Clan be so lucky to be selected by Huang Yueli?","Was it because they only sent one Spiritual Armament Master to participate in the competition?","When the major forces thought of this, they all thumped their chests one by one, regretting it!","What’s the use of sending so many useless Spiritual Armament Masters from your own forces? If they knew it, they would send only one too! Maybe they could get Huang Yueli too!","Li Yuntao was ridiculed by Xuan Zifan and almost didn’t mention it in one breath.","Li Yunhai was calmer and could only stand up to support his brother, “Elder Xuan, you have made up your mind that you are going to turn against the Cloudy Qilin Clan for a deal??”","Before Xuan Zifan could speak, Xuan Qingling smiled faintly: “Divine General Li’s words are too much! Madame Li is a person whom the younger generation appreciates very much. Is it wrong to cooperate with a good friend?”"]},{"number":3436,"title":"Chapter 3436 - The True One (8)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Li Yunhai’s face also turned green, but he had nothing to say.","They had claimed to be good friends, so does it matter to do a deal together? It was not surprising to represent your good friend’s family to participate in the competition, right?","Although everyone present knew it was all fake, it was impossible to argue against it!","Huang Yueli also laughed, and it was a rare sincere smile at that.","The people of the Black Tortoise Clan reacted really fast, just a few glances matched her so seamlessly, especially Xuan Qingling, she was really an interesting girl.","!!","She liked this seemingly cold but calm character!","Huang Yueli turned to Grandmaster Xiao and cupped her hands, “Grandmaster Xiao, the problem has been solved now, so there shouldn’t be any changes, right? I’ll come over tomorrow with Young Miss Xuan and Elder Xuan to discuss the details of the cooperation.”","When Grandmaster Xiao looked at the scene in front of him, he really didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","He nodded helplessly and said, “Alright, this old man knows. Just follow what Madame Li said!”","Grandmaster Xiao’s words marked the closing to this matter.","Today’s competition was really filled with ups and downs, twists and turns, and the final result was beyond everyone’s expectations.","Originally, the Cloudy Qilin Clan was destined to be the biggest winner today. Even if there was a dispute, it was just an infighting between Huang Yueli and Li Leyun, but who would have thought that Huang Yueli chose to cooperate with the Black Tortoise Clan in the end!","Many people sighed, watching this good show today was really enjoyable!","Huang Yueli finished chatting with Grandmaster Xiao, and immediately walked to Xuan Qingling’s side.","She had a very good impression of Xuan Qingling. Besides, the two sides will cooperate for a long time in the future, and it is also very necessary to have a good relationship with business partners.","She leaned over and said in a low voice, “Young Miss Xuan, your reaction is so quick today! I was afraid that you wouldn’t understand what I meant just now!”","Xuan Qingling glanced at her, “Madame Li, is it really alright for you to do this? After all, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is Young Master Li’s family... Even if you don’t care about the Cloudy Qilin Clan, don’t you care about Young Master Li?”","The questions that Xuan Qingling had were also on the mind of others."]},{"number":3437,"title":"Chapter 3437 - Whatever My Wife Says (1)","paragraphs":["Xuan Qingling of the Black Tortoise Clan was a famous for being a genius Spiritual Armament Master in the God Realm, and her reputation was much louder than that of Li Leyun’s.","Originally, Huang Yueli expected that if she didn’t participate in the competition herself, Xuan Qingling would take the first place.","In fact, Xuan Qingling’s performance today was almost the same as Li Leyun’s.","It’s just that Li Leyun was more cunning and took advantage of the loopholes in the rules of the competition. She found a Spiritual Armament Master from the allied armies and secretly trained, so she was able to narrowly defeat Xuan Qingling.","In addition to this factor, the Black Tortoise Clan was also a clan that has always been known for being prudent and honest.","!!","Although the number of masters in the clan is not as many as other clans, almost every famous master has a positive reputation, and almost never has any bad family members.","Such a partner was obviously more reliable.","Huang Yueli never thought about the Cloudy Qilin Clan from the beginning.","“If you say that, of course I’m relieved. By the way, tomorrow...”","Huang Yueli was about to settle tomorrow’s affairs with Xuan Qingling, but at this moment, a guard hurried over from the corridor, looking like he was in a hurry.","Seeing this, Grandmaster Xiao immediately frowned.","“What’s going on? Why are you in such a hurry? There are many distinguished guests in the hall today. What if you bump into the guests?”","The guard hurriedly bowed and saluted, “Master, a young man came to the door of the mansion just now. He said he was the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Because his Madame has not returned from our manor for a long time, so he came here to look...”","“Ah!” Huang Yueli suddenly exclaimed, and then quickly covered her mouth.","She looked up at the sky outside, and found that it was already dark.","When the competition ended today, it was already evening. Later, because of the result of the competition, there were several arguments, which dragged on for a long time. Before she knew it, it was already dark.","Huang Yueli turned her head and said to Xuan Qingling, “Young Miss Xuan, I have to go back first. Tomorrow’s deal...”","Before she finished her farewell words, she heard a few suppressed gasps coming from her side.","“This...could this be...”","“My God, this is really... well-deserved!”","“I finally understand now why there are two talented girls who robbed him so shamelessly...”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her intuition screamed out that things were not good.","Turning her head, she saw that Li Moying couldn’t wait any longer. He had walked in straight to the hall where they were.","This man was born a natural king, with a strong aura and an amazing presence.","As long as he stood there, everyone’s eyes would fall on him involuntarily.","Xuan Qingling also saw Li Moying, even with such a cold and ruthless personality, she couldn’t help raising her eyebrows in surprise.","It was no longer a secret that the Cloudy Qilin Clan had a genius.","However, many people have heard of Li Moying, but those who have actually seen him were few.","At first sight today, everyone finally realized what the true pride of heaven was.","Li Moying was wearing a black robe with gold embellishments and a black crown on his head. No flaws could be picked out from that handsome face of his.","It was not an exaggeration to say that even if Li Moying does not have the strength of a god-level genius, and does not have the identity of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, just with such looks, he could make countless noble ladies of the God Realm fall for his charm."]},{"number":3438,"title":"Chapter 3438 - Whatever My Wife Says (2)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun who stooped at the corner, stared at Li Moying who was getting closer and closer in a daze, and had even forgotten where she was.","Compared with the surrounding women who were simply overwhelmed by Li Moying’s demeanor, Li Leyun actually understood Li Moying’s charm better than them.","He was a real strong man. Although his appearance was outstanding, it only reflected one in ten thousandth of his true charm.","But in the same way, the indifference he showed on the outside was only one in ten thousandth of the real indifference in his heart...","Seeing Li Moying’s arrival, Huang Yueli shrugged her shoulders guiltily.","Li Moying’s expression was ugly to the extreme!","Of course, today’s matter was indeed her fault. It was almost midnight and she still hasn’t come home. A man who loves his wife more than his life will definitely be very worried...","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli quickly walked towards Li Moying, showing a flattering smile while walking.","Approaching the man, she stretched out her hand and immediately wrapped her arms around Li Moying’s arm, smiling sweetly: “Husband, are you here to pick me up? You are so kind to me!”","Li Moying didn’t speak, but he didn’t shake her off either.","He glanced at Huang Yueli rigidly and said in a cold tone , “Who said I’m here to pick you up? If you don’t want to come home, then don’t!”","Alarm bells resounded in Huang Yue’s heart!","Li Moying was really angry!","If it was usual times, even if he was in a bad mood, he would never be like this. Even if she herself annoyed him, he might be arrogant at home, but he would never easily show her such a face when they were out.","Today, he had already taken the initiative to lose his smiling face, but Li Moying still looks arrogant, which is not unusual!","Huang Yueli felt guilty again, and sincerely reflected on her mistake that she didn’t go home on time.","Li Moying’s face was always cold, and he didn’t even look straight at her.","Huang Yueli coquettishly tugged Li Moying’s sleeve with two fingers.","Li Moying ignored her, so she continued to pull and tug. After several times, Li Moying looked at her impatiently.","Huang Yueli leaned half of her body on his arm. Since she was a head shorter than him, she could only look up and her delicate and innocent face now had on a pitiful expression.","“Husband, I know I’m wrong... Let’s go home now!”","When Li Moying came, he was really angry.","Huang Yueli went home late, and that was only part of the reason for his anger.","What really depressed him was that he learned from the allied army today that Huang Yueli was participating in the competition, and she even had a dispute with the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s people.","Li Moying certainly did not think that his wife should not argue with the those in his clan. What he was worried about was that his little fox would suffer!","Moreover, he was a little ashamed.","As a man, he couldn’t even handle the affairs of his own clan. If the elders in the clan make Little Li’er unhappy, he’s going to be extremely distressed!","In Li Moying’s opinion, Huang Yueli should directly disqualify the Cloudy Qilin Clan from the competition. As the owner of the drawings, he felt that she had this right.","Why did she have to end up facing them in person? She even had to be angered by Li Leyun and the others!","Huang Yueli couldn’t have guessed Li Moying’s complicated thoughts, but she could still feel that Li Moying was still sulking, and it didn’t seem like it was easy to calm down."]},{"number":3439,"title":"Chapter 3439 - Whatever My Wife Says (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli couldn’t help but secretly complained. On the one hand, she felt that Li Moying was too arrogant, and on the other hand, she felt that her husband was so handsome even when he was angry, it was too foul.","As all these random thoughts ran amok in her heart, she still kept on an aggrieved expression on her face.","“Don’t be angry, I’m tired, I want to go home...”","When Li Moying heard his little fox whispering in a coaxing tone, more than half of his anger subsided, and when he saw her cute expression with big eyes blinking, his heart softened at once.","After this whole day tossing about, even for a person like Huang Yueli who was usually full of energy, the fatigue in her eyes were obvious.","Li Moying felt extremely distressed, and just wanted to bring his little tired fox home, but at this moment, he heard Li Leyun’s voice coming from the corner.","“Enough! You damned little vixen, don’t let go of Brother Moying! Didn’t you see that Brother Moying was impatient? I have never seen a woman as thick-skinned as you, Brother Moying even gave a look I’m too lazy to give it to you, but you’re too embarrassed to keep holding on to him!”","Huang Yueli was startled for a moment, then turned to look at Li Leyun.","Li Leyun had already lost enough shame today, and she was a little afraid of Li Moying, so she didn’t dare to show up.","But after seeing the interaction between Li Moying and Huang Yueli, she suddenly had other ideas.","Li Moying was strict with her, she was simply a supreme being, a true male god, while Huang Yueli was just a human girl from the lower realm.","This human girl actually clung to him like this, sticking to him all the time!","In Li Leyun’s view, such behavior was shameless!","Huang Yueli pouted and said disapprovingly, “I’m talking to my husband, what’s your deal? Do you think that you’ve not shamed yourself enough for today?”","“What’s the matter with me? Just because I’m Brother Moying’s fiancee, I’m qualified to take care of you! Besides, I’m also for Brother Moying, don’t you see how ugly his face is? He must be entangled by you. Nope, I’ve never seen such a shameless woman like you!”","As soon as Li Leyun said this, the onlookers were in an uproar.","No one would have thought that after so many things that happened before, Li Leyun would still have the face to call herself Li Moying’s fiancee!","How thick was her face?!","However, while everyone despised Li Leyun, their gazes towards Huang Yueli lit up with interest.","Hearing Lady Li’s tone just now, and I thought she and Young Master Li were deeply in love! Now it looks like it’s all just words! Seeing Young Master Li ignoring her, she still clings on to him in such a manner and he hardly even glanced at her.”","“Isn’t that right? Speaking of which, this Lass Li is indeed from the lower realm. She is indeed bold and has a thick skin. If it’s someone from the God Realm who is noble, who would ever be so shameless and hook a man so openly like this?”","“Don’t say it, this is also a skill! Well, at the very least, I can’t do it!”","“Young Master Li has such a good temper. If it were me, I would have thrown away the annoying woman who’s so clingy!”","“Just kidding, at least Lady Li is pretty, so men will be soft-hearted because of this?”","Most of the gossips were said by some young women present who were smitten and tinged with jealousy.","When Huang Yueli and Li Leyun were arguing before, they could still stand on Huang Yueli’s side objectively.","But now after seeing Li Moying treat her, many people’s thoughts changed subtly."]},{"number":3440,"title":"Chapter 3440 - Whatever My Wife Says (4)","paragraphs":["Those who can come to Grandmaster Xiao’s competition today are either the genius Spiritual Armament Masters in the family, or the daughters of great status. In fact, they all had a sense of superiority as born nobles and regarded the people who have risen from the lower realms were just commoners.","It was admirable for Huang Yueli to be such a commoner with such an excellent level of armament refining skills, but it still could not shake away the sense of superiority that these spoilt noble daughters had.","Looking at her status, being able to marry the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, to be honest, many people felt very unbalanced.","However, in that situation, Huang Yueli was slandered by Li Leyun in every possible way, and everyone could easily have a sense of justice, ignoring this imbalance subconsciously.","Now that Huang Yueli won the final victory, and Li Moying appeared in front of everyone with such a shocking momentum...","When facing that handsome man without a wife, many people understand what the name Li Moying really means!","It can be said that the girls present have never seen a man better than him since they were young!","And now, this man belongs to a mere girl that came from the lower realm?","In addition, Li Moying’s attitude towards Huang Yueli was a little cold today because he was unhappy, which gave these ladies a false hint that he didn’t care about Huang Yueli, but only relied on Huang Yueli. Just trying to stick it back.","However, at the beginning, the girls were just thinking about their identities.","After Li Leyun started, she couldn’t help but talk in a low voice.","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli didn’t feel anything at all, she just raised her eyebrows in a funny way.","However, Li Moying’s face suddenly turned gloomy.","The momentum around him suddenly increased, Huang Yueli stood beside him, felt it keenly, hurriedly pulled him, and said in a low voice: “Forget it, Moying, don’t be as knowledgeable as these spoiled little girls! We’ll go back. Rest at home.”","Seeing that Li Moying didn’t move, she said again: “I’m tired, I’ve been standing for a day, my legs are weak, I can’t stand, and I haven’t eaten all day today, I’m about to faint from hunger...”","Li Moying frowned, “You’re stupid! Can’t you take care of yourself? You don’t even know how to eat?”","Seeing him like this, Huang Yueli knew that he was no longer angry, and said with a smile: “If you don’t take care of yourself, you are spoiled by your husband, so you must be responsible to the end!”","The two of them were biting their ears secretly, but the sound didn’t come out.","The people around only saw the two approaching intimately. The icy aura on Li Moying seemed to disappear in an instant, and the everyone who were watching were very surprised.","They had just seen that Li Moying didn’t seem to take this lady from the lower realm seriously, but looking at it now, the relationship between the two seems to be not as bad as everyone thinks?","Li Leyun’s face turned blue and white for a while, she was so angry that she almost vomited blood.","Why didn’t Brother Moying get angry and throw that damned little vixen out!","Didn’t Brother Moying hated others approaching him the most?","If on a regular day, a woman with no eyes in the family touched his body, even if it only touches a finger, he will mercilessly use his profound energy to bounce it off! Some people were seriously injured because of this, and Li Moying didn’t even blink.","That damned little vixen has already stuck to him for so long!","Why didn’t Brother Moying kill her? And...and he even laughed!"]},{"number":3441,"title":"Chapter 3441 - Whatever My Wife Says (5)","paragraphs":["Li Leyun’s heart was torn apart by jealousy, and she was in a lot of pain, but she didn’t dare to go forward to provoke Li Moying.","Li Moying doesn’t know what it meant to have tender, protective feelings for the fairer sex.","She could only turn her eyes to Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai for help.","The two Divine Generals noticed her gaze and both frowned.","They were very disappointed with Li Leyun’s performance today. In fact, they have already made up their minds to report back to the family and disqualify Li Leyun from competing for Li Moying’s fiancee.","So, they didn’t want to help Li Leyun anymore.","However, they had reasons to stand up for her...","Li Yuntao exchanged glances with his brother, then walked out of the crowd and walked in front of Li Moying.","“Young Master, you are here! This Divine General has a few words to tell you.”","Li Moying had already planned to take his precious wife home, so he just glanced at him and refused, “If there’s anything, we’ll talk tomorrow at the Allied Armies branch.”","When Li Yuntao saw that he was about to leave, he became anxious. He originally planned to go to no one to talk about it in private, but he couldn’t care less at this time.","He stopped Li Moying loudly, “Wait, Young Master, do you know what the woman beside you did today?”","Li Moying paused for a while, and finally gave him a glance, and then said in a cold tone: “What do you mean by ‘ this woman’? Little Li’er is my wife, if you still think I am the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, then please remember, Little Li’er is the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Although Li Moying usually disdains those girls in the clan, he still gives some face to the seniors of the family.","Therefore, Li Yuntao never expected that Li Moying would reply him so curtly in public.","Moreover, his point just now was to remind Li Moying that Huang Yueli did something wrong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but Li Moying completely missed his point.","Li Yuntao resisted his anger and said, “Young Madame? If Lady Li really considered herself the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she wouldn’t say that she is not from the Cloudy Qilin Clan today! She even handed over the business she had finally acquired. The Xuanwu family will do it! Look at this woman, she doesn’t care about your family at all, what position does she put you in?”","Li Moying glanced at Huang Yueli and said nothing.","Huang Yueli also found that her husband was not happy again.","However, it was not her who was angry this time.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but feel sorry for Li Yuntao in her heart. If the tiger doesn’t show its power, you will treat others as a sick cat, and you will definitely suffer!","It’s a pity that Li Yuntao was not her, so he didn’t know Li Moying so well.","Although he could see that Li Moying’s face was not good, he felt that Li Moying must be dissatisfied with Huang Yueli’s performance!","A woman who doesn’t think about her husband’s family, but also gives benefits to other forces, is no different from betraying her husband. No man can stand it!","Li Yuntao also thought to himself that he had done a wonderful job.","On the one hand, Li Moying was angry and would definitely ask Huang Yueli to return the business to the Yunlin family. No matter how tough the little girl is, does she dare to go against her husband? On the other hand, Li Moying can also use this to see the true face of this little girl. Maybe she doesn’t need to be obstructed by the family, and the little girl will fall out of favor!","“What did you do to her?” Li Moying said again, but Li Yuntao was stunned for a moment.","“What did you say?” Li Yuntao asked subconsciously."]},{"number":3442,"title":"Chapter 3442 - Whatever My Wife Says (6)","paragraphs":["Li Moying’s tone was calm and restrained, but it was only the calm before the storm.","“I ask... What did you do to Little Li’er? If it wasn’t for the unforgivable things you did, it would be impossible for her to deliberately make trouble with you.”","Li Moying still knew his little fox very well.","Although he doesn’t need Huang Yueli to do anything for his family, Huang Yueli will still take the initiative to consider it for him, and will take care of his face when possible.","Now that she has gotten to the point where they had torn apart all formalities, it was conceivable that Li Leyun and the others must have done something too extreme, and they had completely irritated her!","!!","Li Yuntao stared at Li Moying in disbelief.","He never imagined that Li Moying’s first reaction was not to accuse Huang Yueli, but to question him, an elder!","She’s just a woman. Even if she looks good, she can refine weapons, but how can she compare with the power of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Li Moying didn’t even think about it and he stood on Huang Yueli’s side!","Li Yuntao was stunned for a while, and then he regained his senses and immediately lowered his face, “Young Master, this old man has sacrificed a lot for the Cloudy Qilin Clan for many years, how can you talk like this? Even if this little girl is your woman, but so is the old man. What does it mean to speak to an elder like this, for her? She actually dares to turn her face, and ignores the family interests of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and directly gives the business to the Black Tortoise Clan! Tell me, is this woman too ignorant? ”","After Li Yuntao reacted, he immediately took out the identity of an elder and began to rely on it.","If you really want to say what happened to Li Leyun and himself with Huang Yueli just now, then anyone with a discerning eye will know who was at fault, and looking at how much Li Moying loves that little girl, heavens knows how he will choose.","Therefore, Li Yuntao decisively avoided this topic."]},{"number":3443,"title":"Chapter 3443 - Whatever My Wife Says (7)","paragraphs":["When Li Moying left Amethyst Paramount Palace, he was able to defeat the warriors in the early stage of the Dao Profound Realm. Now, after a few months, his strength must have grown, and Li Yuntao did not dare to say that he would definitely defeat Li Moying.","Besides, even if he tried his best to win, he wouldn’t dare to hurt Li Moying.","As a god-level genius, Li Moying was the hope of the family’s future. If he really dares to attack Li Moying, he will be the enemy of the entire family.","The other warriors present also grew their mouths, their faces full of shock and surprise.","Just now, Li Moying gave Huang Yueli a little arrogance, and they thought that Li Moying was just the same to this lady!","But who would have known that, in such a blink of an eye, Li Moying would so strongly defend the girl in his arms!","Li Leyun was so jealous that she almost fainted!","Even in her dreams that the girl in Li Moying’s arms was herself!","But unfortunately, this man didn’t even look at her.","Li Moying’s attention was all on Huang Yueli in his arms. After talking to Li Yuntao, regardless of his mood, he bent down slightly and directly hugged Huang Yueli.","“Ah!”","Even Huang Yueli didn’t expect him to do this, so he fell back and hurriedly grabbed the clothes on Li Moying’s chest.","Li Moying carefully supported her and adjusted her to a comfortable position.","“Alright, we’re going back first, we’ll talk about it tomorrow.”","What else could Huang Yueli say? She could only nod her head obediently.","Li Moying looked at his little fox with satisfaction, and walked away with her in his arms.","The surrounding warriors were all stunned, unable to even say a word.","Until Li Moying and Huang Yueli disappeared at the end of the corridor, everyone recovered in a trance.","“Young Master Li actually... actually took the young lady out! It’s still... it’s still the princess carry!”","“Oh my, the manner in which he looked at Madame Li! If he could look at me like this, even if I die immediately, I’d be willing to do it!”","“Madame Li is really lucky! Who said just now that the two of them have a bad relationship? If the relationship is not good, would Young Master Li will protect his wife like this? If the relationship is not good, he will carry his wife back? Doing this, it must be because he must have heard Madame Li shouting that she was tired just now!”","“That woman is very lucky! If you hadn’t met Young Master Li in the lower realm and married him, Young Master Li would have gone to the God Realm and seen so many noble ladies of the God Realm with outstanding talents and identities. Get on her!”","“That’s not necessarily true. Men like beautiful ones. Even in the realm of the gods, there are very few beauties like Madame Li!”","There was a lot of discussion and everyone said anything.","However, whether it is envy, jealousy, or unwillingness, the topic revolves around Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","As for Li Leyun and Li Yuntao, they have long been forgotten by everyone!","Grandmaster Xiao couldn’t help but sigh.","However, after all, he is mature and prudent, and he still remembers the purpose of today.","Seeing Xuan Qingling standing at the door thoughtfully, Grandmaster Xiao quickly walked over, “Elder Xuan, Young Miss Xuan, don’t forget to discuss this at the old man’s manor tomorrow. By the way, the old man is still worried that Madame Li will forget, please remind her tomorrow.”","Xuan Qingling nodded quickly and replied, “Grandmaster Xiao, please rest assured, we will be there on time tomorrow!”"]},{"number":3444,"title":"Chapter 3444 - Happy Cooperation (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli and strode out of Grandmaster Xiao’s manor.","At the door, a luxurious carriage was parked, and Li Tianyi and Li Tianer respectfully waited beside the carriage.","Seeing their Young Master and young lady appearing in front of them in such an ambiguous manner, they were already used to it, and they didn’t look sideways the whole time.","Li Moying shoved Huang Yueli into the carriage, and then followed him up.","As soon as the two sat firmly, the carriage began to move.","Huang Yueli was pressed by Li Moying to the seat covered with soft sheepskin, and then was stuffed with a large glass of hot milk.","She hadn’t eaten all day today, so she was already hungry, but just now she was busy coping with the various situations that cropped up and didn’t care.","Now, as soon as she smelled the aroma of milk, she immediately felt hungry.","Huang Yueli held the cup in both hands, raised her head and took a sip. Then she was pleasantly surprised to see that the low table in front of the seat was filled with all kinds of her favorite snacks. She quickly reached out to pick it up, and ate several in a row.","When she was full, she licked the corner of her lips, only to realize that the carriage seemed to be a little too quiet.","The man beside her had been silent since she got in the car.","Apart from handing her milk at the beginning and draping her a white fox fur, there was no other movement.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and turned to look at Li Moying.","The tall and straight man leaned back on the back of the chair, his eyes were slightly closed, his thin lips were slightly pursed, and the hazy moonlight shone through the car window and fell on his angular face, which was as sharp as a knife and axe. A mysterious and cold sexy.","Huang Yueli was immediately bewitched.","She subconsciously got closer, closer and closer...","Seeing that, she was about to lick the corners of Li Moying’s lips.","But at this moment, Li Moying suddenly opened his eyes and tilted his head slightly...","Huang Yueli kissed him but her lips only touched Li Moying’s cheeks.","She was stunned for a moment, and only then did she realize what she had just done, and her cheeks blushed.","She had no idea why but recently, whenever she sees Li Moying, she was inexplicably attracted to his masculinity, and she couldn’t help but want to get closer to him!","However, Li Moying seems to be sticking to her even more...","Wouldn’t it be because the two of them practiced the double cultivation technique together?","When Huang Yueli was distracted for a short time, she suddenly found that Li Moying seemed to move to the side, avoiding her touch without a trace.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a while, then laughed.","Turns out this man hasn’t finished being arrogant at all!","She looked normal at Grandmaster Xiao’s manor just now, it was just to maintain her instincts, but now she becomes arrogant again as soon as she gets in the car.","Huang Yueli approached slowly, “Why don’t you let me kiss?”","Li Moying’s cold eyes slowly swept across the girl’s extraordinarily beautiful and refined face under the moonlight, “Someone didn’t wipe her mouth clean after eating!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and then she thought that she really didn’t wipe her mouth when she ate just now!","She subconsciously stuck out the tip of her tongue, licked the corner of her mouth, and as expected, she felt a milky smell...","Boo hoo, she was really dirty, and she was despised by her husband!","Huang Yueli was annoyed and didn’t notice that the man above her head saw her licking her lips, and the colour at the bottom of her eyes instantly became darker!","“I’ll go wipe it!”","She turned her head to find a handkerchief, but someone grabbed her shoulders!"]},{"number":3445,"title":"Chapter 3445 - Happy Cooperation (2)","paragraphs":["“What are you doing...”","Li Moying’s tall body suddenly pressed down and pressed her onto the back of the chair.","At the same time, he blocked Huang Yueli’s lips with all his strength, and his scorching kiss was like a fiery wave, instantly drowning her.","Huang Yueli struggled for a while at first, but soon, she was losing her own ground under Li Moying’s passion. She forgot where she was and what she was doing. The only thing she could remember in her heart was that there was only her man in front of her, and the aura on him made her feel extremely familiar and reassuring.","While the two of them were ambiguous, suddenly, the carriage vibrated.","!!","Huang Yueli suddenly snapped back to her senses, and only then did she realize that Li Moying had unknowingly laid her down on the spacious seat of the carriage, laying flat on her back, and her belt had been torn off by him.","Huang Yueli’s face became hot for a while, and she quickly reached out to push him.","“You... let me go! We’re in a carriage!”","Although the two of them have done all kinds of shameful things now, they may pass through the downtown area at any time on the moving carriage...","This was still unimaginable for Huang Yueli!","Li Moying’s eyes were full of deep darkness, and his body shook slightly.","However, the strength he held on Huang Yueli’s shoulder did not relax immediately, and his body was still hanging above Huang Yueli, full of oppression.","“Young Master, Young Madame, we have returned to the manor. May I ask you two...”","Suddenly, a voice broke the stalemate between the two.","It had been a while since the carriage arrived at its destination. Li Tianyi and Li Tianer waited in front of the door for a long time, but they did not see their Young Master and young lady get off the carriage.","Due to the sound-isolating formation engraved on the carriage of the carriage, the sound could only be transmitted from the outside to the inside in one direction. Therefore, they couldn’t hear the movement inside at all, and could only wait outside.","After waiting for a long time, the two were worried that something might have happened so only then did they dare to speak.","After Li Tianyi spoke, it didn’t take long for the carriage door to open.","Li Moying took Huang Yueli’s hand and got off the carriage.","Huang Yueli was wearing Li Moying’s fur cloak, her hair was hurriedly pulled up again, it looked a little messy, and her face was flushed.","Li Moying, on the other hand, had on a grim expression as he gave Li Tianyi a cold look, then took his wife and walked forward without saying a word.","When Li Tianyi saw the glare, cold sweat broke out behind his back.","He he he... Did he do something wrong just now?","...","After the two entered the room, Li Moying’s icy expression eased a little.","Huang Yueli tugged at his sleeve, “Are you still angry? You’ve been angry all night already, are you still not angry enough? Or else, I’ll cry and show you!”","Huang Yueli now has a lot of experience in coaxing her husband, and she knows that Li Moying hates her crying the most.","Even if she just casually threatened, he couldn’t stand it.","Sure enough, Li Moying’s expression changed as soon as she said those words, he grabbed her waist, took her into his arms, and held her tightly.","“When did I get angry? When did I show you a bad face? Never!”","Huang Yueli laughed secretly, after being arrogant, he still didn’t admit it!","“Then while you were at Grandmaster Xiao’s place just now, and you deliberately ignored me. Everyone said that I was...” She poked Li Moying’s hard chest in dissatisfaction."]},{"number":3446,"title":"Chapter 3446 - Happy Cooperation (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying frowned, “Who talked about you just now? I’ll send someone to catch him tomorrow and teach him a lesson!”","When Huang Yueli heard the tyrannical words out of his mouth, she raised her eyebrows amusedly.","This man was usually calm and aloof. Only when he encounters something related to her will he suddenly become so naive...","She still had an aggrieved expression on her face, “What does it have to do with gossiping with others? It’s clearly you who bullied me! Didn’t I just go home a little late? You are so cruel to me!”","“When did I get mad at you?” Li Moying retorted subconsciously.","But then, he squeezed Huang Yueli’s slender waist, lowered his head, and looked at the innocent little face in his arms with some displeasure.","“Besides, shouldn’t I say a few words to you? How many times have I told you that the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s affairs are handled by me, and you should try not to conflict with them. After all, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has been in the God Realm for countless years. The huge power of the clan, it is very difficult for you to deal with any elder in the family! What if you are injured and taken away?”","Huang Yueli blinked, “You don’t know the situation at the time! Those people are all scolding you, saying that if you can like a woman like Li Leyun, you must be a scumbag! I can hear you say that! Besides, on a formal occasion like today, it is still very safe in Grandmaster Xiao’s manor. No matter how domineering your Cloudy Qilin Clan is, you can’t bully an ordinary weak girl in such a place, right?”","She really felt that she did nothing wrong.","Although she also knew that Li Moying definitely didn’t like her taking risks, Huang Yueli took all aspects of her self-consciousness into consideration and did not take any risks at all.","Li Moying glared at her, “You’re right?”","Looking at the cold light flashing in the man’s dark pupils, Huang Yueli subconsciously shrank her neck, feeling a little guilty.","However, she soon raised her chin again and looked directly at Li Moying.","“I know you’re worried about me, but I’ve thought about it many times before I show up as my true identity! I won’t do anything really dangerous!”","Li Moying was speechless for a while.","His little fox is good at everything, but he is so capable, sometimes it makes him, a husband, quite powerless.","If it were another girl, knowing that there are so many people in the Cloudy Qilin Clan who disagreed with their marriage, and that there are many experts in the Dao Profound Realm thinking of dealing with her, I am afraid that she would have been scared and hiding in her husband’s arms, trembling like a little deer!","Li Moying would rather have Huang Yueli hide in his arms and let him solve all the troubles.","However, he also knew that it was impossible...","But he at least hoped that before this little fox did anything, she could tell him first, otherwise he would really have a sudden cardiac arrest!","Huang Yueli was tightly wrapped in his arms, she looked like a small one, with her fair complexion and delicate facial features, from the outside, she looked like a weak and pitiful doll.","But only he knows that under the appearance of this peerless beauty, there was a strong heart that couldn’t be suppressed by anything!","“Next time you do something like this, can you send someone to tell me? Do you know how worried I was when I learned that you and the two Divine Generals were quarreling today?” Li Moying sighed deeply.","Huang Yueli’s heart softened immediately."]},{"number":3447,"title":"Chapter 3447 - Happy Cooperation (4)","paragraphs":["However, before she could say anything, Li Moying stretched out his fingers and raised her chin, and the hot breath landed on her lips again.","“I can do anything for you, but I can’t tolerate anything untoward that happens to you... Do you understand?”","The man’s deep mesmerizing voice resounded closely in her ear, by her side.","Huang Yueli wanted to say that she understood, and she understood what he meant.","However, she couldn’t find any chance to speak, and her attention was quickly diverted.","!!","...","The next day, Huang Yueli woke up very early.","It was rare for Li Moying to wake up later than her, and was still asleep. Even in his sleep, he leaned his head against her neck, as if he was afraid that she would disappear in the middle of the night.","Huang Yueli tilted her head slightly, and she could see Li Moying’s handsome face.","In the morning light, his long eyelashes were like two small fans, leaving a light shadow under his eyes.","The face that usually looks cold and severe, now has a soft, gentle and pure expression, like a newborn baby.","This makes him look even more handsome and extraordinary than at night, and has a contrasting cuteness. With such a unique appearance, it is no wonder that so many girls like him...","However, this man was now hers,all hers!","While thinking about it, Huang Yueli secretly kissed Li Moying’s lips.","She just wanted to touch it lightly, so as soon as she touched it, she regretted it.","At that moment, Li Moying’s arm suddenly tightened, and at the same time, he turned over, lowered his head, and flipped her over.","“Uuuu-!”","Huang Yueli was taken aback by the sudden attack, but somehow she remembered the purpose of getting up early this morning, and hurriedly pushed Li Moying several times before pushing him away a little.","However, Li Moying just propped up her body with her elbows, her pitch-black ink pupils narrowed slightly, and looked down at her without saying a word, not intending to let her free.","The long hair, which was usually neatly tied in a white jade crown, was messy at this time and slipped down from the corner of Li Moying’s forehead, making him even more lazy and calm, like a dormant cheetah, ready to fall in front of him at any time. The little fox was caught in the trap and he was ready to swallow it!","Huang Yueli shook her head quickly.","She... she was thinking about something!","“Moying, look, it’s already dawn, we can... we can get up!”","Li Moying stared at her calmly, “Who said it’s dawn?”","Huang Yueli subconsciously looked at the window.","The early morning sun was shining through the gaps in the curtains, which was particularly dazzling.","But then, the curtains suddenly moved automatically without wind, as if being pushed by an invisible force, moving on their own, blocking every gap, and not even a bit of sunlight could penetrate.","The light in the room suddenly dimmed.","Although it’s not as late as night, it makes it difficult to see things around.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, and glared at the man in front of her, “What are you doing? Aren’t you a tad too childish? It’s dawn when it’s dawn. Alright, don’t stay in bed, get up!”","Li Moying’s eyes darkened, “You say your man is childish? It seems that I have to prove myself...”","He said, bowed his head slightly, and leaned towards Huang Yueli with his beautifully curved lips.","However, what he touched was the skin of Huang Yueli’s palm."]},{"number":3448,"title":"Chapter 3448 - Happy Cooperation (5)","paragraphs":["Li Moying was stunned for a moment.","Taking advantage of the moment while he was still in a daze, Huang Yueli used some profound strength to push him aside.","However, she was so anxious and her strength was out of control, so she accidentally pushed Li Moying out of bed.","“Boom!”","The sound of heavy objects falling to the ground sounded!","!!","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, she couldn’t even react!","When she realized what had happened, she quickly jumped up from the bed, grabbed the sheets to block her in front of her, and at the same time used her profound strength to sweep away the curtains that were pulled tightly closed by Li Moying before.","The sun shone into the room, revealing a dazed handsome man half lying beside the bed.","Even with such an embarrassed posture, Li Moying still looks full of indescribable charm. Every inch of his muscles was so perfect, like a craftsman had spent his entire lifetime carefully crafting it...","At this juncture, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but stare at him a few more times.","Then, she said embarrassingly, “Cough, husband, are you all right... Have you been injured anywhere?”","Li Moying sat on the ground and glared at her coldly.","Huang Yueli touched her nose with some guilt, and at the same time, she sneaked a peek down his abdominal lines. The danger she had felt earlier had receded and all was calm.","The crisis was over!","Actually, it’s not that she didn’t want to accompany Li Moying to get up early for double cultivation, it’s just that she really...really had something important on today!","Huang Yueli gave Li Moying a sweet smile, “Husband, I’m sorry! However, I have a lot of things to do today. When I come back in the evening, I will serve you a delicious apology!”","After she finished speaking, she didn’t eve go to him to pull him up but hurriedly ran behind the screen to change her clothes.","Although the sound just now sounded a bit scary, Li Moying was also an exponent of the Heart Profound Realm.","Moreover, she knew with her toes that if she dared to go over now, that shrewd man would never let her go easily.","In addition, the two of them are not wearing any clothes now, so the result... she was certain that she was going to be late!"]},{"number":3449,"title":"Chapter 3449 - Happy Cooperation (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli stood up from the chair, turned around and walked in front of Li Moying.","“Husband, you are so kind to me! The hairpin is so beautiful, thank you!”","When Li Moying heard her words, the corners of his mouth were obviously raised, but he still spoke in a very arrogant tone, “There’s no need for any thanks, just don’t kick me out of bed if you don’t agree!”","“Uh, that was all a mistake! It was a mistake!”","Huang Yueli looked up at the sky and became a little anxious, “It’s getting late, I made an appointment with Grandmaster Xiao to meet at and I’m only left with half an hour now, I should leave...”","Li Moying grabbed her shoulders and pulled back his little fox who had already taken two steps forward.","“Wait a minute, you have to have breakfast!”","“Ah? But, I’m too late...”","“Let them wait before it’s too late!” Li Moying said firmly.","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, Li Moying is really getting stronger and stronger, she is a junior after all, it would be a bit rude to let an old man like Grandmaster Xiao wait!","However, she also knows that what Li Moying believes will not be shaken by anything.","So, I could only sit down and have breakfast with him.","She was in a hurry, so she ate quickly. Li Moying still had half of her plate, and she had already finished it.","Huang Yueli raised her head, looked at Li Moying eating gracefully, and said, “I’m done eating, then I...”","Just then, someone knocked on the door.","Immediately, Li Tianyi reported from the outside: “Young Master, Young Madam, there is a Black Tortoise Clan’s Young Miss from the Black Tortoise Clan who said that she is a friend of Young Madam and came to find Young Madam.”","Huang Yueli gave an “ah” and hurriedly said: “She must have come to find me to go to Grandmaster Xiao’s manor with me, I’ll go right now!”","Huang Yueli stood up and was about to go out.","Li Moying followed and stood up, “I’ll take you there.”","Huang Yueli blinked and looked back at him, “No need! Since Xuan Qingling is here, she must have brought the Black Tortoise Clan’s carriage and guards. I’ll just go in her carriage.”","Li Moying glanced at her and said lightly, “There’s no need for anyone else to send my wife. Besides, last night, you agreed...”","Huang Yueli’s mind buzzed, and she immediately remembered how, under Li Moying’s various methods, she dazedly agreed to let him pick her up every day.","She couldn’t help blushing and glared at him.","“Since you don’t find it too troublesome, and you want to be my bodyguard in such a hurry, then you should come! But don’t interfere with the deal while I’m discussing it with my friends, I won’t be able to care about you then!”","Li Moying glanced at her noncommittally, but did not speak.","However, when Huang Yueli got up and went out, he walked by Huang Yueli’s side without any haste.","Huang Yueli was a little impatient, so she walked quickly.","Not long after, he arrived at the hall.","“Young Miss Xuan, you’ve been waiting for a long time! You are too polite, why did you come out of your way and come all the way here? We can meet directly at Grandmaster Xiao’s place, there’s no need to trouble you!”","Huang Yueli walked in in a hurry, saw Xuan Qingling sitting and drinking tea, and said a few polite words.","Xuan Qingling shook her head, “It’s alright, it’s on the way. Grandmaster Xiao specially asked me to come over yesterday, worried about you...”","Halfway through her words, she saw Li Moying who was following behind Huang Yueli. Halfway through her words, she stopped abruptly.","“Why are you worried about me?” Huang Yueli asked curiously when she saw that she didn’t say anything."]},{"number":3450,"title":"Chapter 3450 - Happy Cooperation (7)","paragraphs":["“Err, well, it’s...it’s because of what happened yesterday...I was afraid that you’ll be in a bad mood..”","As soon as the words were about to fly out of Xuan Qingling’s mouth, she swallowed them back and gave a random reason instead.","In fact, she understood what Grandmaster Xiao meant yesterday. He was afraid that Li Moying would get angry with Huang Yueli when they went back but now, looking at the inseparable appearance of these two people, it was clear that Grandmaster Xiao is overthinking...","This little couple was clearly in love! Look at those pink bubbles!","Speaking of which, a man like Li Moying who looks so ruthless on the outside was actually so sweet to his wife. If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, it would be hard to believe.","Huang Yueli didn’t suspect her at all, she simply smiled and declared, “Hmph! It’s not that I’m bragging but back while we were still in Soaring Heavens Continent, I had many rivals in love! But all those who dared to come and provoke our relationship all ended defeat!”","Although Huang Yueli didn’t think much about it, Li Moying heard what Xuan Qingling meant, and glanced at her coldly.","Xuan Qingling was usually a firm-willed person, but when he glared at her like that, she felt her scalp tingle and she couldn’t help but sit down at Huang Yueli’s side.","Huang Yueli asked strangely, “Young Miss Xuan, what’s wrong with you? Why is your face a little ugly? Are you feeling unwell?”","Xuan Qingling shook her head, “It’s alright, alright! I just want to say, it’s getting late, or we should leave early, go to Grandmaster Xiao’s place, and finalize the business! There are many people who covet this big business. If you make a little decision, you can also rest assured earlier, so as to avoid unintended consequences.”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, she smiled slightly.","She knows best that this deal would not fly away!","After all, she was the real boss behind the scenes.","However, since Xuan Qingling said so, she did not object and stood up directly.","“Alright then, let’s go now!”","The two walked out of the gate together, and in addition to the black carriage of the Black Tortoise Clan, there was a silver-white carriage parked.","Not only does this carriage look luxurious and comfortable, but the horses that pull the carriage were spirit beasts of the eighth rank and above.","Xuan Qingling couldn’t help but look back at Huang Yueli, gaining a new understanding of her favorability.","Even a master at the level of the elders of the Twelve Great God Clans, very few people ride in such a luxurious car when they travel. Compared with the carriage that Huang Yueli was riding in, the one she was riding in was very shabby...","However, what surprised her even more was what happened after.","Li Moying supported Huang Yueli as she stepped into the carriage. However, he did not stop there, but got into the carriage himself.","When Xuan Qingling saw this scene, her eyes widened.","Could it be that Li Moying also wanted to personally send Huang Yueli to Grandmaster Xiao’s manor?","As the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, was he so free?","Huang Yueli left to do such a little thing, and she didn’t even go out of the city gate, he had to send her personally!","However, this was indeed the case.","After Li Moying got into the carriage, the silver-white carriage began to move at a very fast speed.","Xuan Qingling saw that the other party quickly ran a distance, and hurriedly ordered his bodyguard.","“Hurry up, keep up with the carriage of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Not long after, the two carriages stopped in front of Grandmaster Xiao’s manor, and Grandmaster Xiao personally came out to greet them.","When he saw Li Moying behind Huang Yueli, he was also taken aback, “Is Young Master Li also participating in the negotiation today?”"]},{"number":3451,"title":"Chapter 3451 - Happy Cooperation (8)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli shook her head quickly, “There’s no such thing! He just sent me here! He’s going back soon!”","As she explained, she saw that Li Moying was still motionless so she gently pulled on his sleeve.","“Alright, go back early, I’ll go back on time in the evening, you don’t have to come pick me up specially, it’s a waste of your cultivation time...”","“I’ll come pick you up!” Li Moying frowned slightly, interrupting her words.","Huang Yueli blinked, “I really don’t need it, yesterday was just an accident, today...”","“I will come to pick you up!” Li Moying repeated again.","Then, before Huang Yueli could speak again, he raised her chin, brought her luscious lips closer, and gave a light peck.","“I’m leaving first! Today... I hope no one will disrespect my wife again!”","He glanced at Grandmaster Xiao and a few members of the Black Tortoise Clan with a warning, before turning around and getting into the carriage.","Huang Yueli came back to her senses, and a faint blush appeared on her face.","This man really... actually kissed her in front of so many people! And even said such words!","Grandmaster Xiao treats her pretty well?","Having said that, the corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth were still upturned.","Grandmaster Xiao was so angry that his beard flew up, but after looking at Huang Yueli, he didn’t say anything. He just snorted twice, turned around and left, “Follow up, I have a lot of things to confirm today!”","Grandmaster Xiao led them into a well-decorated reception room in the backyard. The walls of this room were painted with layers of soundproof formations, which was enough to see how much Grandmaster Xiao attached to this negotiation.","After everyone was seated, Xuan Qingling looked around and asked strangely, “Grandmaster Xiao, may I ask... Young Master Li, who drew the maps of these Spirit Armaments... why isn’t he here? When will he come?”","Xuan Zifan also said: “Exactly, I have heard people say that this time the twenty illustrations were drawn by this talented young Spiritual Armament Master, and I have long wanted to meet him. I thought we could meet him at the competition but I didn’t expect that he did not show up. Today is just a negotiation, to confirm the details of the cooperation, he should come? ”","When Grandmaster Xiao heard this, there was a trace of embarrassment on his face.","“This... I can only disappoint you. This old man also thought that Young Master Li would come over today, but who knows, just a quarter of an hour ago, he sent someone to send a letter to the old man, saying that something cropped up today and he is unable to come. He also mentioned that this old man should sign a contract with you on his behalf. He also sent his own Spirit Armament badge as a guarantee.”","As Grandmaster Xiao said this, not knowing whether it was intentional or not, he glanced at Huang Yueli.","Immediately, he took out a badge from his sleeve and swiped it on the special mechanism, revealing the name of the badge owner.","“Li Yuehuang, junior Spiritual Armament Master...” Xuan Qingling read it out in a low voice, and a look of shock flashed across her eyes, “He’s actually only a junior Spiritual Armament Master, and about the same age as me! This... This is too shocking! This is no ordinary young man!”","In the realm of the gods, at the age of thirty he has only just reached adulthood. To be able to become a full-fledged Spiritual Armament Master at this age was quite outstanding.","However, he could actually improve so many kinds of standard Spirit Armaments and even directly created a new method of refining!","Such an achievement was simply incredible and unimaginable."]},{"number":3452,"title":"Chapter 3452 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (1)","paragraphs":["Grandmaster Xiao put away the badge of the Spiritual Armament Master and sighed: “Young Master Li’s talent is not just what you see on the surface, he is indeed an amazing person! It’s just that his temper is a little eccentric, sometimes even this old man have been played around by him, and I don’t know how to respect the old and the wise! In short, please bear with me!”","The people of the Black Tortoise Clan waved their hands again and again, saying that they were not in the way.","“Real geniuses have a bit of temper. This is really normal!”","“Isn’t it? It’s just that I didn’t get to meet Young Master Li in the end, so I’m still a little disappointed...”","“A genius like Young Master Li, who has achieved such achievements in armament refining at a young age, will definitely be a top Sky Gem Grandmaster again in a few decades!”","Grandmaster Xiao nodded and said, “In terms of achievement in spirit art, he will definitely be above the old man in the future! It’s this kid who really makes people worry! It’s unreliable, completely unreliable!”","Huang Yueli was so sweaty that she didn’t even dare to say a word.","Grandmaster Xiao is so resentful to her, so persistently and desperately complaining about her!","Although, she is indeed a little bit unreliable...","Well, she is very unreliable, and she has pushed Grandmaster Xiao out of the tank several times, but, isn’t she a last resort...","Fortunately, although Grandmaster Xiao has a lot of resentment, he is still very responsible.","After a few chats, and after confirming that the designer of the map would not appear, Xuan Zifan quickly entered a state of negotiation.","He took the initiative to take out a sample contract drafted by the Black Tortoise Clan and handed it to Grandmaster Xiao.","“This is the cooperation condition proposed by our Black Tortoise Clan. Grandmaster Xiao,?please take a look first.”","Huang Yueli had not seen it either, and Xuan Qingling also handed her a copy.","Huang Yueli skimmed over it roughly and found that the terms were quite reasonable.","After deducting the cost of the jade quartz obtained from the sale of these improved Spirit Armaments, the profit was divided into ten shares.","When Xuan Zifan saw that Grandmaster Xiao had almost seen it, he explained: “How the 60% of the money is distributed between Young Master Li and Grandmaster Xiao is none of our Black Tortoise Clan’s business. Of the 40% of our Black Tortoise Clan’s profits, we will take out one-fifth to Young Miss Li, as a reward for Young Miss Li winning this business for us.”","As he said that, he looked at Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, I also know that this income is a little less for you. Without you, our Black Tortoise Clan would not have been able to get this deal! To manufacture so many Spirit Armaments, we also have to use a lot of family resources, and many relationships in the clan must be settled, please forgive me.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she was quite satisfied.","She didn’t plan to split the money from the Black Tortoise Clan. After all, this business was originally hers, she gave it to herself, don’t get it too easily!","However, the Black Tortoise Clan was very knowledgeable, and they even offered her money.","One-fifth of the profit is actually not low, because she doesn’t have to do anything, just take the money! It’s just a competition. Compared with the large amount of work that Black Tortoise Clan need to complete to produce Spirit Armaments, it can be said that it is not worth mentioning.","Moreover, Xuan Zifan did not have the air of a Dao Profound Realm, and he spoke very politely, she really had nothing to object to."]},{"number":3453,"title":"Chapter 3453 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli nodded, “Elder Xuan is so polite, then we’ll do as you said!”","Xuan Zifan smiled, then turned to look at Grandmaster Xiao again.","Huang Yueli was also waiting for Grandmaster Xiao’s reply.","Originally, Huang Yueli was a little worried about leaving the negotiations to Grandmaster Xiao. After all, Grandmaster Xiao was old and a little stubborn, so he might not know how to adapt.","However, now that the Black Tortoise Clan was so straightforward, the conditions were quite reasonable. This matter was simple, Grandmaster Xiao only needed to nod his head and it would be over.","!!","A few people looked at Grandmaster Xiao, but Grandmaster Xiao seemed to be unaware of their gaze. He was slowly flipping through the pages, and he read it over and over several times. He was not in a hurry at all.","After waiting for a while, he put down the contract in his hand.","“Elder Xuan, your contract is really a bit unkind, isn’t it?” Grandmaster Xiao said, dissatisfied: “According to the old man, this profit distribution should be at 30% and 70%, you’re 30%!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli opened her mouth wide and looked at Grandmaster Xiao in surprise.","She was also worried that Grandmaster Xiao was always confused, but she didn’t expect that Grandmaster Xiao was more powerful than her, and this bargaining power was really amazing!","The share of thirty and seventy!","Even Huang Yueli herself was too embarrassed to say that.","Huang Yueli has always been very rude to people who have offended her, but she and the Black Tortoise Clan are serious partners and want to have a good relationship. In this case, she feels that four or six is ??a comparison. reasonable distribution.","Unexpectedly, Grandmaster Xiao is so cruel!","Sure enough, Xuan Zifan also felt a little unhappy.","He sat up straight and said sternly: “Grandmaster Xiao, what do you mean? I think I have given enough sincerity. In this contract, we have considered all aspects of cooperation, even the distribution of profits. The ratio is also well thought out. When other Spiritual Armament Masters cooperate with major forces, the party who provides the map usually gets 40% to 50% of the profit. We gave 60% this time, which is already very large proportion.”","After listening, Grandmaster Xiao, he nodded and said, “This old man also knows that 40% to 50% of what you said is indeed the current market situation.”","Xuan Zifan breathed a sigh of relief when he heard the words, “Grandmaster Xiao, it’s good that you know about this situation. I’ve also heard that you have always been fair, so you shouldn’t deliberately embarrass us about this, right?”","Grandmaster Xiao twisted his gray beard and said, “However, this old man insists that the profit distribution must be divided 30% and 70%!”","Xuan Zifan immediately frowned, “Grandmaster Xiao, you are...”","Grandmaster Xiao said to him: “What you said is only for ordinary Spirit Armaments. The illustrations that Young Master Li took out this time are unique! Don’t look at it as a low-level Spirit Armaments, but there are several that have reached the level of advanced Spirit Armaments! Moreover, the cost of refining is also very low.”","Xuan Zifan said: “Grandmaster Xiao, we also admit what you said. Therefore, 60% of the profit has been given, which is very high. After all, this is only a low-level Spirit Armament...”","Grandmaster Xiao waved his hand and interrupted him again.","“You still don’t understand! Young Master Li’s Spirit Armaments were made with a brand-new refining method! Do you know what this means? It means that even if the finished product leaks out in the future, your competitors will not be able to copy it!”"]},{"number":3454,"title":"Chapter 3454 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (3)","paragraphs":["Xuan Zifan had no choice but to nod when he heard his words, “You are indeed right, but... our Black Tortoise Clan refines Spirit Armaments, and the cost is not low. If you directly split 70% of the profits, what else do we earn?”","Grandmaster Xiao said with a disapproving smile: “You guys think that you don’t earn enough, so you can raise the selling price a little bit more! Since no one can imitate these Spirit Armaments, then you are the only supplier! When the time comes, you’ll know how popular it’ll be! It’s a little more expensive, but there’s bound to be many people rushing to get it!”","She had to admit that Grandmaster Xiao was indeed very knowledgeable about buying and selling Spirit Armaments.","Xuan Zifan pondered for a while, and finally nodded with a wry smile: “Grandmaster Xiao, you are indeed shrewd enough, I can’t win you in words! Since this is the case, the profit distribution plan can be modified as you said, but can the number of Spirit Armament be increased as appropriate? Only a hundred pieces of each type of Spirit Armament can be produced, which is too small! To be honest, there are more than a hundred juniors in our family who want these Spirit Armaments!”","Grandmaster Xiao shook his head, “This is not negotiable.”","Xuan Zifan was suddenly a little unhappy, and his tone became a little more serious, “Grandmaster Xiao, you can’t be like this. Our Black Tortoise Clan has already made such a big concession, and you also have to take a step back. This is the sincerity of doing business.”","Grandmaster Xiao sighed, “It’s not that this old man refuses to promise you, but the allied armies only agreed to let Young Master Li refine a hundred pieces and sell them privately. If this quantity is too large, it will be known to the allied armies, and it will be difficult for us to explain to the allied armies. After all, we are just small Spiritual Armament Masters, and we are alone , different from a big family clan like yours!”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her eyes widened immediately.","I’ll be damned!","This was really unexpected!","Grandmaster Xiao, who usually looks serious and upright, not only knows how to negotiate, but also speaks at such a level.","Officially, they had made their stance. However, the Black Tortoise Clan has a great background and power hence the allied armies would not fault them because of these trivial things. Since they don’t have enough, so let them figure out how to do it themselves?","Anyway, Grandmaster Xiao made up his mind to pretend to be innocent.","This trick was too insidious and too cunning!","However, from Huang Yueli’s perspective, she naturally couldn’t help applauding Grandmaster Xiao in her heart.","Xuan Zifan, who is a wise man, immediately understands it.","“I understand what Grandmaster Xiao means. Since this is the case, I have no other opinion. Let’s act according to the content of the contract.”","Grandmaster Xiao also nodded and said, “That’s how it should be! Elder Xuan is so sensible, presumably, our cooperation will be very pleasant!”","The two sides, represented by Xuan Zifan and Grandmaster Xiao, signed their names on the contract.","Huang Yueli watched from the side, excited inside.","This was the first big deal she made in the God Realm, and it was very memorable.","Although it is restricted by various aspects, the profit of this business has not reached the maximum, but after experiencing the impoverished life when she first arrived in the God Realm, Huang Yueli was still very excited to be able to get such a sum of money now. .","After signing, Grandmaster Xiao invited them to stay for lunch."]},{"number":3455,"title":"Chapter 3455 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (4)","paragraphs":["During the banquet, Grandmaster Xiao was full of curiosity about Huang Yueli, and the topic kept revolving around her.","“Madame Li, did you learn your armament refining in the lower realm? I heard that the armament refining in the lower realm is very different from that in our God Realm. Even after arriving in the God Realm, many famous Armament Masters from the lower realm take decades of hard work but still can’t become an official Spiritual Armament Master! You are quite talented...”","Huang Yueli smiled and said: “This is also a coincidence, the refining techniques I learned in the lower realm seem to be not much different from those in the God Realm, so I have read a few books of the God Realm myself, and I have learned a lot. Speaking of which, this is really my luck... By the way, today thanks to the blessing of Elder Xuan, I also made a fortune, I toast to you!”","Huang Yueli didn’t want the topic to keep spinning around her, so after a brief explanation, she raised her glass and wanted to change the topic.","Xuan Zifan had a drink with her and was also in a good mood, and praised Huang Yueli well.","!!","“It’s all thanks to Madame Li this time! Don’t worry, our Black Tortoise Clan will take your favor. If you encounter any trouble in the future, the Black Tortoise Clan will definitely stand by you!”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “Then I will thank Elder Xuan first.”","Elder Xuan nodded with a smile, and began to talk about the arrangement of the Black Tortoise Clan for this business.","Just as Huang Yueli breathed a sigh of relief, she heard Grandmaster Xiao turn the subject back to her.","“By the way, the old man just remembered that Young Master Li of our Sky Gem Glass Chamber is also a Spiritual Armament Master who has ascended from the lower realm, and the ascension time is not long. I really didn’t expect that all the Spiritual Armament Masters in the lower realm are so talented now. , it really makes this old man both shocked and admired...”","Xuan Qingling had been sitting by the side silently eating vegetables, but when she heard this, she looked over curiously.","“Young Master Li? Which Young Master Li? Grandmaster Xiao, you are talking about Young Master Li who drew the illustrations of these Spirit Armaments!”","Grandmaster Xiao nodded and said, “Isn’t that right? Young Master Li is still a cultivator from the lower realms. I didn’t expect that his Spirit Armament refining technique was unique, and the power of each type of spiritual Spirit Armament was improved by his unique technique. So much! It’s hard to imagine.”","Xuan Qingling said thoughtfully: “This Young Master Li is really an amazing person! It’s a pity that I haven’t seen him when I came to your place several times.”","Grandmaster Xiao laughed and said meaningfully: “This is not necessarily, maybe, Young Miss Xuan’s luck is much better than others, and there will be many opportunities in the future to discuss spirit art with Young Master Li. ”","Xuan Qingling also showed a smile, “I hope so! If there is a chance to see Young Master Li, Grandmaster Xiao must remember to notify me!”","“Haha, this is a trivial matter, it’s a small effort!”","Listening to the conversation between the two, Huang Yue jumped inwardly.","For some reason, she always felt that Grandmaster Xiao seemed to have something to say today.","Could it be that he actually saw her true identity?","But, doesn’t it make sense? Her disguise was seamless, except for Li Moying, who is very familiar with her breath, it should be impossible for others to see through it.","However, the various reactions of Grandmaster Xiao today are really too abnormal...","Fortunately, Grandmaster Xiao started to chat with Elder Xuan the next moment."]},{"number":3456,"title":"Chapter 3456 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (5)","paragraphs":["This was a long lunch and by the time it was over, it was already approaching evening.","Seeing that it was getting dark, Xuan Zifan and Xuan Qingling got up to say goodbye.","Huang Yueli hesitated for a while, thinking about whether to go back by herself.","There was still half an hour before her appointment with Li Moying. It is estimated that Li Moying has not arrived yet, but if she goes back by herself, she is afraid that the arrogant man will get angry with her again.","Coaxing her husband may be interesting at times, but it doesn’t mean that they should quarrel every day.","Just when she was hesitating, Grandmaster Xiao suddenly said, “Madame Li, can you stay for a bit? I have something to ask you.”","When Grandmaster Xiao said this, Huang Yueli couldn’t say no, so she could only stay.","As soon as Xuan Zifan and Xuan Qingling left, Grandmaster Xiao snorted coldly.","“Madame Li, Young Master Li! You are good, isn’t it interesting to play this old man?”","Huang Yueli actually had a hunch for a long time, and it wasn’t particularly surprising to hear this.","However, seeing that Grandmaster Xiao was so angry, she still pretended to be shocked, “Xiao...Grandmaster Xiao, how...how did you know? I thought...”","“Do you think you’ve hidden it well?” Grandmaster Xiao glared at her and said angrily.","Huang Yueli laughed dryly, “Grandmaster Xiao, this... I actually didn’t intend to hide it from you, but I also have my own difficulties, and this is a last resort.”","Grandmaster Xiao said displeased: “What troubles can you have? You are incredible! Not only are you the genius Spiritual Armament Master that’s rare in the God Realm, but also the fiancée of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Oh, yes, this old man even heard that according to the news from Blessed City, your cultivation is also very good! I heard that even the heavenly genius Lan Mengqing of the Empyrean Fox clan was defeated by you, and you even killed the Sky Devil?”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she finally understood."]},{"number":3457,"title":"Chapter 3457 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (6)","paragraphs":["In their eyes, she was just Li Moying’s wife.","This situation originally made Huang Yueli very unhappy, but now, it has become an important blindfold for her to hide her identity.","Huang Yueli’s thoughts started turning and she went through the cause and effect in her mind.","She shook her head helplessly and said, “Grandmaster Xiao, don’t think about it, my husband is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If the Cloudy Qilin Clan knew that I was the one who did the illustrations, they would definitely force my husband to make me hand over the illustrations, or give them the business, and I just don’t want to give it to them! Otherwise, I won’t hold any public competition and I’ll just show the illustrations to my husband!”","Grandmaster Xiao was originally righteous and had questioned her.","!!","But after listening to Huang Yueli’s explanations, he felt that it was quite reasonable, and the expression on his face relaxed a bit.","“Speaking of which, it’s true. If the Cloudy Qilin Clan knew that you had such a high talent for Spirit Spirit Armaments, they would definitely put unimaginable pressure on you, tying you to the Cloudy Qilin Clan at all costs and asking you to give them the illustrations!”","Having said this, Grandmaster Xiao paused again, frowned, and said inexplicably: “No, why don’t you want to give the illustrations to the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Although it seems that the Cloudy Qilin Clan has a bad attitude towards you now. However, if they know that you are a genius of armament refining that is rare in ten thousand years, their attitude will definitely be different! By the way, if you can defeat Lan Mengqing, it means that you are at least a genius in martial arts! You have such a talent, even marrying Young Master Li is enough!”","“As for the fact that you don’t have a family behind you, and you don’t have enough identity, it depends on your talent in Spirit Armament. This old man reports to the President, and the entire Sky Gem Glass Chamber can stand behind you as your background! We Sky Gem Glass Chamber can stand behind you. Although the pavilion is not strong in force, none of the major God Clans dares to offend us.”","After listening to him, Huang Yueli just shook her head.","“Grandmaster Xiao, I understand what you mean, but things are not as simple as you think. The ancient gods have been inherited for millions of years, and the internal relations are complicated. It is said that the daughters of many branches of the Cloudy Qilin Clan want to marry my husband, they represent the interests of their own branch behind them, and it is definitely not something that an outsider like me can shake! Even if I am talented, it will be the same!”","Although Grandmaster Xiao doesn’t like power and tricks, he has a lot of experience, and he has somewhat heard of the secrets within these big families.","He nodded, “What you said makes sense. If Young Master Li is not the future Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, then it’s alright to say that now it is about the vital interests of the major branches, and I’m afraid no one will give in easily!”","Huang Yueli said again: “Besides, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has coerced me several times, and used various means to deal with me. Why should I bow down to please them, begging them to let me in? It’s ridiculous! I absolutely I wouldn’t do such a thing!”","Grandmaster Xiao was stunned for a moment, looking very surprised.","“This...”","He didn’t expect Huang Yueli to be so hard-hearted, he frowned for a while and then said: “Madame Li, it’s good for young people to have backbone, but, why are you... Leaving the Cloudy Qilin Clan together? Forgive the old man to say it bluntly, this is really worth the loss, the resources of the ancient gods are not what you can imagine, and Young Master Li will not be willing to give up!”"]},{"number":3458,"title":"Chapter 3458 - The Witty Grandmaster Xiao (7)","paragraphs":["The corners of her lips curled up as she shook her head slightly, “Grandmaster Xiao, you are mistaken! I never planned to let my husband leave the Cloudy Qilin Clan with me...”","“Then you are...” Grandmaster Xiao was puzzled.","Huang Yueli said slowly, “I will definitely let the Cloudy Qilin Clan beg me to be the Madame of the clan!”","“You...” Grandmaster Xiao was stunned.","He really never thought that Huang Yueli would have such big ambitions!","!!","In his opinion, although Huang Yueli was good enough, it was still too insignificant in the face of such a big family as Cloudy Qilin Clan, which has been passed down for millions of years.","Even if she tried her best to please everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it would be very difficult to marry into Li Moying’s wife. Not only luck, but also Li Moying’s determination to marry her!","However, Huang Yueli didn’t care about such an approach at all!","For a while, Grandmaster Xiao didn’t know what to say.","He wanted to say that this is impossible, let Huang Yueli calm down and stop dreaming.","However, facing Huang Yueli’s delicate and perfect face, he opened his mouth, but was speechless.","I don’t know why, Huang Yueli seems to have a kind of power in her body, which makes people involuntarily want to believe in her, and believe that no matter what kind of miracle, it is possible to happen to her!","“Hey, since you’re so confident, this old man can only wish you all the best! Don’t worry, in terms of business, this old man will help you keep an eye on it a little more. Xuan Zifan is a reliable person I’ve met before. There shouldn’t be much of a problem with this business.”","After a long while, Grandmaster Xiao came back to his senses.","Huang Yueli nodded, and suddenly the conversation changed, “This time the deal has been successfully negotiated, thanks to your help! I don’t know how I can thank you. In the profit, the 20% belongs to you.”","Grandmaster Xiao was stunned for a while, then waved his hands again and again, “Oh, this is impossible! 20% of the profit! This is too much! The old man didn’t help you, he just organized a competition and casually haggled the price. For this deal, the real valuable illustration was done by you! If you want to thank the old man, just give a few hundred thousand crystal jade!”","Huang Yueli’s generous hand really frightened Grandmaster Xiao.","What was the profit of 20%? That was an unimaginably large number!","Didn’t you see the Black Tortoise Clan, who were responsible for refining and selling Spirit Armaments, only got 30% of the profits?","He was only in charge of the negotiation. Most of the conditions were pre-planned by Huang Yueli, and the result was 20% of the profit?","Although it is said that some people give away money for free, this is a great good thing, but if the pie that falls from the sky is too big, it will make people reluctant to accept it!","Huang Yueli knew what Grandmaster Xiao was thinking and smiled, “Grandmaster Xiao, don’t worry, I won’t let you take this jade quartz for nothing. I’ve planned to cultivate well for the past six months and participate in the Grand Meet in the God Realm in half a year, so I’m afraid there is not much time to stare at the Black Tortoise Clan. When the Spirit Armament officially begins to be refined, there are still many things, and I will need you to help.”","Grandmaster Xiao was surprised, “You want to participate in the Grand Meet in the God Realm?”","He was dazed for a moment before he reacted, “By the way, your cultivation talent is also quite good! Maybe, you can achieve results in cultivation in the God Realm and become famous!”"]},{"number":3459,"title":"Chapter 3459 - The Secret Realm (1)","paragraphs":["“The most important thing for the major families is the talent of cultivation. If you can really get a good ranking, maybe the Cloudy Qilin Clan will not object to your marriage with Young Master Li! No wonder you were so confident just now!”","The more Grandmaster Xiao said, the more excited he became, and his face even glowed red.","“Uh, this...”","Huang Yueli really didn’t want to say that she was there for the ancient inheritance of the rewards of cultivation in the God Realm. As for what the Cloudy Qilin Clan would admit to after she became famous, she never thought about it.","There will be those thoughts that others will admit. To put it bluntly, they were still weak. Even if they were not weak in strength, they are also weak in spirit.","For a peerless genius like Huang Yueli, her innate strength was right there. No matter if she has cultivation skills in the God Realm, it will not disappear. Even if she deliberately hides it, she can’t hide it, and it will be discovered by others one day.","So, she doesn’t need to show off deliberately.","Otherwise, as long as she discloses that she is a god-level genius, she will shock the entire God Realm.","Huang Yueli smiled and didn’t explain much, just said: “Grandmaster Xiao, you are so right! Then please pay more attention to the business. Before the God Realm meets cultivation, try to improve your strength as much as possible.”","“That’s what it should be! Young Master Li... Oh, no, Madame Li, you can go as far as you can. In business matters, this old man promises that nothing will go wrong!”","“Thank you very much!”","After Huang Yueli finished talking to Grandmaster Xiao, she saw that the time had come, so she said goodbye and left.","At the door, Li Moying was already waiting.","This handsome and innocent man stood beside the carriage with a cold expression on his face, and his expression softened until he saw Huang Yueli’s slender figure appearing in front of him.","“You’re obedient today, you know you have to wait for me to pick you up!” Li Moying gave her a sideways glance, a faint smile appeared in his mesmerizing eyes, which made her even more enamored.","Huang Yueli raised the corner of her mouth slightly, “I have promised to wait for you, how could I break my promise?”","Li Moying grabbed her wrist and pulled her into his arms. Before she regained consciousness, he placed a light kiss on the corner of her mouth.","Immediately, he supported her slender waist and put her on the carriage.","“Let’s go, let’s go home!”","...","After the deal was successfully negotiated, Huang Yueli suddenly became more relaxed.","After the illustration is handed over to the Black Tortoise Clan, they will organize their own hands to study and refine them.","However, Xuan Qingling would come to the door in person every other day and ask Huang Yueli some questions about the refining process of the Spirit Armament. After all, the twenty illustrations were all refined with a brand new method, even if Xuan Qingling had extraordinary comprehension. , and it is impossible to completely control it by yourself in such a short period of time.","During this period, neither Li Leyun nor the two Divine Generals of the Cloudy Qilin Clan appeared again.","Once, Huang Yueli asked Li Moying about their situation.","Li Moying just snorted coldly, “The day you argued with them, I asked them to leave Medial Arch City.”","“Leave? Are they willing to leave like this?” Huang Yueli was quite surprised.","Li Leyun was nothing, the two brothers Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai were probably not so easy handle. The two dignified six-star Divine Generals will not be frightened and run out of the city just because of a threat from Li Moying!","Li Moying glanced at her, “The two Divine Generals are in a hurry to report your matter to the Cloudy Qilin Clan Patriarch. Even if I want to keep them, I’m afraid I won’t be able to keep them!”"]},{"number":3460,"title":"Chapter 3460 - The Secret Realm (2)","paragraphs":["“Ah, so that’s the case...” Huang Yueli was stunned.","She should have offended Li Yuntao that day. She felt that it was a little strange before, because Li Yuntao didn’t seem to have any reaction at all, and he never bothered her again after that.","Now it seems that it’s not that they didn’t hold any grudges, but they knew that they couldn’t get through Li Moying here, so they simply went back to Cloudy Qilin Clan to complain!","Li Moying lightly tapped on the table with his fingers, and said in a low voice, “However Li’er, don’t worry, no matter what they say back at the clan, no one can hurt you. I will be responsible for handling the matter, and what happened at Grandmaster Xiao’s manor last time will not happen again.”","Huang Yueli raised her lips into a smile, “I know, I’m not worried about anything. I’m just thinking, won’t you be going back to Cloudy Qilin Continent?”","!!","Li Moying shook his head, “I want to go back but I’m going back with you. I don’t want to be separated from you again, not even for a few days! So, only after I deal with Cloudy Qilin Continent’s matters properly then we’ll head back together.”","“I’m fine, but, in this way, you won’t be able to get the family’s resources? Will it affect your ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet?” Huang Yueli was a little worried.","Speaking of which, Li Moying was a god-level genius, and his talent was second to none in the entire God Realm.","However, on the other hand, this was also a huge pressure.","Li Moying must and can only be the first place. If he doesn’t get the first place, everyone will question the extent of his efforts.","The God Realm Grand Meet was open to everyone under the age of fifty. Compared with these so-called “younger generations”, Li Moying’s age was really too young! The years of cultivation he had were even shorter, and even the time spent cultivating in the God Realm has only been a year.","This disadvantage was also very obvious. Therefore, if Li Moying wants to win the first place, it was still a challenge and he must prepare well.","Li Moying knew what she meant, but just shook his head and smiled, “You forgot? I told you last time that I found a map to the ancient secret realm, and I am going with you for to gain some experience? That secret realm in the God Realm is also rarely opened once, and it is impossible to enter without a map, and there must be a lot of treasures and opportunities hidden in it.”","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up immediately when she heard his words.","“I remember that you mentioned this, but didn’t you say that there’s still some parts on the map that need to be further deciphered before you can ascertain the exact location? How is the situation now?”","Li Moying held her hand out, took out the scroll made of cowhide from the interspatial ring, and handed it to Huang Yueli.","“During this period of time, while you were busy making money by refining armaments, I checked some classic books, deciphered most of them, and successfully found the location of the secret realm. This secret realm is not far from the Empyrean Fox Continent, and it is about seven or eight days of travel via the spaceship.”","Huang Yueli took the scroll, couldn’t wait to spread it out, and looked at it carefully from top to bottom.","Li Moying looked at her getting busy with a flushed face while full of concentration, her long eyelashes fluttering up and down. She looked gentle and beautiful and for a while, he was mesmerized as he stood there staring at her.","“Husband, husband? What are you thinking?”","Huang Yueli’s voice rang in his ears.","Li Moying finally recovered, “What’s the matter? Little Li’er? Have you finished studying it?”"]},{"number":3461,"title":"Chapter 3461 - The Secret Realm (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli pursed her lips, shook her head and said, “No, most of the contents on this map are in the language of the Ancient God Realm, and I can’t understand most of them... However, there are a few symbols that look very familiar... ...we seem to have seen them before in Soaring Heavens Continent?”","Li Moying came over, wrapped his arms around her slender waist, and sat beside her.","“Yes, you discovered this as well? At the beginning, I also thought these symbols were very familiar, only then did I notice this scroll, and gradually deciphered it, only to find out that this is actually a map to the secret realm. By the way, this secret realm has a very similar to our origin.”","“Oh? Really?” Huang Yueli thought thoughtfully, “Could it be that... this was left by the seniors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan or the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","Li Moying showed a mysterious smile and shook his head, “That’s not the case. This secret realm is actually left behind by an evil cultivator.”","Huang Yueli was startled, “Evil cultivator?”","In the God Realm, in addition to ordinary cultivators who cultivate normally, there were also some cultivators who have special abilities or practice special exercises.","For example, Huang Yueli’s good friend Xia Yunxi was born with the power of the witch. This ability was different from ordinary profound energy. Only by cultivating the ways of the sky witch can improve one’s own ability.","As for the evil cultivator, the cultivation method was very similar to that of the Sky Devil race. They rely on hunting and killing various spirit beasts and absorbing the energy in the spirit core to improve their abilities.","The more powerful the spirit beast, the more energy it can provide. In order to quickly break through, some evil cultivators will directly kill people and absorb the energy in their dantian!","It was even said that if an evil cultivator kills a certain number of people, they will gradually generate demonic energy, and even turn into a Sky Devil.","There are many people who suspect that the Sky Devils in the God Realm should be descendants of the evil cultivators who fell into the devil’s way in the ancient times when the God Realm was first created.","Therefore, evil cultivators were a taboo existence for the God Realm.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “If it is a place left by an evil cultivator, isn’t it too dangerous for us to enter like this?”","Ordinary cultivators in the God Realm know very little about the cultivation methods of evil cultivators. It was difficult to imagine what unexpected dangers they would encounter in this secret realm. Once they encounter something dangerous, they do not know how to deal with it.","Li Moying pointed to a few symbols on the scroll, and said, “If it were other secret realms of evil cultivators, I wouldn’t dare to enter it rashly. However, don’t you find these places very familiar?”","“Yes, but, I really can’t remember where I saw it, let alone what it means...” Huang Yueli frowned.","These symbols looked familiar, but once Huang Yueli thought about it carefully, she felt that her mind was blocked by a layer of haze, and she couldn’t see the truth clearly.","When Li Moying saw this, he no longer delayed and said: “This is actually the cave manor left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow!”","“What!?”","Hearing this name, Huang Yueli suddenly exclaimed!","Because, this evil cultivator really had a deep relationship with them.","The secret technique that Li Moying used to split her primordial spirit to protect her last trace of consciousness was the soul-splitting technique left behind by this Saint Iniquitous Shadow!","If there was no Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Huang Yueli would most probably have already died. How could she still continue their fated relationship in this lifetime?","This also explains why Huang Yueli couldn’t remember the real meaning of these symbols.","Because, it was Li Moying, not her, who had read the books of the Saint Iniquitous Shadows!"]},{"number":3462,"title":"Chapter 3462 - The Secret Realm (4)","paragraphs":["The reason why Huang Yueli has an impression it’s because before she returned her primordial spirit to Li Moying, she had some memories of him, and she had seen that book in a dream, but the impression she got was very shallow after all and she doesn’t remember clearly.","After knowing that the owner of the secret realm was the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Huang Yueli immediately became interested, laid the map down on the table and studied it more carefully.","Li Moying also explained from the side: “These locations should be the places where Saint Iniquitous Shadow keeps his treasures. He has rich experience and even has contact with the Sky Devils. There will definitely be no less of secrets of cultivation and various treasures in the cave manor. What is even more rare is that other cultivators have a lot of taboos against evil cultivators, and it is difficult to decipher the content on the map. Therefore, this map has been kept in the library of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and it seems that it has not been touched by others.”","“That means, it is estimated that not many people have been to this secret realm?” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes with a look of surprise, “The treasures in the secret realm must be well preserved! I hate that kind of secret realm that many people have been to, even if there are some good things in it, they have already been taken away!”","Li Moying nodded, paused, and then said, “However, this also means that there are many unknown dangers in the secret realm which we can’t predict, so we must act carefully!”","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “I know this, you can rest assured! We haven’t gone to the secret realm to cultivate together for a long time. I miss the feeling of fighting side by side with you!”","Li Moying slightly hooked the corners of his mouth, he was happy, but also a little worried.","After all, this was the God Realm, not the Soaring Heavens Continent.","He was no longer the peerless master Li Moying who was invincible in the world. In the God Realm, his current cultivation was nothing, there were many who were much stronger than him!","In those real ancient secret realms, there are even powerful existences that can instantly kill the experts in the profound realm.","In comparison, he is too small to protect his Little Li’er...","It seems that he must practice harder and become stronger as fast as possible, so that his Little Li’er can run around carefree, and can also guarantee that no one dares to show his wife a bad face. ...","Huang Yueli didn’t think that Li Moying thought so much because of her words.","She looked at the map up and down, left and right, and with her hands on her cheeks, she said thoughtfully, “I have never been to the cave manor of an evil cultivator, and I don’t know what treasures will be in the cave manor of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. We don’t know much about him either... It’s better to look up some ancient books and make some preparations.”","When Li Moying heard the words, the corners of his mouth curved upward, and a flash of determination flashed by his eyes.","“I know that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow has a treasure, and it must be hidden in the cave. This time I go, I must find a way to get it!”","It was rare to hear that Li Moying was so desperate for a treasure, Huang Yueli looked over curiously.","“What treasure are you talking about? Is it a cultivation technique? Or what kind of Spirit Armament?”","The smile on Li Moying’s mouth deepened, and he said in a low voice, “Do you remember, I told you before that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow created the soul-splitting technique to save his beloved woman? Moreover, the cultivation talent of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow was not high back then, and he was able to become a peerless powerhouse on the third level of the Life Profound Realm, it was all relying on this woman...”"]},{"number":3463,"title":"Chapter 3463 - The Secret Realm (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, trying to think back.","“Ah... It seems that there is such a thing! Did he write on his notebook that his wife is a beautiful and powerful genius cultivator... Hey, Moying, why are you so close to me? I can’t take a good look at the map... ugh!”","Huang Yueli turned her head sharply, only to realize that at some point, Li Moying had already leaned onto her, his handsome face was resting on her neck, and the hot breath was blowing behind her ears.","Huang Yueli subconsciously moved to the side, trying to avoid it.","However, the chair she was sitting on was originally against the wall, and when she moved like this, she sank herself into a corner even more.","!!","Li Moying took advantage of the situation and leaned over, put one hand on the wall, and wrapped her in his arms.","“Little Li’er, do you want to know what kind of techniques this Saint Iniquitous Shadow has cultivated to make his strength grow by leaps and bounds with only basic earth talent?”","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying nervously, under the cover of his alluring aura, her heart was pounding, and she couldn’t even think...","Who can tell her why the atmosphere became so ambiguous when the two were discussing on going to the secret realm for an experience?","“This...this...very...very simple! The Saint Iniquitous Shadow has fallen into the evil way, and his strength will be greatly improved! Maybe he is a peerless genius that comes once in ten thousand years in the cultivation of evil ways!”","Huang Yueli finally regained her thoughts, said a few words quickly, and went to push Li Moying, “Alright, let’s talk properly!”","However, Li Moying’s body was as stable as a mountain, and under the push of her little hand, he did not move at all.","Li Moying smiled lowly, pinched her messy little hand, pressed it against the wall, and moved closer and closer to her.","It was only when the distance between the two of them was only an inch, and the heat of their breathing could be clearly felt, Li Moying stopped and spoke in a low voice.","“The Saint Iniquitous Shadow fell into the evil way, that is what happened after his wife died in an accident! Before that, he was already a powerhouse in the Life Profound Realm. And his cultivation is so fast, relying on his wife’s book of double cultivation exercises brought from her maiden’s house!”","“What? Double... double cultivation technique!”","Huang Yueli opened her mouth in surprise, she had almost bitten her own tongue!","She knew that Li Moying’s mind was full of impure nonsense!","They have already practiced a double cultivation technique, and this man still remembers a more advanced one!","Li Moying looked at her sluggish little face, and the smile on his face became wider and wider.","This little girl doesn’t know that when she has on her cunning expression, she was absolutely beautiful, but her cute look is even more adorable and she looks very tempting, so he can’t control the urge to swallow her!","“The wife of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow is the proud daughter of Heaven who was born in Acacia Valley, a great power in the God Realm. I heard that she is also a top heaven-level genius. This Acacia Valley’s double cultivation technique is very famous. Several experts in the Life Profound Realm have been born, and these Fate Profound Realm cultivators are also Dao Companions, both of whom have made breakthroughs! If we can obtain this set of exercises, our cultivation speed will definitely increase by a lot!”","Li Moying put away his frivolous smile and said in a serious tone.","Huang Yueli looked at his sanctimonious appearance and could not wait to bite him!"]},{"number":3464,"title":"Chapter 3464 - The Secret Realm (6)","paragraphs":["He had the nerve to say such words so seriously!","Did he think that she didn’t know? If this man’s intention was really on speeding up on cultivation, then he really had something up his sleeves!","He most probably thought that the postures recorded in these manuals were very novel!","“I... I think we may not be very suitable! You also said that the talent of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow is not very good, so we use the double cultivation method to help our cultivation. Our talent is so high, it may be more difficult to cultivate ordinary exercises so effectively...”","Huang Yueli tried to reason with him.","Li Moying just shook his head, a smile flashed in his deep eyes.","“I can’t say that, no matter how talented we are, we won’t think that the cultivation speed is too fast! What’s more, I also heard that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow has personally modified this double cultivation method and incorporated a lot of methods to enhance profound strength. The power method, our primordial spirits are all re-forged through the technique of splitting the soul, and it is not an exaggeration to say that we are the successor of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. For us, the effect of his revised exercises must be better than that of ordinary people!”","“Isn’t it a pity not to cultivate such a good cultivation method?”","Li Moying looked at Huang Yue’s puffed up face, tried his best to hold back his laughter, and continued to talk nonsense seriously.","Huang Yueli glared at him angrily, blinking her big eyes, desperately thinking in her heart how to refute him.","However, she knew that Li Moying was talking nonsense without any good intentions, but he actually made a lot of sense, and she couldn’t refute it!","Moreover, before Huang Yueli could think clearly, Li Moying couldn’t help but let out a low laugh.","“You can still laugh...”","Just as Huang Yueli was about to scold him, suddenly, Li Moying came forward again.","The distance between the two was already very close. Huang Yue was leaning against the wall behind her, and there was absolutely nowhere to hide, and her lips were blocked in an instant.","I don’t know how long it took before Huang Yueli, who was blushing all over, was let go.","“Little Li’er, this secret realm is really suitable for us. We will definitely gain a lot from this experience.”","Listening to Li Moying’s words, Huang Yueli pouted.","She doesn’t want to go now, but alas, it’s too late!","...","Three days later, after Huang Yueli carefully explained the business to Grandmaster Xiao and Xuan Qingling, he boarded the flying ship with Li Moying and left Medial Arch City.","“Looking from the map, after we flew north for three days, we entered the uninhabited wilderness.” Huang Yueli stood on the deck and looked at the map.","In the vast God Realm, in addition to the territory occupied by the gods, humans and demons, in fact, more than half of the territory is still undeveloped.","These places were collectively called the Wilderness Land.","For example, near the sea of ??serenity, there is a large wild land where spirit beasts gather.","At that time, Huang Yueli was secretly plotted against by Huang Sanbai and disappeared. Li Moying thought she had fallen into that stretch, so he even searched inside for nearly a month.","However, even Li Moying would not dare to go too deep, because no one can predict the danger of the Wilderness Land!","In the God Realm, many secret realms and treasures from ancient times were hidden in such places.","Although it was dangerous, in order to obtain more resources and improve their own strength, many cultivators still venture into these wild places one after another to experience.","Li Moying glanced at the map and said, “The secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow is not too desolate. Although it is in a barren land, there is a small town inhabited by human races nearby. I heard that there used to be a jade quartz mine there. That’s why people live there.”"]},{"number":3465,"title":"Chapter 3465 - Great harvest (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli laughed, “So you’re saying that we might still get lucky and pick up some jade quartz along the way?”","Li Moying shook his head and laughed, “Your Spirit Armament Illustrations are sold for a lot of money, can this little bit of jade quartz still enter your eyes?”","Huang Yueli had an innocent look on her face, “Who would ever complain to have more money? I still have to support my family, so I’m under a lot of pressure!”","When Li Moying heard this, he couldn’t help raising his eyebrows, “My wife is working so hard, so as a good husband, I really have to serve her well! Would you like your husband to give you a massage and help you relax?”","Saying that, he straightened up, turned behind Huang Yueli, and deftly put his hands on her shoulders.","The heat emanating from his fingers, through the thin fabric, imprinted on Huang Yueli’s skin, making her feel a little itchy, and she subconsciously wanted to hide.","“Alright, alright, don’t wait on me! I’m not working hard! ... Li Moying, that’s enough, this is on the flying ship!”","Huang Yueli pushed him away and glared at him, “I’m going to practice! When I get to the secret realm, I don’t know what danger will come, so let’s get ready as soon as possible!”","Hearing this, Li Moying also took a step back.","His face was slightly red, his forehead was slightly soaked with sweat, and he looked more enchanting. Obviously, he had already felt it because of the entanglement just now.","However, he took a deep breath and said, “You’re right, then I’ll go back to my room to cultivate first.”","After speaking, Li Moying turned around and left quickly.","Huang Yueli was a little surprised when she saw his retreating back as he left in a hurry.","Although Li Moying kept saying that he was going to find some kind of double cultivation method that day, in fact, he didn’t bother her with double cultivation over the past few days, but spent more time on cultivation.","Often Huang Yueli left Grandmaster Xiao to work on errands, and it was already dark when she returned, but Li Moying was still cultivating, which was almost the same as retreating.","“Is it because the day of the Grand Meet in the God Realm is nearing, hmm, is he nervous too? Well, I should work hard too!”","Huang Yueli thought about it, put away the map, and ran back to her room to cultivate.","The flying ship continued to move steadily.","...","Not long after Huang Yueli and Li Moying boarded the flying ship.","In a small inn in Medial Arch City, Empyrean Fox Continent, a figure in black ran into a hidden room in the corner of the inn.","As soon as the figure in black entered the door, he knelt down on one knee and bowed to an old man beside the desk.","“Elder, subordinate has already found out that Li Moying, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, with his lady who has ascended from the lower realms, has already boarded the flying ship and left Medial Arch City!”","“Great, they have finally left!”","When the old man heard the news, he stood up excitedly!","If Huang Yueli saw him, she would definitely be shocked, because this old man was actually Huang Sanbai, the elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan who had secretly harmed her!","Huang Sanbai couldn’t find Huang Yueli, and returned to Sacred Phoenix Continent in desperation. With a clever move, he pushed the entire responsibility of Huang Yueli’s disappearance to Li Moying, telling the Patriarch that it was the god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who was chasing after Huang Yueli and him.","The Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan have always been at odds, and the Patriarch has always relied heavily on Huang Sanbai, so he did not doubt his words at all.","At that time, the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan was very angry about this, and immediately made a decision to send three elders to kill Li Moying.","After Huang Sanbai received the order, he took the other two elders to track Li Moying’s whereabouts."]},{"number":3466,"title":"Chapter 3466 - Great harvest (2)","paragraphs":["At first, they searched aimlessly for nearly a month, but they didn’t find any news about Li Moying, and almost gave up.","However, just as they were about to return to Saint Phoenix Continent, the notices of the allied armies were posted all over the streets and alleys of the Twelve Great Continents overnight.","Li Moying and Jun Sihan joined forces to kill the powerhouse of the Sky Devil!","Hearing this shocking news, the three elders were shocked!","Li Moying was only in his twenties, and he had only been in the Cloudy Qilin Clan for slightly more than a year, and yet his strength has grown by leaps and bounds! The talent of a god-level genius was so terrifying!","They all have high regard for Li Moying, but the talent he showed was stronger and more incredible than they had ever imagined!","If given time, he will definitely grow into the top expert of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. This would definitely be bad news for the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","The three elders all realized that if they didn’t get rid of Li Moying quickly and if they delayed any longer, they were afraid that even though the three of them were in the Dao Profound Realm , they may not be able to get rid of him even if they take action together.","Fortunately, the announcement of the allied armies not only brought bad news, but also exposed Li Moying’s whereabouts.","The three elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan immediately set off and rushed to Blessed City to intercept Li Moying.","However, they were too far away at the time. By the time they reached Blessed City, Li Moying had already left for Medial Arch City with Huang Yueli.","The three elders flinched, but after asking around, they knew where Li Moying was going. At the same time, they also heard about what happened at the banquet at the Divine General’s Mansion.","I heard that Li Moying married a wife in the lower realm, and she is beautiful and talented. The people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were just gossiping and didn’t take it to heart.","Although such a thing was rather surprising, it was not really useful information for the assassination of Li Moying.","However, after Huang Sanbai heard the news, for some reason, there was an uneasy feeling in his heart.","He suppressed this uneasy feeling, and took the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan to Medial Arch City.","This time, they chased after him.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli stayed in Medial Arch City for a long time, long enough for them to arrive and enough for them to inquire about the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Since Huang Sanbai had some doubts in his heart, he took the initiative to take on the task of inquiring about the news. In addition to the spies sent out on the bright side, he also sent his confidant subordinates to secretly ambush in the places where Li Moying often haunts.","After a period of hard work, he really found out news that shocked him!","The woman beside Li Moying... looks like Huang Yueli who was seriously injured and disappeared!","Seeing the portrait brought back by his confidant, at first, Huang Sanbai didn’t believe that such an outrageous thing would happen!","Their god-level genius from the Sacred Phoenix Clan actually married a god-level genius from the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the lower realm? How could that be? How in the world could such a coincidence happen?","For this reason, Huang Sanbai personally followed Li Moying for several days, and finally saw the true face of the woman beside him when Li Moying went to pick up Huang Yueli to go home.","Although he was afraid of being discovered, he could only glance at her from a distance.","However, Huang Yueli’s beauty was unforgettable, just a glance was enough for him to recognize her!"]},{"number":3467,"title":"Chapter 3467 - Great harvest (3)","paragraphs":["The lady next to Li Moying who was extremely close to him... was definitely Huang Yueli herself!","But, how was this possible?","He searched for Huang Yueli for several months but failed to find her. He had decided that she had already died!","But now, she actually appeared, and she looked intact! She even became Li Moying’s wife, and she was inseparable from Li Moying!","When did she hook up with Li Moying?","No, people in the allied armies said that Li Moying married his wife in the lower realms, so... she really married the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","Such a situation was absolutely unexpected by Huang Sanbai.","He was so shocked that he almost exposed his whereabouts!","Afterwards, it took him a long time to accept this fact. According to the information he had obtained, Huang Yueli should have strayed into the area controlled by the Sky Devils while avoiding his pursuit. He didn’t know how Li Moying managed to grasp her whereabouts, rushed to the Sky Devil clan to rescue her, killed the Sky Devil Ruize along the way, and then brought her all the way to Medial Arch City...","Although the situation was quite different from what Huang Sanbai expected at the beginning, in the final analysis, it did not shake his plan, and even made Huang Sanbai more determined to kill Li Moying!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying have such a good relationship, most likely because she had already told the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan about his attempted murder.","However, fortunately, the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan have always been hostile. Therefore, Huang Yueli was concerned about Li Moying’s position, and never revealed her identity, and even pretended that she was just an ordinary human girl.","In this way, she had actually helped Huang Sanbai.","If everyone knew that the girl next to Li Moying was a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, that clan would definitely send someone to look for Huang Yueli. It would be very difficult for him to hide the fact that he had attempted to murder her!","But now, Huang Sanbai was the only one in the Sacred Phoenix Clan who knows Huang Yueli’s true identity!","Of course, this situation was only temporary. God knows when Huang Yueli will reveal her true strength?","Therefore, Huang Sanbai’s killing intent was even stronger!","He knew that he must seize this opportunity and kill Huang Yueli and Li Moying together as soon as possible, so that Li Moying’s lie of plotting against Huang Yueli could be confirmed and the two families would turn against each other, so he could gain a profit from it!","However, Huang Yueli’s appearance was not without impact.","Originally, the biggest difficulty in this matter was just killing Li Moying. Under the joint attack of the three Dao Profound Realm powerhouses, Huang Sanbai was convinced that they had enough strength to kill Li Moying.","However, the question now changed and became how he could prevent the other two elders from discovering Huang Yueli’s identity...","If the three of them met Huang Yueli and the others on the spot, and Huang Yueli found out that their lives were in danger, he would definitely reveal his true identity. At that time, the other two elders would definitely turn against him on the spot!","Therefore, this matter still needs to be thought out properly...","Therefore, Huang Sanbai chose to live in Medial Arch City, and had been secretly observing Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","The other two elders didn’t feel that there was anything wrong.","Because, it was impossible for them to attack Li Moying in Medial Arch City where there were many experts, so they can only wait for him to leave before making any concrete plans."]},{"number":3468,"title":"Chapter 3468 - Great harvest (4)","paragraphs":["The three elders never expected that Li Moying’s wife would actually have a relationship with Grandmaster Xiao, and even started a business together, and because of this, they stayed in Medial Arch City for a long time.","The three of them waited, waited, almost lost their patience, and finally waited for the news of Li Moying’s departure from the city.","Huang Sanbai stared at his subordinate in front of him, and asked in a hurry: “Is Li Moying really out of the city? Did his wife leave with him? Did you see clearly?”","His subordinate nodded and said with affirmation: “Yes, this subordinate personally watched their flying ship fly away. Looking at the direction, it seems to be heading north...”","“North?” Hearing this, Huang Sanbai frowned slightly, “This doesn’t seem to be the direction to Cloudy Qilin Continent? This is so strange!”","!!","He was puzzled for a while before he regained his composure.","It was not a bad thing for Li Moying not to return to the Cloudy Qilin Clan immediately.","In case Li Moying really returned and couldn’t come out anymore, it would be almost impossible to kill him!","However, if he was still running around now, he still had the opportunity to take advantage of this and start.","Huang Sanbai questioned his subordinate a few more times, then sat back, with furrowed brows, he was deep in thoughts.","“From Medial Arch City to the north, there are not many big towns. If you continue to fly a little further, you will enter the Wilderness Lands! Could it be that they are planning to go to the Wilderness Lands for an experience?”","Turning his head, he saw the hesitant expression of his subordinate, frowned and said, “What do you want to say?”","The subordinate hurriedly said: “This subordinate feels that this Young Master Li may have really gone for an experience! Think about it, he values ??his wife so much, but the Cloudy Qilin Clan is obviously not satisfied with her, maybe Young Master Li doesn’t want his wife to go back with him and get angry, so he just brought her around to play and gain some experience...”","Huang Sanbai was taken aback, then nodded again, “You boy, what you said makes sense!”","After all, he was old, and for a while he couldn’t understand what a young man like Li Moying was thinking, but after being reminded by his subordinate, he came to his senses.","“If they really went to the Wilderness Lands, they would have given us a chance! But, this matter... I’m afraid we can’t hide it from the other two...” Huang Sanbai pondered for a moment before saying, “Forget it, go and report to Elder Yu and Elder Zhao and prepare to set off immediately. We must not lose Li Moying!”","...","On the flying ship of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had been quietly cultivating.","After flying for three days, the flying ship entered the Wilderness Lands.","Originally, according to the records of the God Realm, there would be a large number of flying spirit beasts gathered in the sky above and they would be easily attacked.","However, their luck seemed to be very good. They didn’t encounter any large groups of flying spirit beasts along the way, only a few sporadic ones occasionally. They deliberately avoided fighting against each other.","Since the journey was very smooth, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were given a lot of time to cultivate.","Li Moying even successfully broke through to the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm on the flying ship.","A twenty-three-year-old in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","Moreover, after Li Moying broke through the initial stage of the Heart Profound Realm, he broke through again in less than half a year.","Such a cultivation speed, not to mention rare in ten thousand years, probably not even one in hundreds of thousands of years!","If the two Divine Generals of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were here, they might have to take another look at Li Moying, and maybe they wouldn’t dare to interfere in Li Moying’s marriage anymore.","However, Huang Yueli was not too surprised by this."]},{"number":3469,"title":"Chapter 3469 - Great harvest (5)","paragraphs":["Ever since the last time when he battled against Sky Devil Ruize, his meridians were under pressure from a large amount of devilish energy, and the profound energy in his body also underwent a process of compression and purification.","This process made the profound energy in Li Moying’s body become more and more solid and purer by the moment.","Of course, with just one battle, it would be difficult for an expert in the Heart Profound Realm to easily advance.","What really benefited Li Moying was the double cultivation with Huang Yueli.","Although the two of them were already married in the lower realm, in fact, the two of them had not consummated their marriage because of the split of their primordial spirits. The only time they reunited was when Li Moying’s life was in danger...","!!","After the two met again in Blessed City, they became a proper couple.","Both of them are at the age where they were full of passion, coupled with the fact that they were newly married, and more importantly, they were both god-level talents, evenly matched, they could provide each other with a lot of energy, and can also gain a lot from each other. Hence, the effect of double cultivation was amazingly good.","It’s just that Li Moying hadn’t cultivated for a whole period of time until a few days ago, and he could break through at any time, but it was only now that he really entered the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm .","And Huang Yueli’s cultivation has also improved, but it was not as fast as she had imagined.","Originally, when she ascended from Soaring Heavens Continent, she had already comprehended the fifth conception of the fire attribute, and even the sixth conception had already comprehended most of it.","However, after reaching the God Realm, she encountered danger one after another, and she did not have much progress in her cultivation.","It was not until the battle with the Sky Devil Race in Blessed City that she broke through the sixth level of the Dream Profound Realm.","Later, after cultivating with Li Moying, she broke through the seventh level of the Dream Profound Realm.","Now, she was also a cultivator in the late stage of the Dream Profound Realm. At the age of less than nineteen, she had actually attained such a cultivation level, which was comparable to Li Moying’s level.","However, Huang Yueli always felt that her cultivation speed was too slow, especially when she had a very talented husband by her side!","Although Li Moying said every day that his woman should be protected by him, she didn’t want to be a burden to Li Moying. From beginning to end, she liked the feeling of fighting side by side with Li Moying!","Because of this, Huang Yueli had been very annoyed for a few days.","Seeing that she was unhappy, Li Moying came to comfort her, “Little Li’er, this is not your problem. If a cultivator in the Profound Realm wants to improve his cultivation, he usually needs to comprehend various conception illustrations. Only by understanding the conception illustrations can you make a breakthrough. However, you can’t go back to the Sacred Phoenix Clan now, and you can’t see the conception illustration of the fire attribute. You have already attained a very terrifying level of comprehension, even I can’t compare to you!”","Li Moying’s words were not just to comfort Huang Yueli, but he was speaking the truth.","The Dream Profound Realm has nine levels. It seems very simple now, but since ancient times, it was a very, very difficult threshold for the cultivation of genius cultivators.","Because, no matter how talented the body is, and no matter how many medicinal herbs and jade quartz provided by the family, it is not very helpful for comprehending conception.","If you want to break through the Dream Profound Realm, all you need is comprehension!","Wanting to rely on oneself to comprehend the conception of heaven and earth among thousands of is as difficult as going against the heavens!","How many peerless geniuses who were favored by others, were stuck on this threshold and even trapped for dozens or hundreds of years.","Later, the situation changed when a powerful person in the Fate Profound Realm drew something like a conception illustration."]},{"number":3470,"title":"Chapter 3470 - Entering the Secret Realm (1)","paragraphs":["This was why, Huang Yueli’s ability to completely rely on her own strength to improve two small realms was considered a very perverse talent!","Huang Yueli also understood this truth, but she was still not very satisfied with the progress of her own cultivation.","“I don’t know where other than the clan can I see the conception illustration?” Huang Yueli was thoughtful.","Li Moying said: “It’s not a difficult task. Fate Profound Realm cultivators usually leave their own conception illustration, so maybe there is one in the cave of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, but it may not be suitable for you. If it is not suitable for you. If so, when we come out of the secret realm, we can go to the Allied Armies Headquarters. The Allied Armies Headquarters has collections of conception illustrations of various attributes, and there must be something you can use. It takes a lot of military skills to observe these conception illustrations, but the last time you sold a Spirit Armament illustration, you’ve gained a lot of military merit, I think there will be no problem.”","“That would be great!” Huang Yueli was overjoyed, “Before the God Realm Grand Meet, I must go to the headquarters of the Allied Armies!”","!!","“I’ll accompany you when the time comes.” Li Moying laughed softly.","The flying ship flew in the direction marked on the map for seven or eight days, and finally stopped at a mountain pass.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli chose the guards who would enter the secret realm together.","In the secret realm, there were many traps everywhere. There was no benefit to having a lot of people, and they may even increase the burden.","Therefore, they only planned to bring the four guards with the highest cultivation level. All of these four were above the cultivation level of the Heart Profound Realm. In addition, they have learned various secret techniques and profound skills of the Cloudy Qilin Clan since they were a child and they were all at the top.","Moreover, these people were all equipped with a full set of standard Spirit Armaments refined by Huang Yueli—or rather a full set of middle grade Spirit Armaments!","These Spirit Armaments can be said to be the best among the Spirit Armaments that Huang Yueli can refine at this stage.","So, when the guards received this equipment, they were all shocked and stunned in place.","“This... this... Madame, is this really for us?” Li Tianyi stared incredulously at the Spirit Armament in his hands, his eyes were about to pop out!","Li Tian’er also said, “Madame, you couldn’t have made all of these, right? You... you can already refine middle grade Spirit Armaments?”","Huang Yueli shrugged, “If it’s not for you, is it for play? Hurry up and put it on! If you are lucky, even Grandmaster Xiao has never seen these Spirit Armaments!”","In fact, Huang Yueli had been able to refine middle grade Spirit Armament two months ago, but she didn’t let outsiders know about this news, not even Grandmaster Xiao.","Because she was afraid that someone would leak the secret, she didn’t even get the badge of the middle grade Spiritual Armament Master, for fear that the Allied Armies would come and ask her for the illustrations of the middle grade Spirit Armaments.","Now, if it wasn’t for the fact that they were all Li Moying’s people, and that they had been protecting both of them during this period of time, it could be said that they were loyal, and she would not have taken out these Spirit Armaments.","The guards all know that Huang Yueli was Li Yuehuang, the legendary genius Spiritual Armament Master, and she is naturally in awe of what she has refined.","Several people hurriedly put on their equipment, and only moved a few times, and they all showed shock!","“This set of Spirit Armaments is actually... a set!”","“Is this really a middle grade Spirit Armament? The increase in attack defense is far from the ordinary."]},{"number":3471,"title":"Chapter 3471 - Entering the Secret Realm (2)","paragraphs":["“Oh my goodness, it’s... so powerful! I’ve never used such a good Spirit Armament, it’s still a set!”","The guards were all from a big family like the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and they have extraordinary knowledge. They immediately realized how precious this set was!","Compared with the ones on them, the Spirit Armaments that Huang Yueli sold to the headquarters of the Allied Armies were like scrap metal!","If they could sell the Spirit Armaments on their bodies, it would cost tens of thousands of jade quartz for one set!","For such Spirit Armaments, as guards of the Heart Profound Realm, they probably couldn’t afford it in their entire life.","!!","And Huang Yueli gave it to them so casually?","Huang Yueli looked at their surprised faces, and smiled slightly, “You guys are so loyal to my husband and have worked hard, so what’s the matter of giving you a set of Spirit Armaments? However, I still want to remind you that these Spirit Armaments would be too ostentatious to take it out. Your cultivation at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm and these are easy to be coveted by others. Fortunately, these Spirit Armaments look the same as ordinary middle grade Spirit Armaments, and ordinary people can’t tell the difference. When it comes to money, you have to be more careful, as the saying goes, money doesn’t come out in vain!”","The guards agreed repeatedly, each with an extremely respectful tone.","“Yes, this subordinate understands!”","“Thank you, Madame, for your guidance!”","What Huang Yueli said was absolutely correct. They only had a cultivation level at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, yet they were wearing Spirit Armaments worth 10,000 jade quartz and walking on the street. It was like a moving treasure house, luring others to grab it!","However, this was not the reason why the guards were so respectful to Huang Yueli, and even Huang Yueli’s generosity was not the reason why they changed their attitude.","The carefully selected young cultivators from the younger generation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are not so shallow-sighted. Although the Spirit Armaments Huang Yueli sent were indeed very valuable, but relying on money alone to buy their loyalty was far from enough.","What really shocked them was that these Spirit Armaments were all made by Huang Yueli herself!","They all knew Huang Yueli’s real age.","A Spiritual Armament Master who is less than twenty years old can actually refine such a Spirit Armament!","Speaking out was even more shocking than her talent in cultivation!","Besides, what moved them even more was what Huang Yueli said when he handed over the Spirit Armament to them.","Huang Yueli gave them something because they were loyal to Li Moying.","As Li Moying’s wife, she was thinking about him.","As Li Moying’s bodyguards, they were on the same front as Li Moying.","Li Moying loved Huang Yueli very much, and once made these guards secretly worried, fearing that Li Moying would be dazzled by Huang Yueli, if Huang Yueli had any bad thoughts, it would be impossible to guard against.","However, Huang Yueli’s every move now was obviously for Li Moying. The relationship between her and Li Moying was not made by Li Moying alone, but a couple who truly support each other...","This made the guards respect her from the bottom of their hearts.","Seeing the change in their eyes, Huang Yueli somewhat guessed their thoughts.","However, she didn’t take their thoughts very seriously.","To be honest, she doesn’t care whether they like her or not, as long as they were really loyal to Li Moying.","She just did what she wanted to do, and she didn’t intend to please anyone."]},{"number":3472,"title":"Chapter 3472 - Entering the Secret Realm (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli turned her head to look at Li Moying.","She also wanted to equip Li Moying with a set of Spirit Armaments that she made herself, but after carefully observing the equipment on Li Moying, she chose to give it up temporarily.","“These are all treasures on you! The Cloudy Qilin Clan really attaches great importance to you, the Young Master. The Spirit Armaments I refine are not comparable to treasures, so you should wear these on you ,wait for me...”","Before Huang Yueli could finish speaking, she saw Li Moying’s face darken rapidly.","“What? You didn’t prepare a Spirit Armament for your husband?”","!!","When Huang Yueli heard his chilly voice, her back turned cold, and she quickly said, “I mean, I’m not good enough to refine something better than yours...”","Before she could finish her sentence, she saw Li Moying take off the wrist guard he was wearing and threw it on the ground.","Immediately afterwards, the shoulder pads were removed.","Then he tossed the boots next.","At last...","Seeing that Li Moying started to unfasten the robe from the top, Huang Yueli almost jumped up, “Wait...wait, wait! Don’t just take off your clothes if you disagree! Put it on, put it back on quickly!”","Li Moying had already unfasted his top, revealing a muscular chest. There were still traces of ambiguity...","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened. It was clearly scratched by her last night...","“Ahem, ahem! Don’t be like this! These are all treasures on your body! No one else can ask for them! You’d better put them on quickly! How can you throw them on the ground, what if they break? What if you lose them? ”","“Hey, are you really taking it off? Look, Big Brother Tianyi and the others are still around...”","Li Tianyi and the others turned around a long time ago, and all of them huddled in the corner without saying a word, wishing they could disappear immediately in place!","The ancients said it well, when misfortunes come, blessings depend on them, and when blessings come, misfortunes subdue them!","I just got a set of priceless Spirit Armaments, and I haven’t been happy for long, and this is the beginning of bad luck! Why let them see the scene where their Young Master taught his wife a lesson!","In case something unspeakable happens, where will they hide? ?","Seeing Huang Yueli who was desperately pretending to be pitiful, Li Moying snorted coldly, “So what about Spirit Armaments? It’s better to lose them! With these Spirit Armaments, even my wife is not willing to refine Spirit Armaments for me.” It’s worse than trash!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t laugh or cry, “Don’t do this! I’m thinking about your safety! It’s not difficult for me to refine a set for you, but after wearing the Spirit Armament I refined, your attack and defense will drop. In this secret realm that no one has explored, there are dangers everywhere, and you are too unsafe!”","Li Moying glared at her, “Is this a reason? Even if I don’t wear a treasure, I can still protect you! Are you looking down on your man?”","“I...I’m not...” Huang Yueli was tongue-tied.","Seeing that Li Moying was about to throw those priceless treasures out of the flying ship, she rushed over quickly and stopped in front of Li Moying.","“Don’t...don’t throw it away! This is all money!”","Li Moying’s face turned darker, and he glanced at her coldly.","Huang Yueli knows him well. She knows that he is only questioning her. Which was more important for her, husband or money?","But how could she answer this question!","Huang Yueli’s heart was twisted like a knife. Although her husband was definitely the number one, money... was also very important!","Suddenly, Huang Yueli had an idea."]},{"number":3473,"title":"Chapter 3473 - Entering the Secret Realm (4)","paragraphs":["“Wait! I actually prepared something for you!”","Li Moying stopped, turned to look at her, frowned slightly, “Oh, is that right?”","Obviously, he doesn’t really believe it.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and looked innocent, “Really! I prepared something for you, just in case you don’t like it!”","Saying that, she took out a silver-white robe from her interspatial ring and held it in front of Li Moying.","Li Moying couldn’t help but was startled, “This... this is for me? But, this is not... this is not a Spirit Armament, right?”","The robe Huang Yueli took out had a silver-white background and was embroidered with intricate patterns with gold and silver silk threads. It looked low-key and extravagant.","Moreover, Li Moying could see at a glance that this size was completely made according to his figure, and it was much larger than ordinary men’s clothes.","But, no matter what, this was just an ordinary robe.","It looks good, but it doesn’t change the fact that it doesn’t have any defensive power...","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “I made this robe myself, how is it? It’s beautiful, right? You already have a treasure-level profound armour, and I can’t improve it if I make another profound armour. Your defense power will actually make you overburdened and affect your speed, so after thinking about it, I made you an ordinary robe. Although it has no defense power, it is very light and thin. It also looks so good!”","“Also, look at these patterns, I also incorporated a few arrays on it, which can increase your speed a little bit. These arrays also increase wear resistance, so even though it looks very thin, but it’s durable!”","Although the profound armour could also be made into the style of ordinary robes, it just looks light and thin, the weight of the material still exists, and the weight of each piece was quite considerable.","After Huang Yueli finished her introduction, she said excitedly, “How is it? I didn’t forget you, did I? Hurry up, wear it and let me see it!”","As soon as these words came out, Li Moying didn’t act immediately, but frowned slightly and froze in place.","Huang Yueli had expected this for a long time, and couldn’t help but secretly laugh in her heart, but she still had a look of anticipation on her face.","“Don’t you blame me for not preparing it for you? Although this is not a Spirit Armament, I made it myself. Don’t you want to wear it? Is it because you dislike my poor craftsmanship?”","Saying that, she pouted and lowered her head with a disappointed expression.","In fact, this robe was not made by Huang Yueli over the past few days, but it has been made a long time ago, and it was made in Soaring Heavens Continent.","However, Li Moying has always liked black robes and disliked white, so he refused to wear them.","Huang Yueli also thought of various ways to coax him to wear it, because she felt that her husband was so handsome, wearing white must be more elegant.","But Li Moying didn’t buy it at all, and made excuses to slip away every time.","While pretending to be pitiful, Huang Yueli peeked at Li Moying from under her drooping eyelashes, and said to herself, “Let you be arrogant! Now that I’m talking about this, do you want to wear it?”","Li Moying stared at Huang Yueli for a while.","Although she knew that her little fox was very cunning, seeing her so disappointed, she tried her best to emphasize how much thought she had put into this dress...","Li Moying felt a sense of guilt, as if not doing what she said would hurt his little fox’s heart!"]},{"number":3474,"title":"Chapter 3474 - Forest Shade Town (1)","paragraphs":["Finally, he snorted coldly and took the white robe from Huang Yueli’s hand.","Then, in front of Huang Yueli, he picked up the treasures on the ground and put them back one by one. Finally, he frowned and stared at the silver-white robe for a while before putting it on.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and watched with interest.","Although it is said that it is very eye-catching for a beautiful man to undress, but the process of dressing was also a treat to her eyes.","“Tsk tsk, as expected of my husband, this body, this skin...”","Especially the movement of those slender and powerful fingers sliding over the fabric, there was an indescribable elegance and charm that made her unable to look away.","Suddenly, those fingers stopped and didn’t move.","Huang Yueli was a little surprised when she heard a man’s joking voice above her head, “Little fox, the drool is dripping all over. This is because you don’t want me to put my clothes on? Or... let’s not get off the flying ship, I’ll take you back to the cabin so you can take a proper look?”","There was nothing more embarrassing than being caught peeking!","Huang Yueli’s face turned red all of a sudden, “Cough, who... Who is drooling? Don’t slander others! Your figure is just average, so I’m not interested in watching it!”","“Just average?” Li Moying’s face darkened, and his voice immediately sank.","Huang Yueli was shocked to realize that she had said the wrong thing in a hurry!","Given how arrogant this man was, maybe in order to prove his “just average” figure, he will take her into the cabin and force her to watch!","Huang Yueli reacted very quickly, and ran in the direction of several guards in a flash.","“You heard wrong, I didn’t say anything just now! Alright, it’s getting late, let’s not delay, I’ll get off the flying ship first, get dressed and get off quickly!”","The flying ship hadn’t stopped yet, but Huang Yueli was agile and jumped off the flying ship with a swish.","Li Moying’s reaction was a little slower, so he let his little fox escape, not knowing whether to laugh or cry for a while.","Huang Yueli jumped off the flying ship, looked left and right, and found that they were on the edge of a small town. The town was surrounded by densely packed towering trees, and it was impossible to see the end.","“This should be the forest town marked on the map, right?” Huang Yueli muttered to himself.","As soon as she finished speaking, she heard a familiar voice behind her say: “Yes, this is Forest Shade Town. We still have to walk 30 miles to the west of the woods, and we should reach the location of the secret realm. However, Forest Shade Town is the closest location to the secret realm where the flying ship can land, so for the next 30 miles, we must walk there.”","When Huang Yueli heard the mesmerizing voice, she turned around.","Facing her was a handsome man in a white robe.","Li Moying not only put on the long robe, but also tied his long hair and adorned it with a white jade crown. The perfect facial features and contour lines were even more exquisite under the sunlight.","And, just as Huang Yueli imagined, Li Moying was very suitable for wearing white.","Wearing a white robe made his tall and straight figure even more noble and arrogant, but it also covered up his cold, stern and domineering aura a bit, making him like a a noble Young Master, elegant and extraordinary.","“Do I look that good? Otherwise... let’s go back to the cabin, shall we?”","The man’s laughing voice sounded close just beside her ears, Huang Yueli was startled before sherealized that she had been distracted by Li Moying!","As soon as she raised her head, Li Moying had on a proud expression as he looked back at her with a smile!"]},{"number":3475,"title":"Chapter 3475 - Forest Shade Town (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli glared at him, trying to hide her gaffe.","“What... What nonsense! Alright, let’s go to the town quickly!”","A group of six people entered Forest Shade Town directly.","There were a lot of defensive arrays around this town, and all of them are arrays above the heaven level! An array of this scale and level, even Huang Yueli couldn’t set it up, it was definitely something that an Array Grandmaster had done.","In fact, some arrays require a lot of rare materials, and even Array Grandmaster find them difficult to obtain.","“These arrays should have been left by the sect forces that mined the jade quartz veins here.” As the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Moying had a very poisonous vision, and he could see the origin of these arrays at a glance.","He looked in all directions of the town again, “However, this place is different from what we expected at the beginning. After the jade quartz veins were mined, the forces withdrew, but the town did not suffer from depression because of this. Instead, it has become a good place to do business!”","Huang Yueli was also looking around cautiously, and when she heard Li Moying’s words, she couldn’t help showing a knowing smile.","“Yes, it looks like this place has become an underground black market...”","The God Realm was vast and has countless towns. However, people go to high places. Therefore, most of the masters will gather in the Twelve Great Continents, and most of them will gather in the central cities.","In a small town like Forest Shade Town, which was located in the barren and desolate Wilderness Lands, it should not even be easy to pick out a Heart Profound Realm cultivator.","However, as soon as the few of them could see it, they could see that there were three Heart Profound Realm cultivators, and even one of them was at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","This was really unusual.","Moreover, the cultivators who come and go here were all very low-key, and they can’t even speak loudly. Many of them were still wearing thick cloaks and walking in scurried steps.","Huang Yueli subconsciously touched her face, secretly rejoicing.","For the sake of safety, she was more careful, and when she got off the flying ship, she changed her face and covered her face.","At that time, Li Moying laughed at her for thinking too much, but now it seems that this was a wise move.","In a place like the underground black market where fish and dragons are mixed, if there was a stunning beauty in the team, it was easy for others to covet.","Of course, with the strength of their team, it was enough to deal with most cultivators, but, after all, they came here to go to the secret realm to experience, not to find trouble, everything should be low-key, which can save a lot of trouble.","Li Moying nodded and glanced at the four guards behind him, “Everyone, be careful, we will leave as soon as we inquire about the array.”","The four hurriedly replied with a solemn ‘yes’.","Li Moying glanced at Huang Yueli again, “Follow me too, don’t leave me for more than a metre!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but stare in surprise, “One metre? This... is this too exaggerated?”","Being refuted by her, his eyes turned cold, he didn’t even say a word but directly took her hand and clasped it firmly in the palm of his hand.","Huang Yueli was about to pull her hand back subconsciously, “Hey, is this bad? Moying, let me go first! I’m a man now! Wouldn’t it be too attention grabbing for two men to walk hand in hand on the street? Noticed a little...”","However, Li Moying had already made up his mind to hold her."]},{"number":3476,"title":"Chapter 3476 - Forest Shade Town (3)","paragraphs":["No matter how hard Huang Yueli tried to struggle free, she couldn’t escape his firm grip.","A powerful big palm wrapped around her small fair hand. With such force, it almost started to hurt.","In desperation, Huang Yueli had no choice but to give up resisting, “Alright, alright, you can hold me if you want. But, can you use less strength? My hands are going to be red...”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s furrowed brows relaxed a bit, and the strength in his hands also eased.","However, he still held her little hand tightly, refusing to let go.","!!","Huang Yueli also gave up, so she had no choice but to let him lead her forward.","Sure enough, there were constantly prying eyes all around, sweeping towards them.","Normally, when she was dressed as a woman, she would walk hand in hand with Li Moying on the street. Both of them were good looking and were particularly eye-catching. There were many people looking at them each time they went out.","Logically speaking, she should already be used to the feeling of being stared at by passersby.","However, here, the prying eyes of outsiders still made her feel quite uncomfortable.","Because, compared with the envious and jealous eyes of the residents of Medial Arch City, the eyes of the cultivators in Forest Shade Town were obviously guarded mixed with a hint of probing, which made people feel offended.","Li Moying led Huang Yueli away from them, walked into a nearby restaurant, and ordered a few dishes casually.","Taking advantage of the the waiter serving the dishes, Li Tianyi took a look at Li Moying, and after getting his approval, he began to explore the situation nearby.","“Brother, your business here is really good! Although this town is a bit remote, it is quite popular.”","The waiter glanced at them a few times, and soon put on a flattering smile on his face.","“Is this the first time for esteemed guests to come here? I can see that you are all outstanding people, so you have come to the right place, welcome to our Forest Shade Town!”","“Oh? How do you say that?” Li Tianyi humbly asked for advice.","The waiter said: “In Forest Shade Town, there is a black market every year. You can buy whatever you want! Of course, if you want to sell anything, you can sell it at a good price! This is a good place, those auctions and trading houses in the Twelve Great Continents are all controlled by major families, even if there are treasures, it is difficult to sell them at a high price, and they still have to take a cut from them! It is simply a black shop! It is different here, buying and selling are all voluntary, and you can sell them at any price you want!”","Hearing this, the corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth rose into a faint smile.","“Business here is free enough, but if you want to take away the things you buy and keep the jade quartz you earn, you have to rely on your own ability, right?”","The waiter laughed twice and said, “Young Master, look at what you said! Our Forest Shade Town is not far from Empyrean Fox Continent. To tell you the truth, there are some important people from the Empyrean Fox Clan who have relations with us. You can live here with a peace of mind, no one dares to kill people here, you can rest assured!”","Huang Yueli smiled and did not speak, but secretly exchanged a look with Li Moying.","Both of them were people with a lot of experience. After hearing the waiter’s words, they immediately understood the meaning behind.","In Forest Shade Town, no one dares to kill rampantly, so what if you leave this town?","One had to know, Forest Shade Town was surrounded by dense forests, unless one came here by flying ship like them, ordinary people would encounter countless troubles along the way if they wanted to leave here on foot.","If you still had rare treasures or huge sums of money..."]},{"number":3477,"title":"Chapter 3477 - Forest Shade Town (4)","paragraphs":["One could imagine their fate!","However, this also shows from the side that the people who feel that Forest Shade Town comes to make money have a few tricks.","Of course, these people are capable, but only from the perspective of ordinary cultivators. In front of Li Moying and the others, they still needed more work.","While thinking about it, Huang Yueli gave Li Tianyi a wink, signaling him to get straight to the point.","They entered Forest Shade Town this time mainly to understand the surrounding environment and conditions, and to prepare for entering the secret realm. They did not come here to do business!","Although such an underground black market will definitely have some good things, they were short on time and don’t want to have any extra trouble.","The reason why she asked a few more questions was purely because Huang Yueli was curious and wanted to know how the underground transactions in the God Realm were different from those in the lower realm.","From the looks of it now, it’s pretty much the same...","As soon as Li Tianyi received Huang Yueli’s instructions, he immediately understood, and asked, “Brother, I have something else I want to ask you about.” He stuffed a piece of top-grade jade quartz into the waiter hand, “Nearby, was there a jade quartz vein thousands of years ago? Moreover, the scale isn’t small!”","When the waiter saw the top-grade jade quartz, his eyes lit up immediately!","He looked left and right to see if there was no one there, and quickly grabbed Jingyu and stuffed it into his sleeve. At the same time, the manner in which he looked at Li Moying and the others changed!","Ever since Forest Shade Town had a black market, although rich people often come and go, there were still very few people who are so generous. From this, it can be judged that these people must have extraordinary backgrounds.","To make a living in the black market, the most important thing was to have such knowledge.","People like Li Moying seem to be untouchable by ordinary people, and the waiter’s attitude subconsciously became more respectful.","“It turns out that a few of you are here for the jade quartz veins! To be honest, over the past few hundred years, there have been many people who have come to the vicinity of Forest Shade Town to find the jade quartz veins, and a group of them just came last month! ”","This was not what Huang Yueli and the others expected.","Because the jade quartz veins were formed when underground energy was absorbed and solidified by special rocks, so they were actually connected underground.","As long as there was a jade quartz vein, there’s a high possibility that a second jade quartz vein will appear within hundreds of miles.","It’s just that, with a radius of hundreds of miles, it’s neither big nor small. It’s not easy to explore and verify the exact location. Moreover, the possibility of having a second vein is only very high, and it’s not certain.","“So, these people did not gain anything?” Li Tianyi asked again.","The waiter’s face changed, and he lowered his voice and said: “It’s not just that there is no harvest! Seeing that the Young Masters have given so many rewards, I will say a few more words. Most of the people who came to find the jade quartz veins didn’t show up again! I’m afraid they died outside!”","Huang Yueli interrupted and said, “How do you know that they died outside? Maybe they found the jade quartz vein and went straight back to Empyrean Fox Continent.”","The the waiter said: “You don’t know about this! The west of our Forest Shade Town is an evil place. When you are looking for ore veins, don’t go near them! Those who look for ore veins mostly die in the On the way to the west, out of Forest Shade Town and all the way west, there are countless corpses on the ground.”","Hearing this, Li Moying and others frowned.","The secret realm that they were headed to was just on the west side of Forest Shade Town!"]},{"number":3478,"title":"Chapter 3478 - Kill Them (1)","paragraphs":["The waiter has been working in a place like Forest Shade Town for many years, and he was also a clever person. He had keenly noticed the changes in Li Moying’s and the others’ expressions.","However, he misunderstood the intentions of several people.","“Dear esteemed guests, don’t tell me that you want to go to the west to see it? Many people have the same idea as you. They think that the jade quartz veins have not been discovered for so many years, and the veins must be hidden in the west. This idea is not bad, but , even though jade quartz is good, you have to live to get it! Anyway, I have already warned you that the west side is very dangerous, if you insist on going, it has nothing to do with this little one!”","After finishing speaking, the waiter nodded to a few people and left.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows when she saw that there was no one around, and said in a low voice: “It seems that the place we are going to is definitely in the west!”","!!","It’s quite normal for a cave manor where an evil cultivator of the Fate Profound Realm lived to have such an evil door. Ordinary cultivators only think that it is where the jade quartz vein is located, and run directly there, wouldn’t that be death?","What the shop the waiter said is nothing more than confirming that the map in their hands is accurate.","“Besides, I’m afraid no one has ever entered that place. It’s good news for us.” Li Moying curled her lips slightly, “In short, we came to the right place.”","However, Li Tianyi seemed a little nervous, “Unfortunately, we originally wanted to find out from the residents whether there is any danger in that place and what should be paid attention to. Now we have found nothing, so we can only take things step by step...”","Li Tianyi’s worries were shared by the other three guards.","Their responsibility was to protect the Young Master and Madame, so safety was their first consideration.","From this perspective, the information provided by the waiter was not of much value at all.","Huang Yueli waved her hand, and said nonchalantly: “You guys, you are worrying too much! After all, we have a map in our hands, so it’s different from those guys who went to seek their own death! Besides, how could we get nothing? Didn’t the little brother just say that? There’s a jade quartz vein nearby! Looks like we’re going to get rich!”","Li Moying already knew that his little fox was a little money fanatic. Seeing her sly smile, showing her cute little tiger teeth, he couldn’t help laughing too.","He already knew that Huang Yueli would definitely take a fancy to that jade quartz vein!","This was indeed something they hadn’t thought of before they came here. It can be said to be a windfall.","After hearing this, the four guards were all stunned!","Was there any mistake? The waiter said that so many people died, but their Madame was not worried at all? She still remembers the jade quartz veins!","Although they were extremely shocked, Li Moying had no intention of objecting, and they did not dare to speak casually.","After a quick meal, they left the restaurant quietly, ready to set off.","Originally, they wanted to stay for one more day to take care of themselves. However, this Forest Shade Town was different from what they had expected. There was a mix of fish and dragons, so staying for a long time would not be beneficial.","Not long after the six left, another flying ship landed near Forest Shade Town.","When the flying ship landed, a few people got off and the old man leading was Huang Sanbai!","Beside him, there is also an old lady with white hair, Huang Sanbai’s cousin, Huang Shuangyu, and a middle-aged man, Huang Fuzhao."]},{"number":3479,"title":"Chapter 3479 - Kill Them (2)","paragraphs":["Like Huang Sanbai, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were both elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and they were both in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm.","The cultivation of the two were not inferior to that of Huang Sanbai, and even Huang Fuzhao’s strength was one level higher than that of Huang Sanbai.","However, these two elders were relatively simple people, and they have been devoted to cultivating, and usually seldom intervene in the affairs of the clan, unlike Huang Sanbai who holds real power.","It was precisely because the two of them had little contact with the outside world that Huang Sanbai chose them to help him complete the task of assassinating Li Moying.","After getting off the flying ship, Huang Shuangyu frowned when he saw the dilapidated Forest Shade Town.","!!","“Third brother, are you sure that the god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan came here? This town is so remote and simple, why did he come here for nothing?”","Huang Sanbai also felt a little surprised, “This... I don’t know. Li Moying’s marriage was opposed by the Cloudy Qilin Clan. He brought the lady from the lower realm and could not return to the family, so he would probably travel around. It’s just that I didn’t expect him to come to such a place...”","“Have we made a mistake?” Huang Fuzhao said coldly.","Huang Sanbai shook his head and said, “That’s unlikely. The flying ship was indeed flying all the way to the north. If they continue to go north, they will go deeper into the Wilderness Lands. The following is a small town called Forest Shade Town. It is already the northernmost human stronghold, and if they continue to the north, their flying ships have nowhere to park...”","Huang Shuangyu has always been impatient. Hearing this, he simply said: “If that’s the case, then don’t talk nonsense. We’ll know when we go in and ask. Anyway, this place is not big, and if any strangers have come, we’ll know as soon as we ask!”","The three elders stepped into Forest Shade Town, and did not forget to pull up their collars to cover their faces.","However, after entering Forest Shade Town, they soon discovered that their previous judgment was wrong.","This Forest Shade Town was not a useless border town as they had imagined. On the contrary, it was full of mystery and weirdness.","Their experience was much deeper than Huang Yueli’s, and they immediately judged that this was an underground black market.","“So, when Li Moying came here, did he think of black market transactions?” Huang Shuangyu frowned.","Huang Sanbai’s eyes lit up because of this!","What he is worried about now is not only to kill Li Moying, but also to kill Li Moying without revealing Huang Yueli’s identity! It’s best to kill Huang Yueli together!","This was very difficult to do.","Although the other two elders don’t care about world affairs, but they can cultivate to the Dao Profound Realm, but no one is a fool!","As long as the two sides fought head-on, Huang Yueli’s identity would be easily revealed.","However, no one expected that Li Moying and the others would actually go to a ghostly place like Forest Shade Town.","The situation here was very complicated, and anyone can appear, especially at night, when the black market opens, everyone will cover up their appearance and hide their true identity when trading, and no one will casually ask about it—this were the rules of the black market!","In this way, it gave Huang Sanbai a good opportunity to secretly attack others without telling the truth...","Huang Sanbai’s mind was spinning quickly, and he was about to say something.","Before he could speak, Huang Fuzhao had already reached out and stopped a waiter in the restaurant."]},{"number":3480,"title":"Chapter 3480 - Kill Them (3)","paragraphs":["“Come here, we have something to ask you.”","Hearing this, the waiter rolled his eyes in disdain, “Guest officer, we are running a restaurant here, not a family restaurant. You didn’t order something to eat here, but called me over to chat? Forgive me, I can’t accompany you!”","Seeing that these three people were dressed like dogs, but they don’t understand the rules at all!","If you don’t even take care of the restaurant’s business, you still have the nerve to ask questions!","Especially with that arrogant tone, he almost snorted and smacked him.","!!","Most of the people who come to Forest Shade Town were low-key and do not know the details, hence few dare to offend the natives in the town.","However, Huang Fuzhao, as the elder of the ancient god clan, was a very noble existence in the entire God Realm and had always been arrogant and domineering.","Hearing the waiter’s words, a cold murderous aura flashed in his eyes immediately!","Huang Sanbai reacted and hurriedly took out a handful of jade quartz from the interspatial ring before Huang Fuzhao went mad and stuffed it into the hand of the waiter.","“Young man, we are in a hurry. We don’t have time to eat here. We have a few questions to ask you. Please come out with us!”","The waiter was still angry at first, but when he looked down, what Huang Sanbai gave him was actually top-grade jade quartz, and he even gave four or five pieces at once!","This time, he was so happy!","Normally, he would not see a single top-grade jade quartz for a month, but today, he was so lucky that two consecutive groups of guests gave him top-grade jade quartz!","The old man in front of him was extraordinarily generous, and he gave so much in one fell swoop!","This was definitely a local tyrant!","The expression on the waiter’s face immediately changed to a flattering one as he nodded and said: “Several nobles, if you have any questions, feel free to ask! This little one know everything and say everything. Exhausted!”","The three elders exchanged glances, led the people out of the restaurant, found an abandoned and empty alley, and carefully checked the surrounding environment to make sure there was no one, and then stopped.","“Let me ask you, have any strangers appeared in your town recently?”","“Strangers?” The waiter was startled, and then said blankly: “Master, what kind of people are you looking for? Then you have to make them clearer! Strangers appear every day in our Forest Shade Town. Especially over the past few days, the black market is about to open, and there are many people coming from all directions.”","Huang Sanbai frowned, thought for a while, and then said, “I don’t know how many people they are travelling with, but the man and woman leading are very stunning in appearance. The peerless beauty is only about twenty years old.”","The waiter couldn’t help but let out an “ah”!","Huang Shuangyu suddenly became excited and asked repeatedly: “What? Have you seen these two people? Hurry up and tell me!”","As soon as she became anxious, the pressure of profound energy on her body uncontrollably overflowed a little!","As a powerhouse in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, for an ordinary cultivator like the waiter who is only in the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm, she was really too powerful!","It was just a little force of profound force, and the waiter almost vomited blood!","Huang Sanbai hurriedly stopped her, “Don’t worry, let this kid speak slowly!”","The waiter’s face was pale, and only then did he realize that he had encountered a terrifying master!"]},{"number":3481,"title":"Chapter 3481 - Kill Them (4)","paragraphs":["He didn’t dare to tarry any longer, and hurriedly told them what he knew.","“This... I have never seen this girl before, but this morning, I just saw an extremely handsome man! He is really handsome. There are so many people in Forest Shade Town usually but I have never seen a person who is as handsome as him! However, I have not seen the beauty you mentioned. That beautiful man led five people, one of whom was very ordinary, but walked hand in hand with another beautiful man. Many people have seen...”","“Holding a man’s hand?” Huang Fuzhao narrowed his eyes, turned to look at Huang Sanbai, “What’s going on? Didn’t you say that Li Moying has a very beloved wife? He even has the habit of liking men?”","“What? Liking men? That’s impossible!” Huang Sanbai was also very surprised.","Li Moying’s wife was Huang Yueli, a god-level genius of their Sacred Phoenix Clan! This was a secret that only he knows.","With Huang Yueli’s talent and beauty, it was absolutely impossible for Li Moying not to like her but to like men.","Besides, it was impossible for a proud girl like Huang Yueli to allow her husband to do this, not even if he was the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Huang Sanbai was stunned, and immediately realized, “I know, the man holding hands with Li Moying is his wife! Probably because he was afraid that his wife’s beauty would cause commotion, so he deliberately changed her face!”","“That’s reasonable...” Huang Shuangyu mused.","“It shouldn’t be wrong. Young men with such handsome looks are rare. Young Master Li’s appearance is absolutely unforgettable, and he happened to enter the town today, so it can’t be wrong!” Huang Sanbai added.","Huang Fuzhao nodded, then turned to the waiter, “Do you know where they went?”","Although the waiter was confused, he also knew that he couldn’t afford to offend these people, so he didn’t dare to ask more questions, so he could only answer honestly.","“They asked about the situation of the jade quartz mine near here, and they seemed to be looking for the mine. Moreover, they seemed to be in a hurry, and the little one told them that there was a black market soon, and they didn’t stay after asking about the situation of the mine and they left the town.”","“What?? What did you say? They’ve already left the town??” Huang Sanbai was taken aback and called out!","The waiter was taken aback by his excited reaction, took a few steps back, and said, “That’s right... that’s right! I think they left the restaurant, and that direction is to leave the town.”","“How is it possible? They didn’t come to the black market to trade??” Huang Sanbai still couldn’t believe it.","Huang Shuangyu also gave him a strange look, “Third brother, what’s the matter with you? As Li Moying, it’s not surprising that you don’t like things in such a small market, right?”","Huang Sanbai barely suppressed the trembling notion in his heart, “It’s alright, I... I just think it’s a little strange, if it’s not for business, what is he doing here? It doesn’t mean he’s really here to find mines, right?”","He concealed his gaffe, but he was still extremely irritable.","He thought he could kill Li Moying and Huang Yueli here! Didn’t expect that they wouldnot stay in the town at all!","Although it is not difficult to kill people in the Wilderness Lands, the problem is that you have to find someone.","If Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao find him first, then there will be big trouble!","He has to think of a way..."]},{"number":3482,"title":"Chapter 3482 - Kill Them (5)","paragraphs":["“That’s true. Could it be that Li Moying was really kicked out of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?” Huang Shuangyu was puzzled.","“It’s hard to say. However, the Cloudy Qilin’s people are not that stupid, are they?” Huang Fuzhao also frowned.","Several people asked the waiter a few more questions, but they were still to no avail.","The waiter himself believed that Li Moying and the others were looking for jade quartz veins. Naturally, they couldn’t provide more information.","In the end, Huang Fuzhao snorted coldly, “It seems that there is nothing to ask, then you can go!”","He glanced coldly at the waiter.","The waiter was so frightened that when he heard Huang Fuzhao’s order, he was immediately relieved, and hurriedly ran away.","Huang Fuzhao looked at his back as he left in a hurry, a cold light flashed in his eyes, and his fingers moved slightly...","At this moment, Huang Sanbai grabbed Huang Fuzhao’s wrist, “Elder Zhao, be merciful!”","Huang Fuzhao didn’t expect to be obstructed by his companion. He didn’t check for a while, and his movements slowed down a bit. At this moment, the waiter had already turned around the dilapidated corner and ran out of sight.","“Elder Sanbai, what do you mean by that? That kid is just a scumbag of the human race. He dared to threaten this elder just now. There is no need to keep that little life!” Life is in sight.","Huang Sanbai smiled at him and reassured him: “Elder Zhao, although he is a small person, it is not a pity to die, but this Forest Shade Town is not an easy place. Who knows if this kid knows someone in the town? If any trouble is caused by his death, then there is no need!”","Huang Fuzhao snorted coldly and said, “So what? What kind of power can such a broken town have? Can it threaten us?”","Huang Sanbai shook his head and smiled, “That’s not necessarily the case! When the old man came in just now, he saw an inconspicuous shop nearby with a black shield engraved on the door...”","“Black shield? That’s... the insignia of the Dark Lord?” Huang Shuangyu was startled and interjected.","Huang Sanbai nodded and said, “That’s right, it’s the mark of the Dark Lord! The old man didn’t expect that this small Forest Shade Town is actually one of the strongholds of the Dark Lord!”","Both Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao changed their expressions.","The “Dark Lord” was the largest killer organization in the God Realm. According to legend, there’s more than one peerless powerhouse of the Life Profound Realm in the organization. Therefore, no one of the cultivators below the Fate Profound Realm can escape the hunt of “Dark Lord”!","As long as they can afford to pay extra, even if they are allowed to assassinate the Patriarchs of the major God Clans, it was not impossible!","Therefore, even if Huang Shuangyu and the others are the elders of the ancient god clan, and the real powerhouses of the Dao Profound Realm, they were still very afraid of “Dark Lord”.","Hearing that Forest Shade Town is the site of the “Dark Lord”, most of the contempt they had just now disappeared.","“It’s still because Elder Sanbai is careful enough. Since that’s the case, it’s better for us to keep a low profile.” Huang Fuzhao said with relief.","Huang Shuangyu also nodded and said, “It’s not that I’m afraid of these killers, but we have business to do, so there’s no need to cause more trouble.”","Huang Sanbai twisted his beard and said slowly, “Let’s discuss the next plan.”","He was the leader of the three. When it came to business matters, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao both calmed down, staring at Huang Sanbai, waiting for him to speak."]},{"number":3483,"title":"Chapter 3483 - Kill Them (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Sanbai no longer beat around the bush and spoke directly as he analyzed: “According to what the the waiter said, there are only six people travelling with Li Moying this time. Except for his wife who is disguised, the other four should be his guards. I have seen all of them before, they should all be at the Heart Profound Realm , and his wife should be at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.”","“With this kind of cultivation, even if we add up to six of us, they are still not a match for any of us.” Huang Fuzhao sneered and said, “It seems that it is not difficult to kill them, the main thing is to find them!”","Huang Shuangyu also nodded in agreement.","Huang Sanbai sneered in his heart.","People who have never met Li Moying can easily have such a wrong judgment, thinking how much combat power can a cultivator in the Heart Profound Realm have? It was not enough for a Dao Profound Realm cultivator to waste his energy on!","Only when they actually fight each other will they know what kind of abnormal existence a god-level genius was!","However, Huang Sanbai already had a preliminary plan in mind at this time, so he didn’t bother to correct their thinking, but instead said: “That’s right, so let’s mainly arrange a plan to find someone.”","Huang Shuangyu nodded and said, “Third Brother, you can arrange it!”","Huang Sanbai glanced at Huang Fuzhao, seeing that he had no objection, he was secretly happy.","However, he didn’t show it at all, and he still looked calm and unhurried, “In this case, this old man will be straightforward. Now we don’t know what Li Moying is here for. He may be looking for jade quartz mines. It is also possible to come to find someone nearby, but anyway, after he finishes what he wants to do, there is a high possibility that he will return to Forest Shade Town, because this is the only place in the vicinity that he can park his flying ship.”","After hearing this, the two elders nodded together, “That’s right, what you said makes sense!”","Huang Sanbai said again: “So, among the three of us, there must be someone who stays in Forest Shade Town...”","Having said that, he paused for a moment, showing a bit of embarrassment, “This... this old man thinks that this town is a bit strange, maybe he can find out some news and help us find someone, so I’ll be lazy and stay In the town, I am responsible for collecting information and waiting for people, I’ll have to trouble Second Sister and Elder Zhao to find people outside Forest Shade Town.”","Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao looked at each other and frowned slightly, but after a short thought, they both nodded in agreement.","“Alright, it’s no problem for us to go out and find someone!”","There must be someone to keep in the town. Huang Sanbai is better at dealing with outsiders than them, so it is understandable to stay here.","The three of them discussed for a while, and after confirming some other details did they finally found an inn to rest in.","As soon as Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao entered the inn, they went back to their room to cultivate.","They never expected that Huang Sanbai would sneak out after staying in his room for a while.","He once again found the waiter who was let go by him just now.","The waiter was a little nervous when he saw someone looking for him, but he was relieved when he saw that it was Huang Sanbai.","“So, it turned out to be you, Master... just now, thank you for saving my life...”","In fact, the waiter had also noticed Huang Fuzhao’s killing intent, and even heard the conversation between Huang Sanbai and Huang Fuzhao, knowing that he was about to be silenced!","Huang Sanbai sneered secretly. Just now, he said it so loudly on purpose, just to let the waiter hear it."]},{"number":3484,"title":"Chapter 3484 - Kill Them (7)","paragraphs":["Huang Sanbai still had on a kind and amicable smile on his face, “Young man, I still have a few questions that I need your help with. Can you please come out with me again.”","“Master, I’m happy to help!”","The waiter had already regarded him as a lifesaver, and without doubting him, he followed him and left without hesitation.","Huang Sanbai took him to a secluded corner, and immediately asked: “Do you still remember that at that time, besides asking about the jade quartz mine, did those six people ask you anything?”","The waiter said with a bitter face: “Master, I’ve have already talked about it just now, and other than them asking about the black market. I really can’t think of anything else!”","“Oh? They really didn’t ask anything? Do you still remember what they said at that time?” Huang Sanbai asked.","The waiter shook his head, with a blank expression on his face, “This... I have a bad memory, I really can’t remember...”","“In this case, only this old man can help you think about it!”","When the waiter heard this, his whole body trembled!","For some reason, he suddenly felt that this voice gave him a chill from the bottom of his heart!","Immediately afterwards, he suddenly felt that the amiable face of the old man in front of him suddenly became ferocious, and two red lights seemed to appear in his eyes...","The next moment, his head buzzed and he lost consciousness.","Huang Sanbai put one hand on the waiter’s forehead, his gray eyebrows were tightly knit together as he probed into the waiter’s mind with his spiritual sense, searching for his memory thoroughly.","All the things the waiter Dian encountered this morning formed a series of pictures, which flashed before his eyes one by one.","“It really was Li Moying who came! The man beside him... Tsk tsk, I never thought that such a beautiful woman like Huang Yueli would be willing to dress herself up like this...”","“Sure enough, they asked about the black market, and then asked about the jade quartz mine...”","When Huang Sanbai saw the end, he suddenly became agitated and woke up.","“Hmmm, he also mentioned the skeletons west of Forest Shade Town at the end... what’s in the west of Forest Shade Town?”","Huang Sanbai read the memory of the waiter’s shop several times, and his eyes became deeper and deeper.","Finally, as soon as he let go of his hand, the waiter’s body fell limply to the ground, his eyes were full of emptiness, as he stared into the distance in a daze.","Huang Sanbai didn’t even look at him, and muttered to himself, “Looking at the expressions of Li Moying and the others, I guess the place they are looking for is to the west of Forest Shade Town! For hundreds of years, a place where countless people died, he he, how could it be an ordinary place! Maybe it is some kind of secret realm of ancient cultivators! No wonder, even the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan condescends to come to this ghostly place...”","“Ha ha ha, even the Heavens are helping me! This time, not only can I kill the two scourges Li Moying and Huang Yueli, but maybe I can also enter the secret realm to make a fortune! Huang Yueli, Huang Yueli! Yueli, I really have to thank you very much!”","After Huang Sanbai figured it out, he turned around and was about to leave.","Halfway through, he suddenly turned his head again, took out a porcelain bottle from his arms, and sprinkled a handful of dark yellow powder on the waiter.","The waiter’s body then began to dissipate, turning into a puddle of foul-smelling liquid.","“Anyway, after being soul-searched, even if you live, you can only be a fool. This old man will give you a good release, so as to save you from staying in this world and suffer!”"]},{"number":3485,"title":"Chapter 3485 - Crisis (1)","paragraphs":["On the other side, Huang Yueli and Li Moying led the four guards, and after leaving the Forest Shade City, they first walked about three miles towards the south.","After confirming that no one was following them, they changed direction in the dense forest and headed west.","In the dense forest of the barren land, there were all kinds of spirit beasts all around, as well as various poisonous gases and traps. Every step was challenging.","However, the six of them were all very experienced cultivators, and they had a map in their hands, so their speed was not too slow.","About fifteen or six miles away, Huang Yueli paused.","“Wait, let’s see what’s in front of us?”","Several people took a closer look, and found that there were several corpses by the side of the big tree in front of them, all of which had been completely shrivelled up, leaving only thick white bones, which looked particularly creepy.","Li Tianer cupped his hands and said, “Young Master, subordinate will go and have a look.”","Huang Yueli had been staring at the big tree from afar, not paying attention to the situation.","It wasn’t until Li Tianer came near the big tree that she suddenly reacted and shouted: “Wait, Brother Tianer, we can’t go any further, stop quickly!”","Li Tianer was startled and stopped quickly.","However, it was too late.","When he wanted to withdraw, he suddenly found that his legs were completely unable to move. No matter how hard he tried, he couldn’t move a single step!","“Tianer, you...your legs!” Li Tianyi gasped.","Li Tianer looked down and found that his legs had turned into stones. Moreover, the process of turning into stones had not stopped, and it was still spreading towards his upper body.","Even if it was Li Tianer who was well-informed and knowledgeable, his face had already turned pale with fright at this time.","“Young... Young Master, this... this... save... help!”","“Tianer, don’t move, I’ll save you...”","Li Tianyi and Li Tianer were brothers related by blood and they had a very good relationship. He no longer cared about any other thing, he just want to save his brother.","This time, Huang Yueli was faster as she grabbed him immediately and hollered, “You can’t go!”","“Madame, that’s my brother! Let go!” Li Tianyi flicked his sleeves suddenly, trying to shake Huang Yueli away, but he felt a strong force coming from his shoulders, restraining him. It hurt his meridians, making him unable to move anymore.","Li Moying’s voice came from behind him, “Didn’t you hear what Madame said?”","“But, Young Master, Tianer...”","Li Tianyi wanted to say more, but the petrification process of Li Tianer’s body was too fast. At this time, almost all of his body had turned into rock, no different from a stone sculpture.","If they didn’t know Li Tianer’s real appearance, no one would have imagined that the stone sculpture in front of him was a living cultivator just a dozen breaths ago!","This scene happened so quickly, the few remaining people all had horrific expressions on their faces!","Li Moying let go of Li Tianyi, and Li Tianyi slumped down onto the ground.","Huang Yueli took a deep breath and said, “Brother Tianyi, ??it’s not that I want to stop you from saving your younger brother, but you can’t do anything if you go over now! He’s been invaded by evil qi! You just go over there but can’t save him and in then end, you’ll even end up like him!”","Li Tianyi also knew this truth, but he still couldn’t accept such a result.","“But, my younger brother...is there really no other hope for him? Young Master, I beg you to find a way. He has always been loyal to you. You must save him!”"]},{"number":3486,"title":"Chapter 3486 - Crisis (2)","paragraphs":["When Li Moying heard Li Tianyi’s words, the expression on his face was still indifferent.","“Tianyi, don’t be impatient. When did I say that your brother has no hope?”","Li Tianyi was stunned. After he realized his reaction, his legs softened and he knelt down in front of Li Moying. “Young Master, you have a way to save him, right? Please save him!”","Li Moying frowned slightly, “Get up first!”","However, Li Tianyi insisted on kneeling on the ground and refused to get up.","Li Moying raised his left hand slightly upwards, and Li Tianyi felt a peaceful, stable but extremely powerful profound force rising upwards from the bottom of his body.","He couldn’t resist this force at all, so he could only stand up.","Li Moying met Li Tianyi’s expectant gaze, and said lightly, “It’s useless for you to beg me for this matter. There is someone else who can save your brother.”","Li Tianyi’s eyes widened, “Young Master, what do you mean...could it be...”","He turned his gaze to Huang Yueli who was standing next to Li Moying, with a face full of disbelief, even though the meaning behind Li Moying’s words was very clear, but...","Huang Yueli was so young, and he only heard that she was a genius Spiritual Armament Master, but never heard of her outstanding attainments in arrays!","Besides, in this forest, there were countless cultivators who were killed by evil qi intruding into their bodies, and there must be some experienced array masters among them, but they still perished here in the end. Huang Yueli was so young, even if she has some insight into arrays, most probably the level was limited.","Could she really save people who had been completely petrified?","Li Tianyi looked at Huang Yueli suspiciously, “Madame, is... my brother... can he be saved? Please think of a way!”","Huang Yueli had been staring intently at Li Tianer’s feet, her brows slightly frowned, her fingers intertwined, and she was softly reciting formulas, as if she was calculating something.","Li Tianyi suddenly spoke to her, interrupting her train of thought, causing Huang Yueli to frown subconsciously.","However, when she turned her head and saw Li Tianyi’s worried face, the anger for being interrupted just now disappeared at once.","“Brother Tianyi, ??don’t worry. If it’s really a person who has been completely petrified, even a Spiritual Armament Master at the Fate Profound Realm will not be able to save him. However, Brother Tianer has just been petrified. The appearance has been completely petrified, but he has a body protected by profound power inside, so it is not easy to be petrifed inside, and he is an elite cultivator of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, with pure and mellow profound power, he can last a little longer.”","After hearing this, Li Tianyi heaved a sigh of relief, and just wanted to speak.","But who knows, Huang Yueli went on to say: “However, no matter how long you persist, it will not exceed half an hour. Moreover, this array of gathering evil qi is a bit different from the ordinary array of gathering qi. I have never done it before...”","Li Tianyi choked when he heard her and he almost couldn’t even catch his breath, his face flushed red, and he coughed repeatedly.","However, Huang Yueli’s attention had once again shifted to the array, without even looking at him, she walked straight towards Li Tianer.","“Madame, this...”","Seeing Huang Yueli making such a dangerous move, the remaining two guards wanted to go up and stop her.","Li Moying waved his hand slightly, “Let her go. From now on, no one is allowed to speak, so as not to disturb her.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she turned her head and smiled sweetly at him."]},{"number":3487,"title":"Chapter 3487 - Crisis (3)","paragraphs":["When she turned away, the smile on her face disappeared immediately and her expression became extremely serious.","She first walked three or four times around Li Tianer, but instead of looking at Li Tianer himself, she carefully observed the land under his feet, with a thoughtful expression on her face.","Immediately afterwards, she walked under several big trees in front of her, inspected the corpses under the trunks, and even took out a pair of silver silk gloves from her space, put them on her hands, and began to rummage through these corpses.","At the beginning, the guards were all stunned when they saw Huang Yueli’s actions. They all had extremely nervous expressions on their faces, fearing that Huang Yueli would take a wrong step and become like Li Tianer.","Li Tianyi almost couldn’t help crying out.","Fortunately, he still remembered Li Moying’s order just now, so he choked back his cry.","He turned his head subconsciously and found that Li Moying was also focusing on Huang Yueli’s every move.","However, Li Moying was obviously not as nervous as the three of them. The expression on his face was still the same as usual, but his right hand was always pressed on the hilt of his waist, ready to save her at any time.","Under everyone’s fearful gaze, Huang Yueli took one step at a time and moved all around. Although the speed was not fast, every step was very steady without any pause.","What they feared never happened.","Not only that, Huang Yueli even took out her gloves to check the corpse!","Seeing this scene, the eyeballs of the guards almost didn’t fall off!","Was there a need to be so exaggerated?","Li Tianer can be regarded as a cultivator with a lot of experience. When he stepped forward just now, he was also prepared and cautious, but within a few steps, he was hit and turned into stone.","And Huang Yueli walked over for bit here and then went over to the other side but it didn’t affect her at all?","Originally, Li Tianyi didn’t really believe that Huang Yueli could save his younger brother, and he was in despair.","But now, seeing Huang Yueli’s performance, he felt some hope reignite in his heart.","It seems that Huang Yueli really has a lot of research on arrays, maybe...she can really figure out a way?","Huang Yueli checked around, and later, she took out a particularly large white jade array, and repeatedly pinched her fingers to calculate.","Time passed bit by bit, and soon, before the half hour deadline, there was only the last bit of time left.","Li Tianyi began to get nervous again, looking at Li Tianer who was in a petrified state from time to time, his anxiety was already at the brink.","He really wanted to go up and ask Huang Yueli, what was going on now!","However, on the one hand, he didn’t dare to disobey Li Moying’s order, and on the other hand, he was also afraid of disturbing Huang Yueli, so he could only hold back forcefully, almost suffering from internal injuries.","Finally, Huang Yueli stopped. Turned around and looked towards them.","“Alright, I have a general understanding of how this array works. There are thirty-six array eyes in this array. If you want to completely crack it, it may take several days of work, and it may not be completely done. Moreover, there is no need for it. We just need to destroy the eye around Big Brother Tianer.”","Hearing this, Li Tianyi immediately stood up and asked, “Madame, what are we going to do? Please just give orders! Time is running out...”"]},{"number":3488,"title":"Chapter 3488 - Crisis (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli strode towards them and said, “Alright, then I will just say it in a simple manner. All you need to do next is to destroy the devil stones in the four positions at the same time.”","Hearing her words, even Li Moying was stunned, “Devil stone??”","Huang Yueli nodded and said, “Yes, I was surprised when I saw it just now! The array that gathers evil qi is used to maintain the operation of the array, and it is not the crystal core of the spirit beast. It’s a devil stone dug out of the Sky Devil Race! No wonder it’s so gloomy...”","When the three guards heard this, they looked at each other in dismay.","“This, this...”","Ordinary cultivators only knew that the crystal cores of spirit beasts can be used to form arrays or to assist in cultivation. They have also heard that the Sky Devils use the profound energy in the dantian of the cultivators as materialsfor alchemy. However, they had never ever heard that the devil stone also had the same effect!","Li Moying was also surprised, but he frowned slightly before he brought the subject back.","“Can we just destroy these devil stones? What else do we need to do?”","Huang Yueli said: “If you just destroy the devil stone, then in the area covered by the array, all petrified living creatures will instantly turn into powder, and in that case, Big Brother Tianer will not be saved. Therefore, it is necessary to replace these devil stones with ordinary spirit beast core. After you crush the devil stone, put these spirit beast core on the position of the devil stone immediately. The speed must be fast! Otherwise, once an accident occurs, the consequences will be inconceivable.”","Everyone understood the importance of this matter and nodded solemnly.","Huang Yueli took out four spirit beast crystal cores from her space.","These four spirit beasts were all hunted and killed in the Wilderness Lands just now, and they were all equivalent to the cultivation level of the middle stage of the human race’s Heart Profound Realm.","She distributed the crystal cores to Li Moying and the three guards, and said at the same time: “Fortunately, we killed a lot of spirit beasts just now, otherwise, if we were to rush to kill them now, it might be too late. However, the strength of these spirit beasts is pretty bad. It is too low, and the energy it can provide is not comparable to the devil stones left by Saint Iniquitous Shadows, and it can only last for a short time. After we rescue Big Brother Tianer, we must leave this area immediately.”","The four of them all nodded to show their understanding, and followed Huang Yueli’s instructions carefully. They strictly followed the footprints she left on the ground and they slowly moved forward and finally took their places one by one.","“Go!”","Huang Yueli gave an order, and the four of them started working together, shattering the devil stone in front of them.","At the same time as the devil stone shattered, the dense forest floor with a radius of several hundred metres began to shake violently, and cracks even began to appear in some places.","Several people were in it, and their bodies swayed back and forth, unable to stand at all.","Li Moying’s reaction was extremely fast. Although the accident happened suddenly, it did not affect his movements at all. With a flick of his wrist, he buried the crystal core of the spirit beast deeply into the ground.","But what happened to the three guards, it wasn’t as optimistic.","Li Tianyi and Li Tiansan’s cultivation was not bad. Although they almost fell a few times, they managed to withstand the pressure and put the spirit beast core in place.","But Li Tiansi was not so lucky. A crack appeared under his feet. He was caught off guard. As soon as his body tilted, he fell towards the crack, and the crystal core of the spirit beast in his hand fell to one side.","“Tiansi!”","Li Tianyi screamed in surprise and wanted to rush over to help, but the distance between the two sides was too far! It was too late!"]},{"number":3489,"title":"Chapter 3489 - Crisis (5)","paragraphs":["Just at this critical moment, Huang Yueli’s voice suddenly sounded!","“Stop, if you don’t want to turn into a stone sculpture, don’t move!”","Li Tianyi was shocked and stopped quickly.","Immediately after, he saw a white figure whizzing past everyone like a bolt of lightning, tapped her toes on the ground a few times, and reached Li Tiansi’s side.","Huang Yueli picked up the spirit beast crystal core on the ground and inserted it into the vacant position.","Following her movement, the shaking of the ground stopped immediately.","One after another, golden rays of light rose from the positions of the four spirit beast crystal cores, shrouding the surrounding small area in a curtain of light.","“The array is starting to work...” Li Tianyi immediately realized this, and his spirit was lifted.","Under the baptism of the golden light, the stones outside the petrified statues turned into gray sand at a speed visible to the naked eye, and crumbled to the ground.","When the light completely dissipated, all the bodies of the petrified cultivators returned to normal.","However, these were all corpses that have been petrified for hundreds of years and have hence perished along with time.","Only Li Tianer really escaped the disaster.","When he realized that he was able to move, he still had a blank expression on his face, looked at his hands in a daze, and then lowered his head to look at his feet. He survived.","Li Tianyi rushed forward excitedly and hugged him.","“Second Brother, why are you so impulsive? Thanks to the Madame for saving you this time, otherwise, you will have to give up your life here! In the future, you must listen to the orders of the Young Master and the Madame and don’t act so recklessly!”","“Yes... Did Madame save me?” Li Tianer said in surprise.","Li Tianyi sighed: “Yes, it’s Madame! I really didn’t expect that the Madame is so powerful that she can even crack the array left by the evil cultivator tens of thousands of years ago... Come here quickly and let’s thank her together!”","Although Li Tianer was still at a loss, Li Tianyi, who had always been arrogant and cold, was now facing Huang Yueli with a completely different expression. He had on a wide smile and sparkling eyes while Li Tiansan and Li Tiansi were even more reverent. Looking at Huang Yueli and seeing their respectful attitude, it was no different from looking at Li Moying!","Li Tianer reacted immediately, followed Li Tianyi forward and thanked Huang Yueli.","“Madame, thank you for saving subordinate’s life! In the future, subordinates will repay your kindness!”","Huang Yueli waved her hand, “You don’t need to say such words, I know you are very loyal, but you have to be careful, there must be many traps hidden around the evil cultivator’s abode, and even I can’t say for sure. If you can reach the secret realm safely, you should not act without authorization!”","“Yes, this subordinate understands!”","Huang Yueli said again: “The energy of the crystal core has begun to weaken, we must leave here immediately! Let’s go!”","Now, the guards have realized that Huang Yueli’s insight was the key to their safe passage through the Wilderness Lands, so they obeyed her orders without saying a word.","Huang Yueli took a few steps and suddenly realized that Li Moying hadn’t followed.","She turned her head, frowned slightly, and glanced coldly at the woods behind them.","“Husband?” Huang Yueli urged him.","Li Moying said coldly, “It seems that there’s someone!”"]},{"number":3490,"title":"Chapter 3490 - Suspicious Person (1)","paragraphs":["When Huang Yueli and the four guards heard this, they were all shocked.","“What? Someone?” Huang Yueli frowned slightly.","Even she didn’t sense anything abnormal about the surroundings.","Li Moying nodded, and said in a low voice: “Not only is there someone, but... a dangerous person!” As he spoke, he raised his hand and drew out the long sword in his hand, the profound strength around him suddenly increased, and the powerful pressure instantly filled the entire forest.","Seeing his serious expression, Huang Yueli also became serious.","Li Tianyi and the others also drew their swords one after another, and carefully explored the surroundings.","Holding the long sword in his hand, Li Moying walked slowly towards a corner to the east of the forest.","Huang Yueli was a little worried about him, so she followed closely.","Li Moying’s target location was covered with vines, and there were several towering giant trees with thick trunks. There were indeed many obstacles to block it.","However, Li Moying’s profound force was all around, and even the breeze in the woods was suppressed, not even a single leaf swayed. It really didn’t look like there was anyone there.","However, as Huang Yueli approached that position step by step, a dangerous premonition appeared in her heart!","Here... Something is really wrong.","Suddenly, Li Moying’s footsteps stopped, and at the same time, he stretched out her hand to stop Huang Yueli.","“You stay where you are first, I’ll go over and have a look.”","“But...”","“Listen to me. In case of any accident, you can find a way to help me later. It’s better than both of us being caught.”","Only then did Huang Yueli nod her head, and stopped in her tracks.","Li Moying continued to walk forward. This time, his pace was slower, but also more determined.","Every time he takes a step, his consciousness will scan the large area around him to judge whether there is any abnormality around him.","Li Moying’s spiritual consciousness is inherently very powerful. Although in her previous life, she had split a part of it for Huang Yueli through the technique of splitting the soul, resulting in a sharp drop in the strength of her spiritual consciousness. The state is weaker.","However, no matter what, his consciousness is still stronger than most of the cultivators in the God Realm.","Under his spiritual detection, it is almost impossible for all cultivators below the Dap Profound Realm to hide their identities.","Li Moying almost walked around all around, but she still couldn’t confirm the location of the abnormal movement just now.","His face became even more gloomy.","There are almost only two possibilities for this to happen.","One is people who secretly follow them. They have a particularly strong spiritual sense and are proficient in the secrets of the primordial spirit. This kind of person is definitely the top killer in the God Realm.","The second possibility is that the other party has a cultivation level above the Dao Profound Realm!","No matter which possibility it is, it is very dangerous for them who were unfamiliar with the place.","While Li Moying was walking around to investigate, Huang Yueli was also perceiving the surrounding situation.","Suddenly, a slight sound sounded from behind her right!","The sound was very, very soft, like a needle falling on the ground, but Huang Yueli was keenly aware of it.","She immediately pointed in that direction and said loudly, “There!”","At the same time, Li Moying also caught the slightest movement, and his figure was fastlike a streak of lightning, and he quickly rushed towards Huang Yueli’s finger!","There was a “chuckle”!","The sharp edge of the long sword burst out suddenly, piercing the sky!"]},{"number":3491,"title":"Chapter 3491 - Suspicious Person (2)","paragraphs":["Li Moying’s sword was extremely fast, and the long sword in his hand was extremely sharp after he had imbued it with his profound strength.","With one blow of the sword, the vine in front of him was cut in two.","And behind the vine, a piece of sleeve fell to the ground.","Obviously, there was someone here!","However, this person’s cultivation was obviously not weak. Under Li Moying’s sudden burst of sword intent, he even managed to avoid it.","A cold glint flashed by Li Moying’s eyes, he flicked his wrist, changed the angle, and continued to attack.","But, the moment he shot...","The nearby ground suddenly shook violently again!","The cracks in the ground that were closed just now also cracked open towards the two sides again!","With another flick of Li Moying’s wrist, the angle of the long sword’s target deviated a little, but he did not hit the target.","“Damn it!” Li Moying cursed in a low voice!","The ground began to shake more and more violently. Although he could barely stand still and draw his sword, the energy around him became extremely chaotic, and he couldn’t use his divine sense to detect the opponent’s position at all.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed even more, “Moying, hurry up, get out of there! The energy of those spirit beast crystal cores have been exhausted! We must leave here immediately! Otherwise, this forest will sink into the ground and we’ll perish as well!”","Li Moying frowned, he looked fixatedly at the vine as he scanned the surroundings, reluctant to leave.","Just a little bit, just a little bit more!","If it wasn’t for the sudden exhaustion of the energy of the spirit beast crystal core, which caused the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s array to be on the verge of collapse again, then his sword just now would definitely have stabbed the person hiding in the dark!","Right now, the other party definitely hasn’t had a chance to run away, but...","But he couldn’t detect the other party’s location no matter what!","“Moying—! Come here quickly, the array is about to collapse, it’s too late!! You... what are you thinking??” Huang Yueli urged in a flustered voice.","Seeing that Li Moying was not moving, she ran over directly, trying to forcibly drag him away.","Seeing her rushing over, Li Moying gritted his teeth, and immediately appeared beside Huang Yueli.","He stretched out his strong arms and hooked Huang Yueli’s waist. With a few taps on his feet, he flew out of the area covered by the array.","Just at the moment the two of them left, the ground in that area completely caved in.","Large cracks formed along the ground and crumbled as everything around caved in alongside, including the trees that were all broken under the violent tremors and fell into the ground.","The rumbling sound was endless.","Huang Yueli and the others couldn’t help but cover their ears.","It took a while before the violent tremors gradually subsided.","When everything returned to calm, they all looked back. The place where they stood just now had turned into a pile of ruins.","If Huang Yueli and the others hadn’t left in time just now, they must have been buried under countless giant trees. Even if they didn’t die, they would be disabled...","Everyone looked at each other, feeling a little scared in their hearts.","Li Moying was even more flustered, clasped the slender waist of the lady in his arms, and growled at her: “Are you crazy? It was so dangerous just now, the array has already started to collapse! You didn’t run outside and you evendare to run in the opposite direction?!”","Recalling the moment when Huang Yueli rushed towards him just now, Li Moying felt that his heart was about to stop."]},{"number":3492,"title":"Chapter 3492 - Suspicious Person (3)","paragraphs":["Being yelled at by her husband, not only did she feel aggrieved, she simply snapped and hollered back at him.","“How dare you talk about me! Who was the person who just stood there foolishly just now, huh?? No matter who was following us, you can’t make fun of your own life! Don’t you know the consequences once you fall into such a situation? In such an array, physical injury is secondary, and one will definitely be eroded by evil qi after staying for a while, and it would be absolutely impossible to save your life?”","As if to confirm what Huang Yueli said, in the pile of ruins behind them, the fallen and broken tree trunks were all petrifying at a speed visible to the naked eye.","When Li Tianyi and the others saw this scene, their faces turned pale.","The array of evil cultivators were really too evil! There were traps everywhere!","There was no room for mistakes.","Huang Yueli glared at Li Moying angrily, feeling flustered and angry at the same time.","That’s how this man was, always relying on his high strength and quick response, he doesn’t take his own safety in mind! Had he never thought that such a risky move would make those who care about him so worried!","Moreover, how dare he scold her?!","Li Moying looked at the pair of eyes that were glaring back at him angrily and upon seeing her angry expression, his anger dissipated at once.","At the same time, he also felt a little guilty.","“Uh... this... I’m just...” He met with Huang Yueli’s eyes, and hesitantly tried to explain, “Little Li’er, I’m still sure I’ll escape at the last moment. I just think, it’s just very wasted. It was just a little more and ...I’ll be able to drag that person out...”","Huang Yueli interrupted him angrily, “Just a little bit! You didn’t almost catch someone out, but you almost died! Besides, what if you caught that person? What? In that case, can you stab that person to death with a sword, or can you run after that person? For someone who is able to hide their whereabouts so well, that person must be a master, you can’t deal with it with three or two moves! In the event that you’re dragged down by him and miss the opportunity to escape, then...then...”","Huang Yueli’s eyes were red with anger, “Do you know what you were doing?!”","Seeing that Huang Yueli became more and more angry, her voice began to tremble, Li Moying felt extremely distressed.","Just now, he was thinking of finding a reason to justify himself, but at this moment, he could no longer care about anything, he could only keep bowing his head to his wife and admit his mistake, just to make her stop being angry.","“Little Li’er, I was wrong, it’s all my fault! I didn’t think carefully! Don’t be mad at me, next time I will definitely listen to you and put my own safety first!”","“There’s still a next time?!” Huang Yueli glared at him with her eyes narrowed dangerously.","Li Moying shuddered and said hurriedly, “No, there will be no next time! I promise!”","Huang Yueli’s expression became a little better now, but she was still raging within. She glanced at Li Moying from time to time, her eyes were cold, and she was obviously still angry.","On the other hand, Li Moying kept smiling all the time, saying all kinds of sweet words, trying his best to coax her.","As Li Tianyi and the others watched from the side, they were all staring at the scene before them with their mouths agape.","They must have hit their head just now and they were hallucinating! Otherwise, how could they see such a scene?","Where was their wise and majestic Young Master?","Who was this person who was desperately trying to be in the good books of this beautiful woman? They couldn’t recognize him."]},{"number":3493,"title":"Chapter 3493 - Suspicious Person (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli argued with Li Moying for a while, but didn’t delay their business.","Her eyes had been scanning back and forth around the position of the array just now, wanting to see if the person following them was still nearby.","However, the trees in the forest were too dense to see what was in the distance.","In addition, the chaotic energy that was running rampant caused by the collapse of the array had not completely dissipated, and it had become impossible to use her divine sense to detect the opponent’s position.","She looked at the opposite side thoughtfully, “I wonder if the person who was following is still there?”","When Li Moying heard her change the subject, and saw that she seemed to have calmed down, he secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","He held Huang Yueli’s shoulders and gently took her into his arms, then said, “I think that person must have left this area by now. Although we couldn’t catch that person, but It is estimated that that person would not dare to follow us in the future.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “I think so too. Although I don’t know what the other party’s background is, since we got rid of him, it’s better for us to continue on our way. Staying in place is the most dangerous.”","Li Moying nodded in agreement, “Alright, I’ll listen to you.”","After listening to this analysis, several guards were all at a loss.","Li Tianer asked in confusion: “Young Master, what’s this... what is going on here? How can you be sure that you have dumped the person you followed? If he is still nearby, if we continue to go deeper, I am afraid that It’s dangerous! Otherwise, it’s better for your subordinates to go look!”","Li Tianyi couldn’t help but glared at him, “Shut up! Wasn’t the lesson learned just now not deep enough? You almost lost your life, yet you are still so impulsive? The judgment of the Young Master and Madame will never be wrong!”","“But...” Li Tianer was scolded and his face was full of grievances.","Huang Yueli didn’t care, and waved her hand, “Big Brother Tianyi, ??there’s no need to be so mad at him. In fact, the reason is very simple. Although the person who followed us before was not weak, he obviously did not have the ability to kill all six of us! Otherwise, when Moying attacked him just now, he would have revealed himself and come out to attack us!”","“Uh...” Li Tianer was stunned for a moment, then suddenly showed a look of surprise, “What Madame said is very true!”","However, Huang Yueli’s analysis was not over yet, and she continued: “Besides, this person seems to be unfamiliar with the methods of evil cultivators. If he understands the surrounding terrain and arrays, While Brother Tianer was petrified just now, we were all busy saving people, he could take action on us, we were not prepared at that time, if we were suddenly attacked by him, it would definitely be a disaster!”","“Therefore, the only explanation is that he doesn’t understand the arrays either, and is afraid of rushing in to attack us. If he takes a wrong step, he will be invaded by evil qi and turn into a stone statue!”","“The opponent’s strength is not as good as us, and he has no map in hand, and now he has exposed the fact that he is following us. If he still insists on following behind, then the dangerous person is not us, but himself!”","When Li Tianer heard this, he was already convinced.","“Madame, you are really amazing... No wonder even the Young Master obeys you! Subordinate is really convinced!” He said from the bottom of his heart.","Li Tianyi glared at him, “I told you earlier that it was only Madame who could save you!”"]},{"number":3494,"title":"Chapter 3494 - Suspicious Person (5)","paragraphs":["In fact, Li Tianer still doesn’t know how he was rescued before.","He was the only one who lost consciousness due to the evil qi entering his body. He didn’t even know what was happening around him.","When Li Tianyi saw his foolish appearance, he quickly dragged him aside to educate him.","Li Moying looked at his little fox and showed a smile, “Alright, if there is no problem, let’s set off now! Is the map with you?”","Huang Yueli took out the map from her pocket, opened it and pointed at one spot.","“Did you see? The location where we were almost in danger just now is...here! The dangerous location has been marked on the map, but there are still some people who don’t obey commands and rush over by themselves...”","Li Tianer laughed wryly and was too ashamed to speak.","Huang Yueli didn’t look at him at all, but muttered thoughtfully while looking at the map, “If we follow the route marked on the map, we’ll go straight through this route, avoiding the positions ahead, hmm, we should be able to enter the secret realm smoothly. But now there is a problem...”","Her delicate brows furrowed slightly, “We had no choice but to destroy one of the array eyes, thus changing the flow direction of the heaven and earth profound energy in the forest. Will it be affected, we will not know. I am afraid that something unexpected will happen...”","Li Moying heard the words, pursed his lips, thought for a moment, and asked, “Then, can we change the route? If we go around here, here, and here, I wonder if it can be done?”","His fingers lightly slid across the map, outlining a new route.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up immediately, “What you said makes sense! If this is the case... Well, there may be fewer variables encountered, but it will take a lot of detours...”","“It doesn’t matter if it’s farther away. It only takes a day or two longer to go around. It’s better than encountering unpredictable dangers on the road. Besides, if we changed our route suddenly, the person who followed us might lose their target.”","Thinking of the mysterious follower who escaped his attack earlier, Li Moying still felt a little uncomfortable, “I always feel that this guy is not an ordinary robber, maybe he won’t give up easily!”","Although Li Moying was not a chosen one like Xia Yunxi, he usually does not have the ability to predict.","However, he has a sense of crisis that only a top genius can have, and can keenly perceive many potential dangers.","Huang Yueli actually felt the same way.","So, she nodded resolutely, “Alright, then let’s take this longer route! Let’s go!”","Li Moying turned her head and glanced at the four guards behind her, “You all follow closely, no one is allowed to act without my order! Otherwise, you will bear the consequences!”","All four of them shuddered, “Yes, this subordinate understands!”","Li Moying took Huang Yueli’s little hand and walked side by side with her.","...","And on the other side of the array, deep in the dense forest.","Huang Sanbai was hiding behind a huge rock, panting desperately.","It took a while before he felt calmer, and raised his hand to wipe the cold sweat from his forehead.","“Damn it, what kind of hellish place did Li Moying and the others come to, I almost lost my life!”"]},{"number":3495,"title":"Chapter 3495 - Suspicious Person (6)","paragraphs":["After Huang Sanbai interrogated the waiter and killed him, he decisively left Forest Shade Town and came to the dense forest to the west.","He guessed that Li Moying and Huang Yueli had discovered a hidden secret realm, and there was a high possibility that they were on their way to the secret realm!","This kind of speculation made Huang Sanbai’s whole body boil with enthusiasm, he couldn’t wait to find Huang Yueli and immediately kill them, and take the secret treasure they found for himself!","However, he still managed to retain some reason. After a short period of excitement, he gradually calmed down and knew that this matter could not be rushed.","Neither Huang Yueli nor Li Moying were easy. If he acted rashly, he might lose it all!","However, he could no longer stay in Forest Shade Town and wait for news. If Huang Yueli finds the secret realm early and enters it, it will not be so easy for him to find them.","Therefore, Huang Sanbai left Forest Shade Town while no one was paying attention.","He headed west for a while, and soon saw the corpses lying under the big trees.","Huang Sanbai’s experience was very rich, and he naturally knows that there are many dangers around here, and he can’t go forward at will. Just when he was wandering, not knowing whether he should go back first, he saw the figure of Huang Yueli and her group and immediately hid behind the tree.","Huang Yueli’s guess was not bad at all.","Huang Sanbai originally thought of attacking while Huang Yueli was not paying attention, but seeing Li Tianer instantly turned into a stone statue, Huang Sanbai was frightened!","He huddled in the bushes without daring to move.","It was only when Huang Yueli and the others temporarily controlled the nearly collapsed array and were about to leave the area, Huang Sanbai moved a bit, ready to follow.","Who knows, just like this, Li Moying at the end of the team discovered the abnormality!","The moment Li Moying drew his sword towards his hiding place, Huang Sanbai’s heart almost stopped!","He never dreamed that the speed and power of Li Moying’s sword had actually increased so much! Compared with the time he met him in Sacred Phoenix Continent a few months ago, there has been a qualitative leap!","Fortunately, Huang Sanbai was a strong practitioner of the Dao Profound Realm after all, so he managedto avoid the attack, however it was a close shave.","At this moment, he had already begun to deeply regret his underestimation and imprudence!","When Li Moying was in the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, he was able to use the summoning of the Little Qilin to force him back, and he could also join forces with Jun Sihan to kill the powerhouses in the middle stage of the Sky Devil!","Now, Li Moying’s cultivation base has clearly entered the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","In addition, Li Moying also has a monstrous Huang Yueli beside him!","Although that little girl was young, she didn’t cultivate as long as Li Moying, and she didn’t get the family resources of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. However, she was also a god-level genius after all!","Only Heavens know if her current strength has improved?","Facing the enemy, Huang Sanbai wanted to kill both of them at the same time, which was definitely not an easy task.","Wanting to understand this, Huang Sanbai regretted coming here so rashly.","Once his identity is revealed here and Huang Yueli’s vigilance is aroused, it will be even more difficult for him to kill them! Therefore, he can only choose to dodge as much as possible without exposing it.","However, the speed at which Li Moying drew his sword was too fast!","Even Huang Sanbai felt that he couldn’t keep up with Li Moying’s speed and was forced into danger by him!"]},{"number":3496,"title":"Chapter 3496 - Going to Make A Fortune (1)","paragraphs":["In the end, because the array suddenly collapsed for the second time, Li Moying had no choice but to retreat, which allowed Huang Sanbai to find an opportunity to escape from Li Moying’s grasp narrowly.","Huang Sanbai made adjustments, waited until the tremors on the ground had completely stopped, and looked back. However, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had long disappeared by then.","“This is troublesome... It’s almost dawn, it seems that I can only go back first!”","...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying led the four guards forward along the new route.","!!","This route was very different from the optimal route they planned at the beginning, but it seemed much safer, and there were fewer corpses on the roadside than they had seen before.","However, there were still various crises lurking on the road. Although everyone was careful along the way and strictly obeyed Huang Yueli’s command, there would still be cases of ill-considered situations.","Fortunately, these small accidents did not cause too much damage.","After continuing to advance for a day and two nights and killing several high-level spirit beasts, Huang Yueli finally stopped.","“If I’m not mistaken, the entrance to the secret realm should be around here.” She held her chin, her gaze was solemn.","The guards were a little surprised and turned their heads to look around.","“Are we really going to get there? But...it doesn’t look any different from other places in the dense forest, does it?”","“That’s right, besides, there are no corpses in the vicinity for five or six miles, which means that the vicinity is still very safe. Do you think that Saint Iniquitous Shadow has arranged so many traps and arraysso he is easing them as they are nearing the periphery of his abode?”","Everyone was full of doubts.","Only Li Moying didn’t ask any questions. He just looked at the girl beside him with those charming peach eyes, and his eyes were filled with tenderness and trust.","From the beginning to the end, he believed in all of Huang Yueli’s judgments. No matter how strange and unreasonable it seemed to outsiders, he also believed that his Little Li’er would not make a mistake.","Huang Yueli said confidently: “The location of the entrance marked on the map must be right here! There are no corpses around. This abnormality just shows that there are unusual secrets hidden in this area! From the distribution of arrays around, according to the current situation, what’s here should be the source of the evil qi in the outer arrays...”","As she spoke, she raised her eyebrows, and glanced at Li Tianer with a half-smile.","“That is to say, the level of evil qi here is much higher than that of the outer area! It’s just that we can’t feel it when we are in it. However, if Brother Tianer takes a wrong step here, I’m afraid it won’t happen at all.” There is a process of petrification, and it will turn into a pile of dust in an instant...”","Hearing this, Li Tianer couldn’t help shivering.","Just imagining such a scene makes one’s heart tremble.","The guards all shivered. They put up all their energy and put on a defensive posture. They were still a little bit slack and tired just now, but now they’re gone!","Li Moying curled his lips amusedly.","He could see that although it was dangerous here, it was not as exaggerated as what Huang Yueli said. She mainly wanted to scare Li Tianyi and the others.","After scaring the guards, Huang Yueli picked up the map and continued to study it.","“This is the source of evil qi, and the way to open the entrance is closely related to the surrounding arrays...”"]},{"number":3497,"title":"Chapter 3497 - Going to Make A Fortune (2)","paragraphs":["“However, after we destroyed an array eye earlier, it also affected the flow of evil qi at this source... It seems that I can’t easily open the entrance, and I have to recalculate...”","Huang Yueli muttered to herself with a focused expression.","Although she didn’t speak clearly, the guards all understood.","Knowing that it was the array they destroyed just now, it also affected the surrounding environment, causing unpredictable changes.","Several people looked at each other, and couldn’t help admiring Huang Yueli even more in their hearts.","!!","If it weren’t for their Madame here, they wouldn’t have thought so much at all, and would have followed the method marked out on the map to open the entrance without second thoughts.","In this way, no one knows what kind of unexpected situation will happen.","The most likely scenario was that everyone would be immediately invaded by evil qi and turned into stone and may even crumble into dust by now...","Huang Yueli took out the array disk again and kept calculating.","Originally, the guards thought that it would take less than half an hour for Huang Yueli to come out, and the crisis this time could be easily resolved again.","However, this time, Huang Yueli spent a long time calculating as she went back and forth many times.","Everyone didn’t dare to move, for fear that they would be turned into ashes, so they stood in place and waited for Huang Yueli to complete the calculation.","As a result, one hour, two hours, three hours passed, and Huang Yueli was still walking back and forth muttering words.","The legs of the guards were all stiff, but when they looked back at Li Moying, they found that their Young Master was standing there calmly, his eyes following Huang Yueli, and there was no trace of impatience on his face.","In this way, no one dared to complain, so they could only wait obediently.","Finally, Huang Yueli stopped and exhaled a long breath.","“I finally understand... Huh... This array is really too complicated...”","Huang Yueli also revealed a trace of tiredness on her face.","For such a long time, repeated calculations with a high degree of concentration will consume a lot of mental power.","The person who had it the hardest was Huang Yueli herself!","Li Moying looked at her tired face in distress and said in a low and magnetic voice: “Is there a way to open the entrance to the secret realm? What do we need to do?”","Huang Yueli said: “Actually, opening the entrance itself is not complicated. There are several traps buried here, and each trap is inlaid with a devil stone of a Sky Devil top exponent. Removing the devil stone will close the surrounding hidden traps and reveal the entrance. However, the order of removing the devil stone is different from the one marked on the map...”","As she said that, she looked at Li Moying again, “By the way, there is one more thing, because these devil stones are left by the Sky Devil top exponents, so they need cultivators above the Dao Profound Realm to remove them successfully. Brother Tianyi and the others don’t have the ability, Moying, you...”","Huang Yueli wanted to ask Li Moying if he had any confidence.","However, before she could speak, Li Moying nodded slightly, “I understand, leave this matter to me!”","Huang Yueli immediately swallowed the question back.","As long as Li Moying said that he had no issues, it meant he had the confidence. If he was not sure, he would never talk nonsense.","Huang Yueli said: “Since this is the case, then you follow me, let’s go together...”","Before she finished speaking, Huang Yueli suddenly felt her waist tighten, and her feet left the ground.","She was actually hugged by someone!"]},{"number":3498,"title":"Chapter 3498 - Going to Make A Fortune (3)","paragraphs":["“Ah—!” Huang Yueli was taken aback and turned to glared at Li Moying, “You... what are you doing? Let me down!”","Li Moying looked at the faint shadow under her eyes with distress, and whispered: “Don’t think I didn’t see it, you spent too much mental energy and you can’t stand still? You almost fell on a stone just now... ”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect that her foot was bruised just now, but it was just a small episode, which was also noticed by Li Moying.","Her heart suddenly warmed, but after seeing the guards behind Li Moying who looked up at the sky very awkwardly, her face flushed again.","She pushed Li Moying’s chest, “That’s just... it’s just that I didn’t stand firm for a while. I’m all right, you let me down! Without me taking you away, you would easily step on the wrong side. Wherever you go, it’s dangerous!”","However, Li Moying held her firmly with both hands and did not move.","Huang Yueli’s strength acting on him was like tickling him.","“You just tell me how to go, I will never go wrong.”","“But...”","“Look, it’s getting dark, don’t waste any more time.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glared at Li Moying angrily again.","This man had the audacity to say that she wasted time!","Who the hell picked her up suddenly? If it wasn’t for his whim, they wouldn’t have to argue here at all, alright?","Li Moying was stunned by his little fox, but he was very thick-skinned and showed no guilty conscience at all. He still looked directly at his beloved wife in his arms with a firm attitude.","Helpless, Huang Yueli could only cover her face, pretending that Li Tianyi and the others didn’t exist, “Then... that’s fine. But you must listen to me and don’t go wrong! Otherwise, we will all die. It’s gone!”","Li Moying glanced at her disdainfully, “You said this because you don’t believe in your husband’s strength?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and snorted, “Your strength is no problem, but if you love to be brave, that’s all!”","Li Moying was quite nervous at first, but after hearing this, she immediately shrank her neck in guilt.","The day before yesterday, when they had just entered the Wilderness Lands, he was almost buried by the array because he was eager to catch the person who was following them...","“Alright, alright, I’ll listen to you! When did I not listen to you?” Li Moying raised his chin arrogantly.","Looking at the man’s pursed lips, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but laugh a little.","“Alright then, let’s take three steps to the southeast first...”","Huang Yueli lay in Li Moying’s arms, commanding slowly.","Li Moying was of the same mind with her, and he could fulfill every instruction of Huang Yueli’s perfectly, without the slightest mistake.","Huang Yueli was still a little worried, and stared at Li Moying’s feet nervously.","However, after Li Moying took a dozen steps, she was completely relieved.","As soon as her mind relaxed, her body also relaxed.","She adjusted her position in Li Moying’s arms, and leaned comfortably against his muscular chest, the corners of her mouth raised slightly.","She was really lucky to have found a husband like this, he could do everything, and also listened and respected her...","“East... Take off the devil stone on the right, don’t move the one on the left... Then take three steps to the southwest... Alright, here it is...”"]},{"number":3499,"title":"Chapter 3499 - Going to Make A Fortune (4)","paragraphs":["Under Huang Yueli’s command, Li Moying easily removed seven or eight devil stones.","As these devil stones decreased one by one, the evil qi that filled this area gradually became thinner.","Finally, Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli and came to the front of the last devil stone.","He stretched out his hand, about to take off the devil stone...","At this moment, Huang Yueli’s whole body trembled suddenly, her body tensed up in Li Moying’s arms, she raised her hand to grab his sleeve, and sat up.","!!","“Moying, wait a minute!”","Li Moying’s fingers were less than an inch away from the devil stone, but he still stopped in time when he heard Huang Yueli’s voice.","He withdrew his hand and looked at the girl in his arms with a puzzled expression, “Little Li’er, what’s going on? Is there something wrong?”","Huang Yueli didn’t answer his question right away, but turned her head to observe the surrounding environment, her delicate brows were slightly frowned, and she was holding hand formulas in her hands, as if she was calculating something.","Seeing this, Li Moying didn’t make another sound, but just waited quietly.","After a while, Huang Yueli leaned back into his arms and said in a low voice: “There are more than a dozen arrays superimposed around this area, and they are all high-level arrays unique to evil cultivators. The situation is very serious. It’s complicated. I can’t be sure whether all the changes can be deduced. The current situation is different from what I expected at the beginning...”","Li Moying raised her eyebrows, “It’s different? What’s different?”","Huang Yueli said: “To put it simply, there are a total of 18 devil stones from the Sky Devil clan of the Sky Devil top exponents, which together form the array. You have already taken 17 of them, and only one is left. Logically speaking, the rest of the evil qi should have dissipated, and it is almost impossible to feel it. But now, the evil qi has only become a little thinner, and the power is still very strong...”","Li Moying actually felt the same way, but he never said it out loud.","Hearing what Huang Yueli said, a glint flashed by his eyes, but there was not much panic on his face.","“So, what should we do next? Put back the removed devil stone, or...continue to take the last devil stone?”","No matter how the array works, there are actually not many choices before them, nothing more than these two.","Huang Yueli also understood this.","After thinking for a while, she said decisively, “We’ll continue to open the entrance to the secret realm!”","It was obviously unwise for them to get to this point with great difficulty and give up halfway.","Moreover, for such a complex array, once the process of opening the entrance to the secret realm begins, if you want to temporarily stop it, you may be backlashed instead!","Whether it is advancing or retreating, there are still great risks anyway.","Since that’s the case, it’s better to just move on, maybe the situation is not as bad as they imagined!","Li Moying nodded, “Alright, I think so too.”","The two looked at each other, and neither spoke again.","Li Moying immediately took a step forward, stretched out his right hand again, and reached for the last devil stone.","The slender and strong fingers pinched the almost tranparent core, and gently lifted it upwards.","Following Li Moying’s movements, there was a rumbling sound on the ground, accompanied by weak vibrations.","Dust kept flying up from the ground.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying stood too close to the entrance, and they were the first to bear the brunt of it, being choked by the flying dust and ended up coughing."]},{"number":3500,"title":"Chapter 3500 - Going to Make A Fortune (5)","paragraphs":["There was now a cloud of dust in front of their eyes.","They waited until it dissipated a little before they narrowed their eyes and looked forward.","Right before their eyes, a ball of silver light appeared.","This ball of light was not too big, with a diameter of only about two meters. It can’t accommodate three people standing side by side.","However, from the inside of the light sphere, a strange energy was continuously released. This energy was not ordinary heaven and earth profound energy, but it is not purely evil, which makes people feel very uncomfortable.","!!","“This should be the entrance to the secret realm...” Li Moying said in a low voice.","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth and smiled like a little fox, “Finally... finally found the entrance! Luckily nothing happened!”","As she said that, she turned her head and waved to Li Tianyi and the others, “Let’s go in now! This entrance should disappear soon, so everyone hurry up! By the way, you must remember to step on Moying’s footprints, don’t get it wrong!”","The four guards nodded hurriedly and walked towards them quickly.","Holding the girl in her arms, Li Moying stepped into the ball of light.","However, no one expected that at the moment when the figures of Li Moying and Huang Yueli entered the ball of light, a sudden change occurred!","The entire ball of light suddenly became extremely bright, and the overflowing energy escaped outwards, as if it might explode at any time!","At the same time, Huang Yueli let out an exclamation, “Devil stones...these devil stones!!!”","Since she was holding his own little fox in his arms, all the devil stones that Li Moying took down were handed over to Huang Yueli, who kept holding them in her palm.","The moment they entered the ball of light, these devil stones suddenly flew out of her hand at the same time, flying directly towards the ball of light!","And after the ball of light absorbed these devil stones, it became so bright that people couldn’t even open their eyes!","Not only that, a huge coercion radiated from the outside of the light sphere inward, and gradually became stronger and stronger.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli, who were in the center of the light sphere, suddenly felt a pain in their chest, and the pressure doubled!","Li Moying squinted his eyes, and his first move was to protect Huang Yueli into his arms, bearing the powerful pressure in the ball of light for her.","Being embraced tightly by Li Moying, she poked her head out of his arms.","“There is indeed something strange about this entrance...”","Li Moying frowned slightly, “I’ve never encountered such a situation before, the evil cultivator’s abode is indeed evil enough! However, it doesn’t seem to be too dangerous...”","He could feel that the coercion in the sphere of light increased rapidly in a short period of time, but after rising to a certain level, it suddenly stopped and remained at a fixed intensity.","This kind of intensity puts enormous pressure on ordinary Heart Profound Realm cultivators.","However, being a god level genius, it was not too difficult to bear.","Huang Yueli also felt this. With the blink of an eye, she found that the devil stones that flew out of her arms just now did not disappear, but were neatly arranged in a ring around the outside of the ball of light, like a belt , ringing the light sphere in the middle, and at the same time, it was still flashing non-stop.","But outside the sphere of light, Li Tianyi and the others’ complexions changed abruptly, and they all spat out a mouthful of blood!","“This...the evil qi here...”","In the area near the light sphere, the evil qi had become thinner due to the removal of the devil stone, but now, it has become stronger than before!"]}]);
